// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — 捷進全民英檢初級單字書
window.G_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"Human Body, Physical Actions & Health","cards":[{"w":"ankle","p":"n.","d":"the joint between the foot and the lower leg","c":"腳踝","s":"Yesterday afternoon, Peter jumped off the garden wall, but he landed badly and hurt his right ankle, so he could not walk home.","t":"昨天下午彼得跳下花園圍牆，但他著地姿勢不佳並傷到了右腳踝，所以他無法走回家。"},{"w":"bone","p":"n.","d":"any of the hard pieces that make up the skeleton","c":"骨頭","s":"The stray dog looked very hungry and tired, so the kind lady gave him a beef bone to chew on in the yard.","t":"那隻流浪狗看起來非常飢餓且疲累，所以那位好心的女士給了牠一根牛骨頭在院子裡啃咬。"},{"w":"brain","p":"n.","d":"the organ inside the head that controls thought and memory","c":"大腦；智力","s":"Regular physical exercise is good for your health, and reading books can help train your brain to stay active and sharp.","t":"規律的身體運動對健康有益，而閱讀書籍可以幫助訓練你的大腦保持活躍與敏銳。"},{"w":"chin","p":"n.","d":"the bottom part of the face below the mouth","c":"下巴","s":"My little brother fell off his bicycle on the street, and he scraped his chin on the ground, but he did not cry.","t":"我的小弟弟在街上從腳踏車上摔了下來，他的下巴在地上擦傷，但他並沒有哭。"},{"w":"hip","p":"n.","d":"the area on either side of the body below the waist","c":"臀部；髖部","s":"My grandmother slipped on the wet kitchen floor this morning, so my father took her to the hospital to check her left hip.","t":"我的祖母今天早上在濕滑的廚房地板上滑倒，所以我父親帶她去醫院檢查她的左側臀部（髖部）。"},{"w":"beard","p":"n.","d":"the hair that grows on a man's chin and cheeks","c":"鬍鬚","s":"Uncle David decided to grow a thick beard during his winter vacation, but his wife asked him to shave it off yesterday.","t":"大衛叔叔決定在寒假期間留濃密的鬍鬚，但他的妻子昨天要求他將它刮掉。"},{"w":"nail","p":"n.","d":"the hard surface covering the tip of fingers; a metal pin","c":"指甲；釘子","s":"Tom was very nervous before the English speech contest began, so he sat in the corner and kept biting his finger nail.","t":"湯姆在英語演講比賽開始前非常緊張，所以他坐在角落裡一直咬自己的手指甲。"},{"w":"skin","p":"n. / v.","d":"the natural outer layer that covers the body","c":"皮膚；擦破皮","s":"You should put on some sunscreen before going to the beach, or the hot summer sun will easily burn your skin.","t":"你去海灘前應該擦點防曬乳，否則炎熱的夏日陽光很容易曬傷你的皮膚。"},{"w":"tear","p":"v. / n.","d":"to pull paper or cloth into pieces; water from eyes","c":"撕裂；眼淚","s":"Please be very careful when you open the old envelope, and do not tear the letter inside because it is very important.","t":"當你打開那個舊信封時請非常小心，不要撕破裡面的信件，因為它非常重要。"},{"w":"throat","p":"n.","d":"the front passage inside the neck","c":"喉嚨","s":"I caught a bad cold on Monday morning, so I had a sore throat and could not speak loudly in class all day.","t":"我星期一早上得了重感冒，所以我喉嚨痛且一整天在課堂上都無法大聲說話。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"Body Parts, Physical Health & Medical Conditions","cards":[{"w":"thumb","p":"n.","d":"the short, thick first finger on the human hand","c":"拇指","s":"When Emma opened the heavy glass door, her left thumb was caught in the frame, but luckily it was not broken.","t":"當艾瑪推開厚重的玻璃門時，她的左手拇指被門框夾到了，但幸運的是沒有骨折。"},{"w":"toe","p":"n.","d":"any of the five separate parts at the end of each foot","c":"腳趾","s":"Jason accidentally kicked the corner of the wooden table, and he hurt his big toe, so he sat on the sofa in pain.","t":"傑森不小心踢到木桌的角落並傷到了他的大腳趾，所以他痛苦地坐在沙發上。"},{"w":"tongue","p":"n.","d":"the soft organ inside the mouth used for tasting and speaking","c":"舌頭","s":"The spicy noodle soup was still extremely hot, and Kevin burned his tongue badly, so he had to drink a glass of cold water.","t":"那碗辣麵湯依然非常燙，凱文嚴重燙傷了舌頭，所以他不得不喝下一杯冰水。"},{"w":"tummy","p":"n.","d":"the stomach or belly, especially used by or with children","c":"肚子；胃","s":"The little girl ate too many chocolate candies before lunch, so she had a sore tummy and could not finish her meal.","t":"小女孩在午餐前吃了太多巧克力糖，所以她肚子痛且無法吃完正餐。"},{"w":"waist","p":"n.","d":"the narrow middle part of the human body above the hips","c":"腰部","s":"My uncle has exercised every morning for six months, and his waist has become much smaller, so he needs to buy a new belt.","t":"我叔叔連續六個月每天早晨運動，他的腰圍縮小了許多，所以他需要買一條新皮帶。"},{"w":"wrist","p":"n.","d":"the joint between the hand and the lower arm","c":"手腕","s":"David fell off his skateboard on the playground, and he sprained his right wrist when he tried to stop himself from hitting the floor.","t":"大衛在操場上從滑板上摔了下來，當他試圖用手撐地防止摔倒時扭傷了右手腕。"},{"w":"AIDS","p":"n.","d":"a serious disease caused by a virus that harms the immune system","c":"愛滋病","s":"Modern doctors have developed new treatments for AIDS, and many international groups work together to prevent its spread worldwide.","t":"現代醫生已經開發出治療愛滋病的新療法，許多國際組織也攜手合作以防止其在全球蔓延。"},{"w":"cancer","p":"n.","d":"a very serious disease in which abnormal cells grow uncontrollably","c":"癌症","s":"Smoking cigarettes significantly increases the risk of lung cancer, so the government launched an educational campaign across the country.","t":"吸菸會顯著增加罹患肺癌的風險，因此政府在全國展開了一項教育宣導宣傳。"},{"w":"cough","p":"v. / n.","d":"to force air out of the throat with a sudden sound; the illness","c":"咳嗽","s":"The classroom was completely quiet during the exam, but Jerry had a dry cough and tried his best not to disturb others.","t":"考試期間教室裡非常安靜，但傑瑞患有乾咳並竭盡全力不去打擾他人。"},{"w":"death","p":"n.","d":"the end of life; the state of being dead","c":"死亡","s":"The sudden death of the beloved leader deeply shocked the entire nation, and thousands of citizens gathered to pay their respects.","t":"這位敬愛領袖的突然去世深深震驚了全國，數千名市民聚集在一起表達敬意。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"Illnesses, Symptoms & Physical Sensations","cards":[{"w":"deaf","p":"adj.","d":"unable to hear anything or unable to hear well","c":"聾的；重聽的","s":"The elderly musician became completely deaf in his left ear, but he continued to compose touching songs by feeling the piano's vibrations.","t":"這位年長的音樂家左耳完全聾了，但他透過感受鋼琴的振動繼續創作出感人的歌曲。"},{"w":"dizzy","p":"adj.","d":"feeling as if everything is turning around and that you might fall","c":"頭暈的","s":"After riding the fast roller coaster three times in the amusement park, Laura felt very dizzy and had to sit on the bench.","t":"在遊樂園連續坐了三次快速雲霄飛車後，蘿拉感到非常頭暈，不得不坐在長椅上。"},{"w":"dumb","p":"adj.","d":"temporarily unable to speak, or permanently unable to speak; stupid","c":"啞的；說不出話的；愚蠢的","s":"When Mark heard the sudden news that he had won the grand prize, he was struck dumb with shock and could not say a single word.","t":"當馬克聽到自己獲得大獎的突發消息時，他震驚得說不出話來，一個字也說不出來。"},{"w":"fever","p":"n.","d":"a medical condition in which the body temperature is higher than normal","c":"發燒","s":"The little boy developed a high fever of thirty-nine degrees late at night, so his worried parents took him straight to the emergency room.","t":"小男孩在深夜發了三十九度的高燒，擔憂的父母立刻將他直接送往急診室。"},{"w":"flu","p":"n.","d":"an infectious illness like a very bad cold that causes fever and weakness","c":"流行性感冒；流感","s":"Several students in our class caught the flu this week, so the teacher advised everyone to wash hands often and wear masks.","t":"我們班這週有幾位同學得了流行性感冒，所以老師建議大家要勤洗手並戴口罩。"},{"w":"healthy","p":"adj.","d":"strong and well; not sick; good for health","c":"健康的；健壯的","s":"My grandfather eats plenty of fresh vegetables every day and walks two miles, so he remains remarkably healthy at the age of eighty.","t":"我的祖父每天吃大量新鮮蔬菜並步行兩英里，因此他在八十歲高齡依然非常健康。"},{"w":"ill","p":"adj.","d":"not feeling well; suffering from a disease or sickness","c":"生病的；不舒服的","s":"Because our English teacher suddenly fell ill with a severe stomachache yesterday, another teacher had to take over our afternoon class.","t":"因為我們的英文老師昨天突然因嚴重胃痛而生病，另一位老師不得不接替我們下午的課。"},{"w":"pain","p":"n.","d":"the unpleasant physical feeling caused by injury or illness","c":"疼痛；痛苦","s":"After running the full marathon on Sunday morning, Jack experienced severe muscle pain in both legs and could hardly climb the stairs.","t":"週日早晨跑完完整的馬拉松後，傑克的雙腿經歷了嚴重的肌肉疼痛，幾乎無法爬樓梯。"},{"w":"painful","p":"adj.","d":"causing physical pain or mental suffering","c":"令人疼痛的；痛苦的","s":"The deep cut on Robert's right thumb was extremely painful, but the nurse treated it gently with antiseptic cream and a clean bandage.","t":"羅伯特右手大拇指上的深傷口極為令人疼痛，但護士用消毒藥膏和乾淨繃帶溫柔地進行了處理。"},{"w":"pale","p":"adj.","d":"having less color than usual, especially on the face because of illness","c":"蒼白的；灰白的","s":"When the nurse noticed how pale the young patient looked after giving blood, she immediately brought him a cup of warm sweet tea.","t":"當護士注意到那位年輕病人在捐血後臉色多麼蒼白時，她立刻給他端來一杯溫熱的甜茶。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"Recovery, Medical Facilities & Spiritual Concepts","cards":[{"w":"recover","p":"v.","d":"to become healthy or well again after an illness or injury","c":"康復；恢復","s":"After resting quietly at home for two weeks, Samuel began to recover from his chest infection, and he returned to school yesterday.","t":"在家安靜休養兩週後，塞繆爾開始從胸部感染中康復，並於昨天重返學校。"},{"w":"toothache","p":"n.","d":"a sharp or dull pain in or near a tooth","c":"牙痛","s":"Linda suffered from a terrible toothache all night long, so she made an urgent appointment with her dentist early this morning.","t":"琳達整晚飽受劇烈牙痛之苦，所以她今天清晨緊急向牙醫師預約看診。"},{"w":"weight","p":"n.","d":"how heavy someone or something is; heaviness","c":"重量；體重","s":"Because my father wanted to control his body weight, he stopped drinking sugary sodas and started jogging every evening.","t":"因為我父親想要控制自己的體重，他不再喝含糖汽水並開始每天傍晚慢跑。"},{"w":"wound","p":"n. / v.","d":"an injury to the body, especially a cut or tear in the skin","c":"傷口；傷害","s":"The soldier received a deep bullet wound on his right arm during the battle, but field doctors bandaged it quickly.","t":"那名士兵在戰鬥中右臂受了嚴重的子彈傷口，但戰地醫生迅速為他進行了包紮。"},{"w":"ambulance","p":"n.","d":"a special vehicle used for taking sick or injured people to hospital","c":"救護車","s":"When the serious highway crash occurred, the police arrived immediately and called an ambulance to transport the injured driver.","t":"當這起嚴重的公路車禍發生時，警方立即趕到現場並呼叫救護車運送受傷的司機。"},{"w":"patient","p":"n. / adj.","d":"a person receiving medical care; able to wait calmly","c":"病人；有耐心的","s":"The elderly doctor was very gentle and patient with every young child who visited the hospital clinic.","t":"那位年邁的醫生對每一位來到醫院診所的小朋友都非常溫柔且有耐心。"},{"w":"homesick","p":"adj.","d":"sad because you are away from home and miss your family","c":"想家的；思鄉的","s":"During her first semester studying abroad in London, Emily felt deeply homesick whenever she looked at family photographs.","t":"在倫敦留學的第一個學期裡，每當艾瑪看著家庭照片時，都感到深深的想家。"},{"w":"drugstore","p":"n.","d":"a shop where you can buy medicines, makeup, and daily items","c":"藥局；藥妝店","s":"Grandma asked me to walk over to the corner drugstore to pick up her blood pressure pills and some cotton pads.","t":"祖母叫我走到街角的藥局去幫她拿降血壓藥和一些化妝棉。"},{"w":"ghost","p":"n.","d":"the spirit of a dead person that some people believe can appear","c":"鬼魂；幽靈","s":"The children refused to enter the abandoned wooden mansion because an ancient legend claimed that a mysterious ghost lived inside.","t":"孩子們拒絕進入那座廢棄的木製豪宅，因為一個古老的傳說聲稱裡面住著一個神秘的鬼魂。"},{"w":"god","p":"n.","d":"a superhuman being worshipped as having power over nature or human fortunes","c":"神；上帝","s":"The fishermen gathered at the coastal temple to pray to their god for safe voyages and calm seas ahead.","t":"漁民們聚集在沿海的廟宇，向他們的神祈求航行平安與未來海面平靜。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"People, Manners & Human Spirit","cards":[{"w":"praise","p":"v. / n.","d":"to express strong approval or admiration for someone","c":"稱讚；讚美","s":"The principal gathered the whole school to praise the brave students who rescued an elderly neighbor from the flooded house.","t":"校長召集了全校師生，稱讚那些從淹水房屋中救出年邁鄰居的英勇學生。"},{"w":"pray","p":"v.","d":"to speak to God or a saint in order to give thanks or ask for help","c":"祈禱；祈求","s":"Every night before going to sleep, the little boy kneels beside his bed to pray for his family's continued good health.","t":"每晚就寢前，小男孩都會跪在床邊祈禱他的家人能夠持續保持身體健康。"},{"w":"spirit","p":"n.","d":"the non-physical part of a person; mood; courage and enthusiasm","c":"精神；靈魂；士氣","s":"Although our soccer team lost the final championship match, our coach admired the fighting spirit that every player showed.","t":"雖然我們的足球隊在最後的冠軍爭奪賽中落敗，但教練十分讚賞每位球員所展現的戰鬥精神。"},{"w":"male","p":"adj. / n.","d":"belonging to the sex that does not give birth to young","c":"男性的；雄性的","s":"In most bird species, the male bird displays brightly colored feathers to attract female partners during spring.","t":"在大多數鳥類物種中，雄鳥在春季會展現出色彩斑斕的羽毛以吸引雌性伴侶。"},{"w":"adult","p":"n. / adj.","d":"a person who is fully grown or legally mature","c":"成年人；成熟的","s":"Children under the age of twelve are not permitted to enter the swimming pool unless accompanied by an adult.","t":"十二歲以下的兒童除非有成年人陪同，否則不允許進入該游泳池。"},{"w":"elder","p":"adj. / n.","d":"born earlier; senior; older person in a family or tribe","c":"年長的；長者","s":"Traditional Taiwanese culture teaches children to show high respect and courtesy toward their family elder.","t":"台灣傳統文化教育孩子們要對家庭中的年長長輩表達崇高的尊敬與禮貌。"},{"w":"youth","p":"n.","d":"the period between childhood and adult age; young people","c":"青年時期；青春；年輕人","s":"In his youth, my grandfather worked on a merchant ship and traveled to more than twenty different countries.","t":"在他年輕的時候，我的祖父曾在一艘商船上工作，並到過二十多個不同的國家旅行。"},{"w":"guy","p":"n.","d":"a man or boy; an informal word for an individual person","c":"傢伙；人；男士","s":"Mark is a really friendly and generous guy, and he always volunteers to help his classmates with difficult math homework.","t":"馬克真是一個非常友善且慷慨的傢伙，他總是自願幫助同學解答困難的數學作業。"},{"w":"lady","p":"n.","d":"a polite or formal way of referring to a woman","c":"女士；淑女","s":"The polite young gentleman immediately stood up on the crowded subway train to offer his seat to an elderly lady.","t":"那位有禮貌的年輕紳士立即在擁擠的捷運列車上站起身來，將座位讓給一位年長的女士。"},{"w":"ma'am","p":"n.","d":"a polite way of addressing a woman, especially in formal service","c":"女士；夫人（尊稱）","s":"The flight attendant smiled warmly and asked, 'May I bring you another cup of hot green tea, ma'am?'","t":"空服員溫暖地微笑著問道：「女士，我能再為您拿一杯熱綠茶嗎？」"}]},{"unit":6,"theme":"Family Relations, Social Roles & Guests","cards":[{"w":"granddaughter","p":"n.","d":"a daughter of your son or daughter","c":"孫女；外孫女","s":"The elderly lady smiled happily as her little granddaughter ran into her arms and handed her a handmade birthday card.","t":"當小孫女跑進那位年長女士的懷裡並遞給她一張手工生日卡片時，她幸福地微笑著。"},{"w":"grandson","p":"n.","d":"a son of your son or daughter","c":"孫子；外孫","s":"Mr. Watson took his energetic ten-year-old grandson to the baseball park, and they caught a foul ball in the third inning.","t":"華生先生帶著他精力充沛的十歲孫子去棒球場，他們在第三局接到了一顆界外球。"},{"w":"nephew","p":"n.","d":"a son of your brother or sister","c":"姪子；外甥","s":"Aunt Catherine bought a remote-controlled helicopter for her favorite nephew, and they flew it together in the garden.","t":"凱薩琳姑姑為她最喜歡的姪子買了一架遙控直升機，他們一起在花園裡放飛它。"},{"w":"niece","p":"n.","d":"a daughter of your brother or sister","c":"姪女；外甥女","s":"Uncle David was extremely proud when his smart niece graduated from medical school with top honors last month.","t":"上個月，當大衛叔叔聰穎的姪女以優異的成績從醫學院畢業時，他感到無比自豪。"},{"w":"relative","p":"n. / adj.","d":"a person connected by blood or marriage; comparative","c":"親戚；親屬","s":"During the Lunar New Year holidays, dozens of distant relatives gather at our ancestral home to share a festive reunion dinner.","t":"在農曆新年假期期間，數十位遠房親戚聚集在我們祖厝，共同享用豐盛的團圓晚餐。"},{"w":"couple","p":"n.","d":"two people who are married or in a romantic relationship; a small number","c":"夫妻；情侶；一對","s":"The newly married young couple rented a cozy apartment near the park, and they spent weekends decorating their living room.","t":"這對新婚的年輕夫婦在公園附近租了一間溫馨的公寓，他們利用週末時間裝飾客廳。"},{"w":"guest","p":"n.","d":"a person invited to visit someone's home or attend an event","c":"客人；賓客","s":"The hotel staff prepared fresh flowers and fruit baskets to welcome every VIP guest attending the international conference.","t":"飯店員工準備了鮮花和水果籃，以歡迎出席這次國際會議的每一位貴賓。"},{"w":"host","p":"n. / v.","d":"a person who receives or entertains guests; to organize an event","c":"主人；主辦；主持","s":"The gracious host welcomed each visitor at the front door with a warm smile and served hot tea in the parlor.","t":"親切的主人在前門帶著溫暖的微笑迎接每位訪客，並在客廳裡為大家奉上熱茶。"},{"w":"member","p":"n.","d":"a person or animal belonging to a group, club, or society","c":"成員；會員","s":"Because Samuel has been an active member of the science club for three years, he was elected team leader for the competition.","t":"因為塞繆爾連續三年擔任科學社團的活躍成員，他被推選為本次競賽的隊長。"},{"w":"visitor","p":"n.","d":"a person who visits someone or somewhere for a short time","c":"參觀者；訪客","s":"Museum guides kindly reminded each foreign visitor not to take photos using flash inside the ancient Egyptian exhibition hall.","t":"博物館導覽員親切地提醒每一位外國參觀者，在古埃及展覽廳內不得使用閃光燈拍照。"}]},{"unit":7,"theme":"Holidays, Cultural Festivals & Celebrations","cards":[{"w":"Double Tenth Day","p":"n.phr.","d":"the national day of the Republic of China (Taiwan) celebrated on October 10","c":"雙十節；國慶日","s":"Thousands of citizens gathered in front of the Presidential Office Building on Double Tenth Day to watch the military parade and air show.","t":"數千名市民在雙十節聚集在總統府前，觀看盛大的閱兵典禮與飛行特技表演。"},{"w":"Dragon Boat Festival","p":"n.phr.","d":"a traditional Chinese holiday when people race dragon boats and eat rice dumplings","c":"端午節","s":"Every summer during the Dragon Boat Festival, our family eats delicious sticky rice dumplings and watches exciting boat races on the river.","t":"每年夏天的端午節期間，我們全家人都會吃美味的糯米粽子，並在河畔觀看精彩刺激的划龍舟比賽。"},{"w":"Easter","p":"n.","d":"a Christian festival celebrating the resurrection of Jesus, marked by decorated eggs","c":"復活節","s":"Children ran excitedly around the church lawn on Easter Sunday morning searching for colorful chocolate eggs hidden in the bushes.","t":"在復活節週日早晨，孩子們興奮地在教堂草坪四周奔跑，尋找藏在灌木叢中的彩色巧克力蛋。"},{"w":"Halloween","p":"n.","d":"the night of October 31 when children wear costumes and go trick-or-treating","c":"萬聖節前夕","s":"Young kids dressed up as friendly ghosts and superheroes on Halloween, walking from house to house shouting 'trick or treat' for candy.","t":"年幼的孩子們在萬聖節前夕裝扮成友好的鬼魂和超級英雄，挨家挨戶走著並大喊「不給糖就搗蛋」以討取糖果。"},{"w":"Lantern Festival","p":"n.phr.","d":"a Chinese festival celebrated on the 15th day of the first lunar month","c":"元宵節","s":"People across Taiwan solve tricky riddles and admire magnificent glowing light displays during the annual Lantern Festival in February.","t":"每年二月的元宵節期間，全台灣各地的人們都會猜有趣的燈謎，並欣賞壯麗璀璨的發光花燈展覽。"},{"w":"Mother's Day","p":"n.phr.","d":"a day honoring mothers, celebrated on the second Sunday of May","c":"母親節","s":"Kevin and his sister prepared breakfast in bed and bought pink carnations to celebrate Mother's Day with their loving mom.","t":"凱文和他的妹妹準備了床上早餐並買了粉紅康乃馨，與他們深愛的母親一同慶祝母親節。"},{"w":"Teacher's Day","p":"n.phr.","d":"a day honoring teachers, celebrated in Taiwan on September 28","c":"教師節","s":"Students across Taiwan write heartfelt greeting cards and present flowers to thank their dedicated educators on Teacher's Day.","t":"全台灣的學生都會在教師節這一天寫下由衷的感謝賀卡並奉上鮮花，向盡職盡責的教育工作者表達感謝。"},{"w":"Thanksgiving Day","p":"n.phr.","d":"a North American holiday of giving thanks, celebrated with a roast turkey dinner","c":"感恩節","s":"American families reunite around the dining table on Thanksgiving Day to enjoy roast turkey, cranberry sauce, and sweet pumpkin pie.","t":"美國家庭會在感恩節這一天團聚在餐桌旁，一同享用烤火雞、蔓越莓醬和香甜南瓜派。"},{"w":"Valentine's Day","p":"n.phr.","d":"February 14, celebrated by sending cards and gifts to sweethearts","c":"情人節","s":"Florists and chocolate shops are packed with excited customers buying romantic red roses and gift boxes on Valentine's Day.","t":"在情人節這一天，花店和巧克力店擠滿了興奮的顧客，爭相購買浪漫的紅玫瑰與精緻禮物盒。"},{"w":"wedding","p":"n.","d":"a marriage ceremony, especially considered as including the associated celebrations","c":"婚禮；結婚典禮","s":"The bride looked breathtaking in her lace gown, and more than two hundred guests attended the outdoor church wedding.","t":"新娘穿著蕾絲禮服顯得光彩照人，超過兩百位賓客出席了這場戶外教堂婚禮。"}]},{"unit":8,"theme":"Vegetables, Grains & Common Produce","cards":[{"w":"bean","p":"n.","d":"an edible seed or pod of certain plants, especially used for food","c":"豆莢；豆子","s":"Mom cooked a pot of hearty beef stew with green bean and potatoes, so our whole family enjoyed a warm dinner.","t":"媽媽用四季豆和馬鈴薯燉煮了一鍋熱氣騰騰的牛肉煲，所以我們全家人享受了一頓溫暖的晚餐。"},{"w":"cabbage","p":"n.","d":"a large round vegetable with thick green or purple leaves","c":"高麗菜；包心菜","s":"The chef chopped fresh green cabbage finely to make crispy vegetable dumplings and spicy pickled side dishes.","t":"主廚將新鮮翠綠的高麗菜切得碎碎的，以製作香脆蔬菜水餃與香辣醃漬小菜。"},{"w":"carrot","p":"n.","d":"a long, thin, orange vegetable that grows underground","c":"胡蘿蔔","s":"The little girl fed a sweet, crunchy carrot to the hungry white rabbit in the kindergarten pet corner.","t":"小女孩在幼兒園的寵物角落，將一根香甜酥脆的胡蘿蔔餵給飢餓的白兔。"},{"w":"cereal","p":"n.","d":"a grain used for food, such as wheat or oats, often eaten with milk","c":"穀類食品；麥片","s":"Every morning before heading to school, Jason pours cold milk over a bowl of crunchy whole-grain cereal.","t":"每天早晨上學前，傑森都會將冰牛奶倒進一碗香脆的全穀麥片中。"},{"w":"corn","p":"n.","d":"a tall plant that produces yellow grains on large ears","c":"玉米","s":"Night market vendors grill sweet yellow corn over charcoal and brush it with savory soy sauce for tourists.","t":"夜市攤販在炭火上碳烤香甜的黃玉米，並為遊客刷上鹹香的醬油醬汁。"},{"w":"grape","p":"n.","d":"a small round green or purple fruit that grows in bunches","c":"葡萄","s":"The French farmer harvested thousands of ripe purple grapes from the vineyard to produce award-winning wine.","t":"法國農夫從葡萄園裡採收了數千顆成熟的紫葡萄，以釀造屢獲殊榮的葡萄酒。"},{"w":"guava","p":"n.","d":"a tropical fruit with green skin, sweet pink or white flesh, and seeds","c":"芭樂；番石榴","s":"Taiwanese farmers grow delicious crisp guava in Changhua, and locals love to sprinkle plum powder over sliced pieces.","t":"台灣農民在彰化種植香脆可口的芭樂，當地人非常喜歡在切片上撒上甘梅粉食用。"},{"w":"lettuce","p":"n.","d":"a leafy green vegetable used especially in raw salads or burgers","c":"萵苣；生菜","s":"The waiter layered crisp green lettuce and ripe red tomatoes between the toasted bread to make a club sandwich.","t":"服務生在烘烤過的吐司之間夾入清脆綠萵苣與熟透紅番茄，製作了一份總匯三明治。"},{"w":"mango","p":"n.","d":"a tropical fruit with smooth yellow-red skin and sweet juicy yellow flesh","c":"芒果","s":"During hot summer afternoons, tourists line up outside dessert shops in Tainan to order shaved ice topped with fresh mango.","t":"在炎熱的夏日午後，遊客們在台南的甜品店外排隊，點選鋪滿新鮮芒果的芒果刨冰。"},{"w":"onion","p":"n.","d":"a round vegetable with many layers that has a strong smell and taste","c":"洋蔥","s":"When Samuel chopped the pungent white onion on the cutting board, his eyes watered so much that he had to wipe them.","t":"當塞繆爾在砧板上切嗆辣的白洋蔥時，他的眼睛流淚不止，不得不頻頻擦拭。"}]},{"unit":9,"theme":"Fruits, Gourds & Dairy Condiments","cards":[{"w":"papaya","p":"n.","d":"a tropical fruit with orange flesh and small black seeds","c":"木瓜","s":"The juice shop blenders were running nonstop as customers ordered thick, sweet papaya milk throughout the warm afternoon.","t":"果汁店的果汁機運轉不停，因為整個溫暖午後顧客們不斷點選濃郁香甜的木瓜牛奶。"},{"w":"peach","p":"n.","d":"a soft round fruit with pink-yellow fuzzy skin and a large stone","c":"桃子；水蜜桃","s":"Lala Mountain in Taoyuan is famous for growing sweet, juicy peach that tourists love to buy during summer.","t":"桃園拉拉山以種植香甜多汁的水蜜桃聞名，遊客們非常喜歡在夏天購買品嚐。"},{"w":"pear","p":"n.","d":"a sweet fruit that is narrow near the stem and rounded at the bottom","c":"梨子","s":"Grandfather sliced a crisp, watery Asian pear into pieces and shared it with the children after dinner.","t":"晚飯後，祖父將一顆清脆多汁的亞洲水梨切成片，與孩子們一同分享。"},{"w":"pineapple","p":"n.","d":"a large tropical fruit with stiff leaves and sweet, yellow flesh","c":"鳳梨","s":"Tourists visiting Taiwan always buy several boxes of traditional pineapple cakes to take home as souvenirs for friends.","t":"造訪台灣的遊客總會買好幾盒傳統鳳梨酥帶回家，作為送給親友的伴手禮。"},{"w":"potato","p":"n.","d":"a round root vegetable with brown or yellow skin that grows underground","c":"馬鈴薯；洋芋","s":"The chef mashed boiled potato with fresh butter and warm milk to serve beside the roasted beef.","t":"大廚將煮熟的馬鈴薯與新鮮奶油及溫牛奶壓成泥，搭配烤牛肉端上桌。"},{"w":"pumpkin","p":"n.","d":"a large round orange vegetable often used for pies or soups","c":"南瓜","s":"During autumn festivals, farmers display giant orange pumpkin and bake creamy pies flavored with cinnamon and nutmeg.","t":"秋季節日期間，農夫們展示巨大的橘色南瓜，並烘烤帶有肉桂與肉荳蔻風味的香濃南瓜派。"},{"w":"strawberry","p":"n.","d":"a small soft red fruit with tiny yellow seeds on its surface","c":"草莓","s":"Families enjoyed picking sweet red strawberry in the scenic mountain farms of Dahu on a sunny winter morning.","t":"在一個陽光明媚的冬日早晨，各個家庭在大湖風景秀麗的高山農場開心地採摘香甜紅草莓。"},{"w":"tangerine","p":"n.","d":"a small sweet citrus fruit with loose, easily peeled skin","c":"柑橘；小柑橘","s":"During Lunar New Year, people place bright orange tangerine on tables because their shape symbolizes good luck and wealth.","t":"農曆新年期間，人們會在桌上擺放鮮豔的橘子，因為其形狀與名稱象徵著吉祥與財富。"},{"w":"watermelon","p":"n.","d":"a large heavy fruit with thick green skin and sweet red flesh with seeds","c":"西瓜","s":"Nothing cools you down on a sweltering July afternoon like a huge, chilled slice of sweet red watermelon.","t":"在七月酷熱的午後，沒有什麼比一大片冰涼香甜的紅肉西瓜更能讓人消暑解渴了。"},{"w":"cream","p":"n.","d":"the thick white liquid containing fat taken from milk","c":"鮮奶油；奶油","s":"The pastry baker topped the freshly baked chocolate tart with a swirl of fluffy whipped cream and berries.","t":"糕點師傅在剛出爐的巧克力塔上擠上一圈蓬鬆細緻的打發鮮奶油和新鮮莓果。"}]},{"unit":10,"theme":"Baking, Staples & Traditional Dishes","cards":[{"w":"bake","p":"v.","d":"to cook food such as bread, cakes, or pies in an oven","c":"烘烤；烘焙","s":"On Sunday mornings, grandma loves to bake sweet cinnamon rolls in the oven until their aroma fills the entire house.","t":"在星期天早晨，祖母喜歡在烤箱裡烘烤香甜肉桂捲，直到香氣瀰漫整座屋子。"},{"w":"bun","p":"n.","d":"a small round sweet bread roll, or bread containing meat/vegetables","c":"小麵包；小圓包","s":"The hungry student bought a warm steamed pork bun from the convenience store and ate it quickly on the train.","t":"飢餓的學生從便利商店買了一個熱騰騰的蒸肉包，並在火車上快速吃完。"},{"w":"dessert","p":"n.","d":"sweet food eaten at the end of a meal","c":"甜點；甜食","s":"After finishing our savory Italian pasta dinner, we ordered tiramisu and chocolate cake for dessert.","t":"在享用完美味的義大利麵晚餐後，我們點了提拉米蘇和巧克力蛋糕作為餐後甜點。"},{"w":"donut","p":"n.","d":"a small fried cake of sweetened dough, usually shaped like a ring","c":"甜甜圈","s":"Oliver bought a box of colorful glazed donuts with rainbow sprinkles to share with his colleagues at the office.","t":"奧利佛買了一盒帶有彩虹糖碎的鮮豔糖霜甜甜圈，在辦公室與同事們一同分享。"},{"w":"dumpling","p":"n.","d":"a small piece of dough wrapped around minced meat or vegetables","c":"水餃；餃子","s":"During Chinese New Year celebrations, our entire family sits around the table wrapping hundreds of pork dumplings.","t":"在農曆新年慶祝活動期間，我們全家人圍坐在桌旁包著數百顆香蔥豬肉水餃。"},{"w":"flour","p":"n.","d":"powder obtained by grinding grain, used to make bread, cakes, and pastry","c":"麵粉","s":"Before mixing the birthday cake batter, the baker sifted white wheat flour through a fine metal sieve.","t":"在攪拌生日蛋糕麵糊之前，烘焙師用細金屬篩網將白色小麥麵粉過篩。"},{"w":"loaf","p":"n.","d":"bread shaped and baked in one piece (plural: loaves)","c":"一條（麵包）","s":"Dad walked over to the neighborhood bakery and purchased a warm, freshly baked loaf of whole-wheat bread.","t":"爸爸步行到附近的麵包店，購買了一條剛出爐溫熱的全麥土司麵包。"},{"w":"spaghetti","p":"n.","d":"pasta made in long, thin, solid strings, boiled and served with sauce","c":"義大利麵","s":"Mom cooked delicious homemade spaghetti topped with rich tomato beef sauce and sprinkled with parmesan cheese.","t":"媽媽烹煮了美味的自製義大利細麵，淋上濃郁的番茄牛肉肉醬，並撒上帕瑪森起司粉。"},{"w":"toast","p":"n. / v.","d":"sliced bread made brown and crisp by heating; a drink to honor someone","c":"烤土司；吐司；祝酒","s":"For breakfast, Kevin usually spreads sweet strawberry jam over two slices of crunchy golden toast.","t":"早餐時，凱文通常會在兩片香脆的金黃烤土司上抹上香甜的草莓果醬。"},{"w":"tofu","p":"n.","d":"a soft white food made from mashed soybeans, used in Asian cooking","c":"豆腐","s":"Taiwanese night markets are world-famous for serving deep-fried stinky tofu accompanied by sour pickled cabbage.","t":"台灣夜市以供應油炸臭豆腐聞名全球，通常會搭配酸脆的醃漬泡菜一同享用。"}]},{"unit":11,"theme":"Beverages, Condiments & Seasonings","cards":[{"w":"beer","p":"n.","d":"an alcoholic drink made from grain and hops","c":"啤酒","s":"My father worked hard in the garden all Saturday afternoon, so he drank a cold glass of beer with dinner.","t":"我父親星期六整個下午都在花園裡辛勞工作，所以他晚餐時喝了一杯冰涼的啤酒。"},{"w":"soda","p":"n.","d":"a sweet, cold carbonated soft drink","c":"汽水；碳酸飲料","s":"The children played soccer under the burning hot sun, and they bought two large cans of cold soda at the convenience store.","t":"孩子們在炎熱的烈日下踢足球，他們在便利商店買了兩大罐冰涼的汽水。"},{"w":"honey","p":"n.","d":"a sweet, sticky yellow liquid made by bees","c":"蜂蜜","s":"Grandmother had a dry cough during the cold winter night, so my mother made her warm lemon tea with natural honey.","t":"祖母在寒冷的冬夜裡乾咳，所以我母親用天然蜂蜜為她泡了一杯溫熱的檸檬茶。"},{"w":"ketchup","p":"n.","d":"a thick red sauce made from tomatoes, vinegar, and sugar","c":"番茄醬","s":"The French fries tasted a little plain without seasoning, so David squeezed some tomato ketchup on his plate to dip them.","t":"炸薯條沒有調味料時味道有點淡，所以戴維在盤子裡擠了一些番茄醬來沾薯條。"},{"w":"pepper","p":"n.","d":"a sharp-tasting black or white powder made from dried berries","c":"胡椒粉","s":"The beef soup was very warm and rich, but my brother added a little black pepper to give it an extra spicy flavor.","t":"牛肉湯非常溫暖濃郁，但我哥哥加了一點黑胡椒粉以增添額外的辛香風味。"},{"w":"soy sauce","p":"n.phr.","d":"a dark, salty liquid made from fermented soybeans","c":"醬油","s":"My aunt fried a large plate of pork dumplings for lunch, and we mixed some dark soy sauce with vinegar for dipping.","t":"我姑姑午餐時煎了一大盤豬肉餃子，我們混合了一些深色醬油和醋當作沾醬。"},{"w":"sugar","p":"n.","d":"a sweet white substance obtained from plants","c":"糖","s":"The black coffee was too bitter for Mary to finish, so she added two small spoons of white sugar into the cup.","t":"黑咖啡太苦了讓瑪麗喝不完，所以她在杯子裡加了兩小匙白糖。"},{"w":"vinegar","p":"n.","d":"a sour liquid made from fermented wine, cider, or rice","c":"醋","s":"The cook chopped some fresh cabbage and carrots finely, and he poured a spoonful of apple vinegar over the salad.","t":"廚師把新鮮的高麗菜和紅蘿蔔切得很細，並在沙拉上淋了一匙蘋果醋。"},{"w":"delicious","p":"adj.","d":"having a very pleasant and enjoyable taste or smell","c":"美味的；可口的","s":"Mrs. Lin baked an apple pie following her secret recipe, and everyone at the dinner table agreed that it was truly delicious.","t":"林太太依照她的私房食譜烤了一個蘋果派，餐桌上的每個人都一致認為它非常美味。"},{"w":"yummy","p":"adj.","d":"tasting very good (often used informally)","c":"好吃的；美味的（口語）","s":"The bakery on the corner sells chocolate muffins every morning, and the little girl said they were the most yummy treats she ever had.","t":"轉角的麵包店每天早上都賣巧克力馬芬蛋糕，小女孩說那是她吃過最好吃的點心。"}]},{"unit":12,"theme":"Dining Out, Kitchen Utensils & Cooking","cards":[{"w":"brunch","p":"n.","d":"a meal eaten late in the morning that combines breakfast and lunch","c":"早午餐","s":"On Sunday mornings, our family likes to sleep late and go to a cozy cafe for brunch.","t":"在星期天早晨，我們全家喜歡睡到自然醒，然後去一家溫馨的咖啡館享用早午餐。"},{"w":"cafeteria","p":"n.","d":"a restaurant where customers collect food on trays and pay at a register","c":"自助餐廳；學校/公司員工餐廳","s":"High school students lined up with their plastic trays in the school cafeteria to buy hot noodles.","t":"高中生們端著塑膠托盤在學校員工餐廳（自助餐廳）排隊購買熱麵。"},{"w":"buffet","p":"n.","d":"a meal where people serve themselves from a table of different dishes","c":"歐式自助餐；吃到飽餐飲","s":"The luxury hotel offered an amazing seafood buffet with fresh crabs, prawns, and grilled fish.","t":"這家豪華飯店提供了令人驚嘆的海鮮自助餐，備有新鮮螃蟹、明蝦與烤魚。"},{"w":"pan","p":"n.","d":"a wide, shallow metal container used for frying or cooking food","c":"平底鍋","s":"Mother heated some olive oil in the frying pan before adding the diced garlic and onions.","t":"母親在平底鍋裡加熱了一些橄欖油，然後加入切碎的大蒜與洋蔥。"},{"w":"plate","p":"n.","d":"a flat, usually round dish from which food is eaten","c":"盤子","s":"The waiter carried a large white ceramic plate with grilled steak and roasted vegetables.","t":"服務生端著一個裝有烤牛排和烤蔬菜的白色大陶瓷盤子。"},{"w":"pot","p":"n.","d":"a deep round container used for cooking stews, soups, or boiling water","c":"深鍋；湯鍋","s":"Father placed a heavy metal pot of vegetable soup on the kitchen counter to cool.","t":"父親將一重金屬蔬菜湯鍋放在廚房流理台上使其冷卻。"},{"w":"saucer","p":"n.","d":"a small, shallow curved dish placed under a teacup","c":"茶碟；茶托","s":"The graceful lady picked up the delicate teacup and rested it gently on its matching saucer.","t":"那位優雅的女士端起精緻的茶杯，並將它輕輕放在配套的茶碟上。"},{"w":"teapot","p":"n.","d":"a container with a handle and spout used for making and serving tea","c":"茶壺","s":"Grandpa poured steaming oolong tea from the purple clay teapot into our tiny porcelain cups.","t":"爺爺從紫砂茶壺中倒出熱氣騰騰的烏龍茶到我們的細瓷小杯子裡。"},{"w":"wok","p":"n.","d":"a large, bowl-shaped pan used especially in Chinese cooking","c":"炒鍋；中華炒鍋","s":"The experienced chef stirred the sliced beef rapidly inside the hot iron wok over high heat.","t":"經驗豐富的主廚在大火上的熱鐵炒鍋內迅速翻炒牛肉片。"},{"w":"boil","p":"v.","d":"to heat a liquid until bubbles rise to the surface","c":"煮沸；水滾","s":"You should let the clean water boil completely before using it to prepare baby formula.","t":"你在用乾淨的水沖泡嬰兒奶粉之前，應該讓水完全煮沸。"}]},{"unit":13,"theme":"Clothing, Formal Attire & Accessories","cards":[{"w":"blouse","p":"n.","d":"a woman's shirt or upper garment","c":"女性襯衫；罩衫","s":"Helen wore a lightweight silk blouse with dark blue trousers to her job interview yesterday morning.","t":"海倫昨天早上穿著一件輕盈的絲質女性襯衫搭配深藍色長褲去參加求職面試。"},{"w":"pajamas","p":"n.","d":"soft loose clothing worn in bed","c":"睡衣褲","s":"The little boy brushed his teeth, put on his warm cotton pajamas, and climbed into bed with a storybook.","t":"小男孩刷了牙，穿上他溫暖的純棉睡衣褲，拿著故事書爬上了床。"},{"w":"suit","p":"n. / v.","d":"a jacket and matching trousers or skirt; to fit well","c":"套裝；西裝；適合","s":"Mr. Anderson bought an elegant black suit for the annual corporate dinner, and it fit him perfectly.","t":"安德森先生為年度公司晚宴買了一套優雅的黑色西裝，而且穿在他身上非常合身。"},{"w":"trousers","p":"n.","d":"a piece of clothing covering the body from waist to ankle on each leg","c":"長褲","s":"My brother spilled tomato soup on his khaki trousers, so he had to wash them before going to class.","t":"我哥哥把番茄湯灑在他的卡其長褲上，所以他去上課前必須先把褲子洗乾淨。"},{"w":"T-shirt","p":"n.","d":"a simple short-sleeved cotton casual shirt with no collar","c":"短袖圓領汗衫；T恤","s":"During the humid summer months, teenagers prefer wearing a loose white T-shirt with casual shorts.","t":"在潮濕的夏季月份裡，青少年更喜歡穿著寬鬆的白色T恤搭配休閒短褲。"},{"w":"underwear","p":"n.","d":"clothes worn under other clothes next to the skin","c":"內衣褲","s":"Packing clean socks and underwear is essential whenever you plan a three-day hiking trip in the mountains.","t":"每當你計畫去山裡進行為期三天的健行旅行時，打包乾淨的襪子和內衣褲是必不可少的。"},{"w":"vest","p":"n.","d":"a sleeveless upper garment worn over a shirt","c":"背心","s":"The police officer wore a bulletproof vest under his uniform to protect himself while on night patrol.","t":"警官在制服底下穿了一件防彈背心，以便在夜間巡邏時保護自己。"},{"w":"scarf","p":"n.","d":"a length of fabric worn around the neck for warmth or style","c":"圍巾","s":"Cold northern winds blew across the city streets, so Jessica wrapped a wool scarf securely around her neck.","t":"冰冷的北風吹過城市街道，所以潔西卡把一條羊毛圍巾緊緊圍在脖子上。"},{"w":"tie","p":"n. / v.","d":"a narrow strip of material worn around the neck; to bind","c":"領帶；繫；綁","s":"The young salesman learned how to fasten his silk tie neatly before meeting important clients.","t":"這位年輕業務員在拜訪重要客戶之前，學會了如何把他的絲質領帶繫得整整齊齊。"},{"w":"necklace","p":"n.","d":"an ornamental chain or string of beads worn around the neck","c":"項鍊","s":"On their twentieth wedding anniversary, my father surprised my mother with an expensive pearl necklace.","t":"在他們結婚二十週年紀念日，我父親送給我母親一條昂貴的珍珠項鍊作為驚喜。"}]},{"unit":14,"theme":"Footwear, Personal Accessories & Precious Metals","cards":[{"w":"slippers","p":"n.","d":"comfortable loose soft shoes worn indoors","c":"室內拖鞋","s":"When guests enter our home, mother kindly offers them a clean pair of cotton slippers to wear.","t":"當客人走進我們家時，母親會親切地提供他們一雙乾淨的室內純棉拖鞋穿著。"},{"w":"sneakers","p":"n.","d":"soft sports shoes suitable for casual wear and athletics","c":"運動鞋；球鞋","s":"Mark laced up his lightweight running sneakers before heading down to the school athletic track.","t":"馬克在前往學校田徑場之前，繫緊了他輕便慢跑運動鞋的鞋帶。"},{"w":"socks","p":"n.","d":"soft knitted coverings for the feet worn inside shoes","c":"短襪","s":"You should wear thick cotton socks when hiking in the mountains to prevent blisters on your feet.","t":"在山區健行時，你應該穿著厚棉短襪以防止腳上起水泡。"},{"w":"handkerchief","p":"n.","d":"a small square piece of cloth used for wiping the nose or face","c":"手帕","s":"The gentle old man took a clean white handkerchief from his pocket and wiped the tears from his eyes.","t":"那位溫和的老先生從口袋裡拿出一條乾淨的白色手帕，擦乾了他眼中的淚水。"},{"w":"purse","p":"n.","d":"a small bag used especially by women for holding coins, money, and makeup","c":"女用手提包；小錢包","s":"While riding the crowded subway train, Brenda kept a firm grip on her leather purse.","t":"在搭乘擁擠的地鐵列車時，布蘭達緊緊抓著她的皮質女用手提包。"},{"w":"wallet","p":"n.","d":"a flat folding pocketbook used especially by men for holding paper money and cards","c":"皮夾；短夾","s":"After paying for the groceries at the counter, dad put his credit card back into his brown leather wallet.","t":"在櫃檯付完雜貨費用後，爸爸把信用卡放回他棕色的皮革短夾裡。"},{"w":"diamond","p":"n.","d":"an extremely hard, precious clear gemstone made of pure carbon","c":"鑽石","s":"The romantic gentleman knelt down in the restaurant and offered his girlfriend a sparkling diamond ring.","t":"那位浪漫的紳士在餐廳裡單膝跪地，向他的女友獻上一枚閃閃發光的鑽石戒指。"},{"w":"gold","p":"n.","d":"a valuable soft yellow metallic element used for coins and jewelry","c":"黃金","s":"During periods of financial crisis, many investors prefer buying physical gold to protect their wealth.","t":"在金融危機時期，許多投資人更喜歡購買實體黃金來保護他們的財富。"},{"w":"golden","p":"adj.","d":"made of gold or having a bright yellow, shining color","c":"金黃色的；金色的","s":"The autumn afternoon sun cast a warm golden glow over the ripening wheat fields across the valley.","t":"秋日午後的陽光在整個山谷成熟的麥田上灑下了溫暖的金黃色光芒。"},{"w":"silver","p":"n. / adj.","d":"a shiny white metallic element used for coins, ornaments, and utensils","c":"銀；白銀；銀製的","s":"The royal banquet table was laid out with delicate porcelain dishes and polished antique silver spoons.","t":"皇家宴會桌上擺滿了精緻的瓷器餐具與擦得發亮的仿古銀製湯匙。"}]},{"unit":15,"theme":"Stationery, Office Supplies & Materials","cards":[{"w":"cotton","p":"n.","d":"a soft white fibrous substance used for making clothes and thread","c":"棉花；純棉","s":"People living in tropical climates prefer wearing light clothes made of pure cotton because it absorbs sweat well.","t":"生活在熱帶氣候的人們更喜歡穿著純棉製成的輕便衣服，因為它吸汗效果好。"},{"w":"pipe","p":"n.","d":"a tube through which liquids or gases flow; a smoking device","c":"管子；煙斗","s":"The plumber had to replace a leaking copper pipe under the kitchen sink to prevent further water damage.","t":"水電工必須更換廚房水槽下一根漏水的銅管，以防止水災進一步擴大。"},{"w":"tape","p":"n. / v.","d":"a narrow strip of sticky material; to record audio/video","c":"膠帶；磁帶；用膠帶黏貼；錄製","s":"Before moving to the new apartment, father used strong packaging tape to seal all the cardboard boxes.","t":"在搬到新公寓之前，父親用強韌的封箱膠帶把所有的紙箱都密封好。"},{"w":"CD","p":"n.","d":"a compact disc used for storing digital audio, video, or data","c":"光碟；雷射唱片","s":"My uncle has an impressive music collection with over five hundred jazz albums stored on original CD.","t":"我叔叔擁有令人印象深刻的音樂收藏，有超過五百張爵士專輯保存在原版光碟上。"},{"w":"envelope","p":"n.","d":"a flat paper container used especially for enclosing a letter","c":"信封","s":"After writing a heartfelt thank-you letter to her teacher, Maria slipped it into a clean white envelope.","t":"在給她的老師寫了一封由衷的感謝信之後，瑪麗亞將信滑入一個乾淨的白色信封中。"},{"w":"glue","p":"n. / v.","d":"a sticky substance used for joining things together","c":"膠水；黏貼","s":"The little girl made a colorful paper lantern for the festival, and she used liquid glue to stick the parts.","t":"小女孩為節日做了一個色彩繽紛的紙燈籠，她用液態膠水將各個部分黏合在一起。"},{"w":"ink","p":"n.","d":"a colored liquid used for writing, drawing, or printing","c":"墨水；油墨","s":"The office printer stopped working suddenly because the black ink cartridge ran completely dry.","t":"辦公室印表機突然停止運作，因為黑色墨水匣裡面的墨水已經徹底用乾了。"},{"w":"marker","p":"n.","d":"a felt-tipped pen used for writing bold lines or highlighting","c":"麥克筆；彩色筆","s":"The English teacher picked up a red dry-erase marker and wrote three important grammar rules on the whiteboard.","t":"英文老師拿起一支給白板用的紅色乾擦麥克筆，在白板上寫了三條重要的文法規則。"},{"w":"paste","p":"n. / v.","d":"a thick wet mixture used for sticking paper; to glue","c":"糊狀物；漿糊；張貼","s":"The students spread homemade wheat paste evenly over the wall to hang their artistic campaign posters.","t":"學生們將自製的麵粉漿糊均勻塗抹在牆上，以張貼他們的藝術宣傳海報。"},{"w":"textbook","p":"n.","d":"a comprehensive book used for the formal study of a subject","c":"教科書；課本","s":"Every student must bring their science textbook to class every morning so that we can read chapter four together.","t":"每位學生每天早上都必須帶他們的自然教科書來上課，這樣我們才能一起閱讀第四章。"}]},{"unit":16,"theme":"Home Architecture, Rooms & Interior Storage","cards":[{"w":"balcony","p":"n.","d":"a platform projecting from the wall of a building","c":"陽台","s":"On cool summer evenings, my grandparents enjoy sitting on the second-floor balcony to watch the street below.","t":"在涼爽的夏日傍晚，我的祖父母喜歡坐在二樓陽台上觀看下方街景。"},{"w":"basement","p":"n.","d":"the lowest floor of a building located entirely or partly underground","c":"地下室","s":"During heavy summer rainstorms, father went down to the dark basement to check if water had entered.","t":"在夏季強烈暴風雨期間，父親走到黑暗的地下室檢查是否有水滲入。"},{"w":"garage","p":"n.","d":"a building or indoor space used for housing motor vehicles","c":"車庫","s":"Uncle Robert parked his new electric car inside the spacious garage and plugged it into the charger.","t":"羅伯特叔叔將他的新電動車停進寬敞的車庫裡，並插上充電器。"},{"w":"fence","p":"n.","d":"a wooden or metal barrier enclosing an area of land","c":"籬笆；柵欄","s":"Our neighbor built a tall wooden fence around his backyard to prevent his energetic dog from running out.","t":"我們的鄰居在後院周圍建了一道高高的木籬笆，以防止他精力充沛的狗跑出去。"},{"w":"yard","p":"n.","d":"a piece of ground adjoining a house, often with grass or gardens","c":"庭院；院子","s":"The cheerful children chased colourful butterflies around the grassy front yard until dinner was ready.","t":"活潑開朗的孩子們在綠草如茵的前院追逐色彩繽紛的蝴蝶，直到晚餐準備就緒。"},{"w":"bookcase","p":"n.","d":"a piece of furniture with shelves used for storing books","c":"書櫃；書架","s":"Professor Miller ordered a custom-made mahogany bookcase to display his vast collection of antique literature.","t":"米勒教授訂製了一個紅木書架，以展示他收藏的大量古代文學典籍。"},{"w":"shelf","p":"n.","d":"a flat horizontal board fixed to a wall or frame for displaying objects","c":"層架；架子","s":"Mother asked Kevin to reach up and fetch the large porcelain bowl from the highest wooden shelf.","t":"母親請凱文把手伸高，從最高處的木製層架上取下那個大瓷碗。"},{"w":"closet","p":"n.","d":"a tall cupboard or small recess used for storing clothes and coats","c":"壁櫥；衣櫥","s":"Before leaving for work, Mr. Davis opened the bedroom closet and selected a crisp navy blue suit.","t":"出門上班前，戴維斯先生打開臥室衣櫥，挑選了一套筆挺的海軍藍西裝。"},{"w":"drawer","p":"n.","d":"a sliding box-like container fitted into a desk or chest of drawers","c":"抽屜","s":"Grandmother kept her golden scissors, sewing needles, and thread safely stored in the top desk drawer.","t":"祖母把她的金剪刀、縫紉針和線安全地收納在書桌最上方的抽屜裡。"},{"w":"dresser","p":"n.","d":"a piece of bedroom furniture with drawers and usually a mirror","c":"梳妝台；矮衣櫃","s":"My older sister sat in front of the bedroom dresser every morning to comb her hair and apply light makeup.","t":"我姊姊每天早上坐在臥室梳妝台前梳理頭髮並化上淡淡的妝容。"}]},{"unit":17,"theme":"Home Fixtures, Domestic Appliances & Floor Coverings","cards":[{"w":"ceiling","p":"n.","d":"the overhead upper surface of a room","c":"天花板","s":"The historic cathedral features a magnificent dome with biblical scenes painted across the high ceiling.","t":"這座歷史悠久的大教堂擁有壯麗的穹頂，高聳的天花板上繪製著聖經場景。"},{"w":"roof","p":"n.","d":"the structure forming the upper covering of a building","c":"屋頂","s":"A violent typhoon damaged the terracotta tiles, so two workers climbed up to repair the house roof.","t":"強烈颱風破壞了紅陶瓦片，所以兩名工人爬上去修復房子的屋頂。"},{"w":"curtain","p":"n.","d":"a piece of hanging cloth used to screen a window","c":"窗簾；簾子","s":"Because the afternoon sunlight was shining directly into the study, Linda pulled the thick velvet curtain closed.","t":"因為午後的陽光直接照進書房，琳達把厚重的天鵝絨窗簾拉上了。"},{"w":"dryer","p":"n.","d":"an appliance that removes moisture, especially for clothes or hair","c":"烘乾機；吹風機","s":"After washing his muddy soccer kit, Tom placed the clean uniforms into the electric clothes dryer.","t":"在洗好沾滿泥巴的足球裝備後，湯姆把乾淨的球衣放進了電動乾衣機中。"},{"w":"heater","p":"n.","d":"an apparatus used for warming the air in a room or building","c":"暖氣機；電暖爐","s":"When mountain temperatures dropped below zero degrees in January, we gathered around the portable electric heater.","t":"當一月份山區氣溫降至零度以下時，我們聚集在便攜式電暖爐周圍取暖。"},{"w":"microwave","p":"n.","d":"an oven that cooks or warms food using high-frequency electromagnetic waves","c":"微波爐","s":"If you arrive home late and find the dinner cold, you can reheat the chicken soup in the kitchen microwave.","t":"如果你很晚才到家發現晚餐涼了，你可以把雞湯放進廚房微波爐裡重新加熱。"},{"w":"oven","p":"n.","d":"an enclosed compartment used for baking or roasting food","c":"烤箱","s":"Mother preheated the electric baking oven to 180 degrees before putting the apple pie inside.","t":"母親在把蘋果派放進去之前，先把電烤箱預熱到攝氏一百八十度。"},{"w":"stove","p":"n.","d":"an apparatus for cooking or heating that operates by burning fuel or electricity","c":"瓦斯爐；火爐","s":"Always remember to turn off the gas knobs on the kitchen stove before leaving the house.","t":"出門前請務必記得關閉廚房瓦斯爐上的旋鈕開關。"},{"w":"carpet","p":"n.","d":"a thick heavy woven floor covering covering an entire room","c":"地毯","s":"The luxury presidential suite was decorated with Persian rugs and a thick, soft woolen carpet on the floor.","t":"豪華總統套房鋪設著波斯地毯，地板上鋪著一層厚實柔軟的羊毛地毯。"},{"w":"mat","p":"n.","d":"a small piece of coarse material placed on a floor for wiping shoes","c":"地墊；門墊；墊子","s":"Before stepping into the Japanese-style living room, visitors wipe the mud off their shoes on the door mat.","t":"在走進日式客廳之前，訪客會在門墊上擦掉鞋子上的泥土。"}]},{"unit":18,"theme":"Furniture, Bedding & Bathroom Hardware","cards":[{"w":"bench","p":"n.","d":"a long seat for several people, typically made of wood or stone","c":"長凳；長椅","s":"The elderly couple sat quietly on a wooden park bench to rest and feed the pigeons under the oak tree.","t":"那對老夫婦靜靜地坐在公園木長椅上休息，並在橡樹下餵食鴿子。"},{"w":"armchair","p":"n.","d":"a comfortable chair with supports for the arms","c":"單人扶手沙發椅","s":"Grandfather settled into his leather armchair with a cup of hot tea to read the evening newspaper.","t":"祖父坐在他的皮質單人扶手椅裡，喝著熱茶閱讀晚報。"},{"w":"pillow","p":"n.","d":"a soft cushion used to support the head during sleep","c":"枕頭","s":"I was so exhausted after hiking up the mountain that my eyes closed the moment my head touched the pillow.","t":"登山健行後我筋疲力竭，以至於我的頭一碰到枕頭眼睛就閉上了。"},{"w":"sheet","p":"n.","d":"a large piece of cotton or linen used on a bed; a broad thin piece","c":"床單；一張薄紙/板","s":"Mother laundered the bed linen every Saturday morning and spread a clean white cotton sheet across the mattress.","t":"母親每週六早晨洗滌寢具，並在床墊上鋪上一張乾淨的白色純棉床單。"},{"w":"blanket","p":"n.","d":"a thick piece of woolen or warm material used as a bed covering","c":"毛毯；厚毯子","s":"The mountain night was bitterly cold, so the camp counselor handed each student an extra wool blanket.","t":"山裡的夜晚寒冷徹骨，所以營隊輔導員給每位學生分發了一條額外的羊毛毯。"},{"w":"sink","p":"n. / v.","d":"a fixed basin with a water supply; to go down below surface","c":"水槽；下沉；沉沒","s":"Before preparing dinner, the chef washed his hands with soap and cleaned the fresh vegetables in the kitchen sink.","t":"在準備晚餐前，廚師用肥皂洗手並在廚房水槽清洗新鮮蔬菜。"},{"w":"tub","p":"n.","d":"a wide, open container used especially for taking a bath","c":"浴缸；桶","s":"After running a twenty-kilometer race in the rain, Samuel soaked his sore muscles in a warm bath tub.","t":"在雨中跑完二十公里賽跑後，塞繆爾在溫暖的浴缸中浸泡舒緩痠痛的肌肉。"},{"w":"mirror","p":"n.","d":"a reflective glass surface used for viewing one's appearance","c":"鏡子","s":"The actor stood backstage in front of the illuminated dressing mirror to make sure his costume was perfect.","t":"演員站在後台有照明的更衣梳妝鏡前，確保他的戲服完美無瑕。"},{"w":"faucet","p":"n.","d":"a device by which a flow of liquid from a pipe is controlled","c":"水龍頭","s":"To conserve water during the dry season, always remember to turn off the bathroom faucet while brushing teeth.","t":"為了在乾季節約用水，刷牙時請務必記得關緊浴室水龍頭。"},{"w":"bucket","p":"n.","d":"a cylindrical vessel used for carrying liquids or materials","c":"提桶；水桶","s":"The janitor filled a yellow plastic bucket with soapy water to mop the classroom hallway floor.","t":"工友在黃色塑膠水桶裡裝滿肥皂水，以拖洗教室走廊的地板。"}]},{"unit":19,"theme":"Household Hardware, Lighting & Everyday Gadgets","cards":[{"w":"toilet","p":"n.","d":"a fixed bowl with a seat and water flush system used for urination and defecation","c":"抽水馬桶；洗手間","s":"When traveling on a long-distance express train, you can find a clean public toilet at either end of the carriage.","t":"在長途特快車上旅行時，你可以在車廂的任一端找到一間乾淨的公用洗手間（抽水馬桶）。"},{"w":"candle","p":"n.","d":"a cylinder of wax with a central wick burned to provide light or fragrance","c":"蠟燭","s":"When the sudden thunderstorm caused a blackout across the neighborhood, grandmother lit a scented candle on the dining table.","t":"當突如其來的雷雨導致整個社區停電時，祖母在餐桌上點燃了一支香氛蠟燭。"},{"w":"flashlight","p":"n.","d":"a portable handheld battery-powered electric lamp","c":"手電筒","s":"The security guard carried a heavy-duty LED flashlight while patrolling the dark warehouse grounds at midnight.","t":"警衛在半夜巡邏黑暗的倉庫廠區時，手裡拿著一支高功率的LED手電筒。"},{"w":"needle","p":"n.","d":"a very thin pointed steel tool with an eye for thread used in sewing","c":"縫紉針；指針","s":"Aunt Mary threaded a sharp steel needle carefully before mending the torn sleeve on her husband's wool jacket.","t":"瑪麗姑姑在修補丈夫羊毛夾克上破損的袖子之前，小心翼翼地穿好了一根鋒利的鋼縫紉針。"},{"w":"pin","p":"n. / v.","d":"a tiny thin piece of metal used for fastening clothes or paper","c":"大頭針；別針；別住","s":"The tailor used a sharp silver pin to hold the pant cuff in place before he began sewing the hem.","t":"裁縫師在開始縫製褲管邊緣之前，用一枚鋒利的銀色別針把褲腳固定在原位。"},{"w":"hanger","p":"n.","d":"a curved piece of wood, metal, or plastic on which clothes are hung","c":"衣架","s":"Please hang your damp winter raincoat neatly on a sturdy wooden hanger instead of throwing it over the couch.","t":"請把你潮濕的冬季雨衣整齊掛在堅固的木衣架上，不要隨手扔在沙發上。"},{"w":"lock","p":"n. / v.","d":"a mechanism for keeping a door secure; to fasten with a key","c":"門鎖；上鎖","s":"Before our family leaves the house for a long vacation, father always checks that the front door lock is secure.","t":"在我們全家出門度長假之前，父親總是會檢查前門門鎖是否已經鎖好牢固。"},{"w":"freezer","p":"n.","d":"a refrigerated cabinet or room preserved at below freezing temperatures","c":"冷凍庫；冷凍櫃","s":"Mother bought two large tubs of vanilla ice cream and placed them immediately inside the kitchen freezer to keep firm.","t":"母親買了兩大桶香草冰淇淋，並立刻放進廚房冷凍庫以保持硬度。"},{"w":"recorder","p":"n.","d":"an apparatus for recording sound or visual signals digitally or on tape","c":"錄音機；記錄器；直笛","s":"The university journalist placed a digital audio recorder on the interview table to capture every word accurately.","t":"大學校刊記者在訪談桌上放了一台數位錄音機，以便準確記錄下每一個字。"},{"w":"video","p":"n. / v.","d":"the recording, reproducing, or broadcasting of moving visual images","c":"影片；錄影；錄製影片","s":"During my sister's high school graduation ceremony, my proud father recorded the entire event on digital video.","t":"在我姊姊的高中畢業典禮上，我引以為傲的父親用數位影片記錄下了整場活動。"}]},{"unit":20,"theme":"Sports, Leisure Activities & Camping Recreation","cards":[{"w":"activity","p":"n.","d":"a thing that a person or group does or has done","c":"活動","s":"The summer camp offered many exciting outdoor activities such as kayaking, rock climbing, and forest hiking.","t":"夏令營提供了許多令人興奮的戶外活動，例如划皮艇、攀岩以及森林健行。"},{"w":"badminton","p":"n.","d":"a court game played with lightweight rackets and a shuttlecock","c":"羽毛球運動","s":"After finishing classes on Friday afternoon, Kevin and his classmate played three intense games of badminton.","t":"星期五下午放學後，凱文和他的同學在體育館打了三場激烈的羽毛球比賽。"},{"w":"bowling","p":"n.","d":"a game in which players roll a heavy ball down a wooden lane to knock down pins","c":"保齡球運動","s":"For my brother's sixteenth birthday celebration, we booked two lanes at the downtown bowling alley.","t":"為了慶祝我弟弟的十六歲生日，我們在市中心的保齡球館預訂了兩個球道。"},{"w":"football","p":"n.","d":"a game played with an oval ball on an outdoor field; American football or soccer","c":"美式足球；橄欖球；足球","s":"High school students gathered at the outdoor stadium on Friday night to cheer for their varsity football team.","t":"高中生們週五晚上聚集在戶外體育場，為他們的學校美式足球代表隊加油吶喊。"},{"w":"frisbee","p":"n.","d":"a plastic flying disc thrown for recreation or in competitive team sports","c":"飛盤","s":"On sunny Saturday afternoons, dog owners gather in the riverside park and toss a bright plastic frisbee to their pets.","t":"在陽光明媚的週六午後，養狗人士聚集在河濱公園，向他們的寵物拋擲鮮豔的塑膠飛盤。"},{"w":"golf","p":"n.","d":"a club-and-ball sport played across an outdoor course of 9 or 18 holes","c":"高爾夫球","s":"My retired grandfather plays eighteen holes of golf every Wednesday morning with his former business partners.","t":"我退休的祖父每週三早上都會與他以前的商業夥伴打十八洞高爾夫球。"},{"w":"soccer","p":"n.","d":"a football game played between two teams of eleven players with a round ball","c":"足球（英式足球）","s":"During the FIFA World Cup tournament, millions of passionate fans watch their national soccer team on television.","t":"在國際足協世界盃錦標賽期間，數以百萬計的熱情球迷在電視機前觀看他們的國家足球隊比賽。"},{"w":"volleyball","p":"n.","d":"a team game played by hitting an inflated ball back and forth over a high net","c":"排球","s":"During their summer vacation at Kenting, the teenagers enjoyed playing beach volleyball under the blue sky.","t":"在墾丁放暑假期間，青少年們在藍天下的沙灘上盡情享受打沙灘排球的樂趣。"},{"w":"tent","p":"n.","d":"a portable shelter made of fabric supported by poles and ropes","c":"帳篷","s":"Before the mountain rainstorm arrived, the hikers pitched their waterproof canvas tent on high ground.","t":"在山區暴風雨來臨之前，登山者們在高地上搭起了他們的防水帆布帳篷。"},{"w":"chess","p":"n.","d":"a strategic board game for two players played on a checkered board with sixteen pieces each","c":"西洋棋；國際象棋","s":"Grandmaster players must think three or four moves ahead when competing in a national chess championship.","t":"國際特級大師在參加全國西洋棋錦標賽時，必須提前深思熟慮三到四步棋。"}]},{"unit":21,"theme":"Entertainment, Performing Arts & Musical Instruments","cards":[{"w":"drama","p":"n.","d":"a play for theater, radio, or television; exciting events","c":"戲劇","s":"The high school English club staged a famous Shakespeare drama in the school hall, and parents gave them a standing ovation.","t":"高中英語社團在學校禮堂上演了一齣著名的莎士比亞戲劇，家長們起立給予他們熱烈鼓掌。"},{"w":"film","p":"n. / v.","d":"a motion picture; thin layer; to record moving pictures","c":"電影；膠卷；拍攝","s":"We stayed home on Friday night to watch an award-winning documentary film, but my younger sister fell asleep on the couch.","t":"我們週五晚上留在家裡看一部獲獎的紀錄片電影，但我妹妹卻在沙發上睡著了。"},{"w":"cartoon","p":"n.","d":"an animated film or a humorous drawing in a newspaper","c":"卡通；漫畫","s":"Children usually wake up very early on Saturday mornings to watch their favorite cartoon on television while eating cereal.","t":"孩子們通常在週六早晨很早就起床，一邊吃麥片一邊看電視上他們最喜歡的卡通。"},{"w":"KTV","p":"n.","d":"a commercial entertainment venue where people sing karaoke","c":"KTV；卡拉OK包廂","s":"After completing our final semester examinations, our classmates booked a private room at a nearby KTV to sing pop songs.","t":"完成期末考試後，我們同班同學在附近的一家 KTV 預訂了一間包廂唱流行歌曲。"},{"w":"MTV","p":"n.","d":"Music Television; music videos broadcast on screen","c":"音樂電視；音樂錄影帶頻道","s":"During the summer holidays, teenagers spent hours watching trendy pop songs and artist interviews on MTV, which was very popular.","t":"在暑假期間，青少年花好幾個小時在 MTV 上觀看熱門流行歌曲和藝人訪談，這在當時非常流行。"},{"w":"jazz","p":"n.","d":"a type of modern music with strong rhythms and improvisation","c":"爵士樂","s":"The cozy downtown cafe invited a talented saxophone player to perform live jazz every Friday evening, so many customers arrived early.","t":"市中心那家溫馨的咖啡館邀請了一位才華洋溢的薩克斯風樂手在每週五傍晚現場演奏爵士樂，所以許多顧客很早就抵達了。"},{"w":"drum","p":"n. / v.","d":"a musical percussion instrument; to beat repeatedly","c":"鼓；打鼓","s":"Kevin joined the marching band as the main rhythm player, so he practiced beating the bass drum for two hours every afternoon.","t":"凱文加入行進樂隊擔任主要節奏手，所以他每天下午花兩個小時練習敲擊大鼓。"},{"w":"flute","p":"n.","d":"a high-pitched wind instrument made of wood or metal","c":"長笛","s":"Sarah stood under the spotlight on stage and played a sweet melody on her silver flute, which touched everyone in the auditorium.","t":"莎拉站在舞台的聚光燈下，用她的銀色長笛吹奏出甜美的旋律，感動了禮堂裡的每個人。"},{"w":"guitar","p":"n.","d":"a musical instrument usually with six strings played by plucking","c":"吉他","s":"Jason sat beside the warm campfire on the beach and strummed his acoustic guitar while his friends sang classic folk songs together.","t":"傑森坐在海灘溫暖的營火旁撥弄著他的民謠吉他，而他的朋友們則一起哼唱著經典民謠。"},{"w":"trumpet","p":"n.","d":"a brass musical instrument with a flared bell and valves","c":"小號；喇叭","s":"The brass band leader raised his hand to start the march, and the loud sound of the golden trumpet echoed across the athletic field.","t":"銅管樂隊指揮舉手示意開始進行曲，金黃色小號響亮的聲音隨即在運動場上迴盪。"}]},{"unit":22,"theme":"Professions, Roles & Career Paths","cards":[{"w":"violin","p":"n.","d":"a four-stringed wooden musical instrument played with a bow","c":"小提琴","s":"The orchestra concert master tucked the wooden violin under her chin and played a beautiful solo that silenced the audience.","t":"管弦樂團首席將木製小提琴夾在下巴下，演奏了一段優美的獨奏，令全場觀眾屏息聆聽。"},{"w":"career","p":"n.","d":"a profession or occupation chosen as one's life's work","c":"職業；事業","s":"After graduating from college with honors, Kevin decided to pursue a professional career in computer software development.","t":"在大學以優異成績畢業後，凱文決定在電腦軟體開發領域追求專業的事業生涯。"},{"w":"actor","p":"n.","d":"a person whose profession is acting on stage, in movies, or on television","c":"男演員；演員","s":"The famous Hollywood actor practiced his lines repeatedly in the dressing room before stepping out in front of the cameras.","t":"這位著名好萊塢演員在走進鏡頭前，在更衣室裡反覆練習他的台詞。"},{"w":"actress","p":"n.","d":"a woman whose profession is acting on stage, in movies, or on television","c":"女演員","s":"The young actress received an international award for her brilliant performance as a brave doctor in the wartime film.","t":"這位年輕女演員因在戰爭電影中精彩詮釋一位勇敢的醫生而榮獲國際大獎。"},{"w":"artist","p":"n.","d":"a person who produces paintings or drawings as a profession or hobby","c":"藝術家；畫家","s":"The talented local artist displayed thirty colorful oil paintings in the gallery, and visitors admired her creative imagination.","t":"這位才華洋溢的在地藝術家在畫廊展出了三十幅色彩繽紛的油畫，參觀者對她的創意思維讚歎不已。"},{"w":"assistant","p":"n.","d":"a person who helps someone in a higher position with their work","c":"助理；助手","s":"The general manager hired a bilingual assistant to organize business meetings, reply to client emails, and book flight tickets.","t":"總經理僱用了一位雙語助手來安排商務會議、回覆客戶電子郵件以及訂購機票。"},{"w":"banker","p":"n.","d":"an officer or manager of a bank or financial institution","c":"銀行家；銀行主管","s":"My uncle works as a senior banker in Taipei, and he helps local business owners obtain loans to expand their factories.","t":"我叔叔在台北擔任資深銀行主管，他協助當地企業主獲得貸款以擴大他們的工廠。"},{"w":"barber","p":"n.","d":"a person whose business is cutting men's hair and shaving beards","c":"理髮師（男士）","s":"Grandfather always visits the same traditional barber on the corner to have his hair trimmed and his beard neatly shaved.","t":"祖父總是去街角那家傳統理髮店剪頭髮，並請理髮師把他的鬍鬚刮得整整齊齊。"},{"w":"captain","p":"n.","d":"the person in command of a ship or aircraft; team leader","c":"船長；機長；隊長","s":"The experienced ship captain steered the large cargo vessel safely through the stormy sea into the deep harbor.","t":"這位經驗豐富的船長駕駛著大型貨輪安全穿過暴風雨肆虐的海洋，駛入深水港灣。"},{"w":"clerk","p":"n.","d":"a person employed in an office or bank to keep records; shop assistant","c":"辦事員；店員","s":"When the customer brought the winter jacket to the counter, the polite store clerk scanned the price tag and accepted payment.","t":"當顧客將冬季夾克拿到櫃檯時，有禮貌的店員掃描了價格標籤並收取了款項。"}]},{"unit":23,"theme":"Specialized Occupations, Legal & Technical Experts","cards":[{"w":"coach","p":"n. / v.","d":"an athletic trainer; long-distance bus; to train someone","c":"教練；長途巴士；指導","s":"The high school basketball coach blew his whistle loudly to stop the practice and explained how to set a better defense.","t":"高中籃球教練大聲吹響哨子暫停練習，並解釋如何建立更好的防守陣型。"},{"w":"dentist","p":"n.","d":"a doctor who specializes in treating teeth and gums","c":"牙醫","s":"Because my younger brother ate too many candies without brushing his teeth, mother took him to the dentist to check a cavity.","t":"因為我弟弟吃太多糖果且沒刷牙，母親帶他去看牙醫以檢查蛀牙。"},{"w":"engineer","p":"n.","d":"a person trained in designing or building machines, structures, or software","c":"工程師","s":"The senior mechanical engineer inspected the blueprint carefully before the construction crew began assembling the new bridge.","t":"資深機械工程師在施工團隊開始組裝新橋樑之前，仔細檢查了設計藍圖。"},{"w":"expert","p":"n. / adj.","d":"a person with comprehensive and authoritative knowledge in a particular area","c":"專家；熟練的","s":"The financial news station invited a stock market expert to analyze global inflation trends and advise viewers on investments.","t":"財經新聞台邀請了一位股票市場專家來分析全球通貨膨脹趨勢，並為觀眾提供投資建議。"},{"w":"hunter","p":"n.","d":"a person or animal that pursues and kills wild animals for food or sport","c":"獵人","s":"In ancient times, the skilled forest hunter tracked footprints in the snow for hours to find food for the hungry tribe.","t":"在古代，熟練的森林獵人在雪地中追蹤腳印數小時，為飢餓的部落尋找食物。"},{"w":"journalist","p":"n.","d":"a person who writes news stories for newspapers, magazines, or broadcasts","c":"新聞記者","s":"The courageous investigative journalist traveled into remote areas to interview villagers and report on local water pollution.","t":"這位勇敢的調查新聞記者深入偏遠地區採訪村民，報導當地的水質污染問題。"},{"w":"judge","p":"n. / v.","d":"a public officer appointed to decide cases in court; to form an opinion","c":"法官；裁判；評斷","s":"After listening carefully to both lawyers in the courtroom, the impartial judge delivered a fair sentence to the defendant.","t":"在法庭上仔細聆聽兩位律師的陳述後，公正的法官對被告宣判了公平的判決。"},{"w":"lawyer","p":"n.","d":"a person who practices or studies law; an attorney or legal counselor","c":"律師","s":"Before signing the business partnership agreement, Mr. Lin consulted a corporate lawyer to ensure all contractual terms were legal.","t":"在簽署商業合夥協議之前，林先生諮詢了一位公司律師以確保所有合約條款皆合法。"},{"w":"manager","p":"n.","d":"a person responsible for controlling or administering an organization or staff","c":"經理；主管","s":"The customer service manager resolved the client's complaint politely and offered a full refund for the defective product.","t":"客服部經理客氣地解決了顧客的投訴，並為該瑕疵產品提供了全額退款。"},{"w":"model","p":"n. / v.","d":"a person employed to display clothes; a representation of an object","c":"模特兒；模型；模範","s":"The international fashion model walked gracefully down the catwalk in Paris, showcasing the designer's latest winter collection.","t":"這位國際時尚模特兒優雅地走在巴黎伸展台上，展示設計師最新的冬季時裝系列。"}]},{"unit":24,"theme":"Public Service, Academia & Cultural Professions","cards":[{"w":"musician","p":"n.","d":"a person who plays a musical instrument or writes music","c":"音樂家","s":"The talented classical musician composed an original piano sonata, and she performed it with great passion at the national theater.","t":"這位才華洋溢的古典音樂家創作了一首原創鋼琴奏鳴曲，她在國家劇院充滿激情地演奏了這首曲子。"},{"w":"priest","p":"n.","d":"an ordained minister of the Christian Church having religious authority","c":"神父；牧師","s":"Every Sunday morning, the elderly Catholic priest gave an inspiring sermon about compassion to all believers in the church.","t":"每逢週日早晨，這位年邁的天主教神父都會在教堂向全體信徒發表關於慈悲的激勵人心講道。"},{"w":"painter","p":"n.","d":"an artist who paints pictures; a person who paints buildings","c":"畫家；油漆匠","s":"The French Impressionist painter set up his easel in the flower garden to capture the morning sunlight on his canvas.","t":"這位法國印象派畫家在花園中架起畫架，試圖在畫布上捕捉晨曦的光影變化。"},{"w":"photographer","p":"n.","d":"a person who takes photographs, either as a job or hobby","c":"攝影師","s":"The wildlife photographer waited patiently behind camouflage netting for six hours to take pictures of rare mountain eagles.","t":"這位野生動物攝影師在偽裝網後耐心等待了六個小時，只為拍攝稀有山雕的照片。"},{"w":"policeman","p":"n.","d":"a male member of a police force","c":"警察；警員","s":"The brave traffic policeman stood at the busy downtown intersection directing vehicles after the traffic lights broke down.","t":"在紅綠燈故障後，英勇的交通警察站在繁忙的市中心十字路口指揮車輛行進。"},{"w":"president","p":"n.","d":"the elected head of a republican state; leader of an organization","c":"總統；總裁；理事長","s":"The newly elected national president delivered a hopeful inaugural address promising to improve education and reduce unemployment.","t":"新當選的國家總統發表了充滿希望的就職演說，承諾改善教育並降低失業率。"},{"w":"principal","p":"n. / adj.","d":"the head of a school; first in order of importance","c":"校長；主要的","s":"During the morning assembly, the school principal awarded medals to outstanding students who won the regional science contest.","t":"在晨會期間，學校校長向贏得區域科學競賽的優秀學生頒發了獎牌。"},{"w":"professor","p":"n.","d":"a university teacher of the highest academic rank","c":"教授","s":"The history professor delivered an engaging lecture on ancient Egyptian pyramids and answered questions from curious students.","t":"歷史系教授發表了一場關於古埃及金字塔的生動演講，並回答了好奇學生的提問。"},{"w":"reporter","p":"n.","d":"a person who reports news or conducts interviews for television or press","c":"記者；通訊員","s":"The television news reporter held a microphone in the pouring rain, broadcasting live updates about the approaching typhoon.","t":"電視新聞記者在傾盆大雨中手持麥克風，現場直播關於颱風逼近的最新動態。"},{"w":"sailor","p":"n.","d":"a person who works as a member of the crew of a ship or boat","c":"水手；海員","s":"The young naval sailor tightened the thick ropes on deck and looked out across the boundless ocean toward the horizon.","t":"年輕的海軍水手緊緊拉繫甲板上的粗繩，放眼望向地平線對面的無垠大洋。"}]},{"unit":25,"theme":"Service Roles, Royalty & Specialized Trades","cards":[{"w":"salesman","p":"n.","d":"a man whose job involves selling goods or services","c":"業務員；推銷員","s":"The friendly car salesman explained all the safety features of the hybrid sedan and offered us a free test drive.","t":"這位親切的汽車業務員解釋了這輛油電混合轎車的所有安全功能，並為我們提供了免費試駕。"},{"w":"scientist","p":"n.","d":"a person who studies or has expert knowledge in one or more sciences","c":"科學家","s":"The environmental scientist analyzed water samples collected from the river and discovered dangerous levels of chemical waste.","t":"這位環境科學家分析了從該河流採集的水樣，並發現了危險含量的化學廢料。"},{"w":"mechanic","p":"n.","d":"a person who repairs and maintains machinery, especially car engines","c":"技工；修車工","s":"When my old car suddenly broke down on the highway, a skillful mechanic replaced the damaged alternator in two hours.","t":"當我的老爺車在公路上突然拋錨時，一位技術精湛的技工在兩小時內更換了損壞的發電機。"},{"w":"secretary","p":"n.","d":"a person employed to assist with correspondence, keep records, and make appointments","c":"秘書","s":"The executive secretary answered incoming telephone calls politely and scheduled important meetings on the company digital calendar.","t":"這位主管秘書客氣地接聽打進來的電話，並在公司的數位行事曆上安排了重要會議。"},{"w":"servant","p":"n.","d":"a person who performs duties for others, especially in a domestic setting","c":"僕人；傭人","s":"In ancient European castles, numerous servants cleaned grand dining halls, prepared elaborate meals, and looked after the nobility.","t":"在古代歐洲城堡中，眾多僕人負責打掃宏偉的宴會廳、準備豐盛的餐點，並伺候貴族階層。"},{"w":"vendor","p":"n.","d":"a person or company offering something for sale, especially street traders","c":"小販；攤販；廠商","s":"Every Saturday night, the street food vendor sets up his mobile stall in the night market to grill fragrant sausages for customers.","t":"每逢週六晚上，街頭小販都會在夜市擺出移動攤位，為顧客現烤香氣四溢的香腸。"},{"w":"thief","p":"n.","d":"a person who steals another person's property, especially secretly (pl. thieves)","c":"小偷；竊賊","s":"An alert store security officer caught the sneaky thief trying to sneak out the back exit with stolen electronic watches.","t":"一名警覺的店內保全人員抓住了這個鬼鬼祟祟的小偷，他當時正試圖帶著偷來的電子手錶從後門溜出去。"},{"w":"speaker","p":"n.","d":"a person who speaks, especially at a formal event; audio device","c":"演講者；講者；揚聲器","s":"The keynote speaker delivered an inspiring talk on artificial intelligence, and the auditorium erupted in loud applause.","t":"主講人在會上發表了關於人工智慧的激勵人心演講，整個禮堂爆發出熱烈的掌聲。"},{"w":"prince","p":"n.","d":"the son of a monarch; a close male member of a royal family","c":"王子；親王","s":"The handsome young prince rode his white horse through the palace gates to greet thousands of cheering royal subjects.","t":"這位英俊的年輕王子騎著白馬穿過宮殿大門，向數千名歡呼的王室子民揮手致意。"},{"w":"princess","p":"n.","d":"the daughter of a monarch; the wife of a prince","c":"公主；王妃","s":"The royal princess wore a sparkling diamond tiara to the banquet and smiled warmly at international diplomatic guests.","t":"這位王室公主戴著閃亮的鑽石皇冠出席宴會，並對國際外交嘉賓報以溫暖的微笑。"}]},{"unit":26,"theme":"Business, Employment & Commerce","cards":[{"w":"serve","p":"v.","d":"to perform duties or services for an organization, customer, or country","c":"服務；供應；服役","s":"The friendly family restaurant continues to serve traditional Taiwanese beef noodles, and long queues form outside every weekend.","t":"這家溫馨的家庭餐館繼續供應道地的台灣牛肉麵，每個週末外面都會排起長長的人龍。"},{"w":"service","p":"n.","d":"the action of helping or doing work for someone; customer care","c":"服務；協助","s":"The hotel staff was praised by overseas travelers because the room service was prompt, courteous, and exceptionally helpful.","t":"飯店員工受到海外旅客的讚賞，因為客房服務迅速、謙恭有禮且非常有幫助。"},{"w":"customer","p":"n.","d":"a person or organization that buys goods or services from a store or business","c":"顧客；客戶","s":"The supermarket manager politely greeted every loyal customer who walked through the front doors on Saturday morning.","t":"超市經理在週六早晨客氣地向走進大門的每一位忠實顧客打招呼。"},{"w":"trade","p":"n. / v.","d":"the buying and selling of goods and services between people or countries","c":"貿易；交易；商業","s":"International trade between Asian and European nations has expanded rapidly because shipping routes have become more efficient.","t":"亞洲和歐洲國家之間的國際貿易迅速擴張，因為航運路線變得更加高效。"},{"w":"company","p":"n.","d":"a commercial business; the condition of being with someone","c":"公司；同行；陪伴","s":"After working for ten years in finance, Jason and his college friends established an innovative tech company in Taipei.","t":"在金融領域工作了十年之後，傑森和他的大學好友在台北成立了一家創新科技公司。"},{"w":"employee","p":"n.","d":"a person employed for wages or salary, especially at non-executive level","c":"員工；受僱者","s":"The generous manufacturing firm offered every hardworking employee a generous year-end bonus and three weeks of paid leave.","t":"這家慷慨的製造業公司為每位辛勤工作的員工提供了優厚的年終獎金和三週的有薪假。"},{"w":"interview","p":"n. / v.","d":"a formal meeting at which someone is questioned to assess suitability","c":"面試；訪談；採訪","s":"David felt slightly nervous before his morning job interview, so he reviewed common questions while waiting in the reception hall.","t":"大衛在早晨的求職面試前感到有些緊張，所以他在接待大廳等待時複習了常見問題。"},{"w":"hire","p":"v. / n.","d":"to employ someone for wages; to rent equipment for temporary use","c":"僱用；聘請；租用","s":"Because the software department had several big projects, the board decided to hire ten experienced programmers immediately.","t":"因為軟體部門有幾個大專案，董事會決定立即聘請十位有經驗的程式設計師。"},{"w":"contract","p":"n. / v.","d":"a written or spoken agreement intended to be enforceable by law","c":"合約；契約；縮小","s":"Both corporate leaders read every clause in the legal contract carefully before signing their names at the bottom.","t":"兩位企業領導人在底部簽名之前，仔細閱讀了這份法律合約中的每一個條款。"},{"w":"quit","p":"v.","d":"to leave a place usually permanently; to stop an action or employment","c":"辭職；放棄；停止","s":"After working long overnight hours for three years, Sarah decided to quit her stressful job to pursue her passion for painting.","t":"在連續三年上夜班長時間工作之後，莎拉決定辭掉這份壓力很大的工作，去追求她對畫畫的熱情。"}]},{"unit":27,"theme":"Aviation, Public Transit & Highway Infrastructure","cards":[{"w":"aircraft","p":"n.","d":"any airplane, helicopter, or flying machine (pl. aircraft)","c":"航空器；飛機","s":"The international airport ordered fifteen modern commercial aircraft to meet the rising demand for overseas travel.","t":"該國際機場訂購了十五架現代商用航空器，以滿足日益增長的出境旅遊需求。"},{"w":"airline","p":"n.","d":"a company that provides regular flights for passengers or cargo","c":"航空公司","s":"Our family booked discounted round-trip tickets through a reputable budget airline, and the customer service was surprisingly good.","t":"我們全家透過一家聲譽良好的廉價航空公司訂購了折扣來回機票，其客戶服務出乎意料地好。"},{"w":"flight","p":"n.","d":"a journey made through the air, especially in an airplane","c":"航班；飛行","s":"Because severe stormy weather hit Tokyo, our direct afternoon flight was delayed on the airport runway for two hours.","t":"因為嚴重暴風雨襲擊東京，我們下午的直飛航班在機場跑道上延誤了兩個小時。"},{"w":"plane","p":"n.","d":"an airplane; a powered flying vehicle with fixed wings","c":"飛機","s":"The passengers fastened their seatbelts tightly as the heavy passenger plane accelerated rapidly down the runway.","t":"當這架沉重的大型客運飛機在跑道上快速加速時，機上乘客緊緊繫上了安全帶。"},{"w":"helicopter","p":"n.","d":"an aircraft that derives lift from rotating overhead blades","c":"直升機","s":"A rescue helicopter hovered steadily above the raging river to lift stranded mountain hikers into the cabin safely.","t":"一架救援直升機在洶湧的河流上方平穩盤旋，將受困的山區登山客安全吊起進入機艙。"},{"w":"MRT","p":"n.","d":"Mass Rapid Transit; the metropolitan subway and elevated train system","c":"捷運；大眾捷運系統","s":"Commuters in Taipei prefer taking the punctual MRT during rush hours because city street traffic is often gridlocked.","t":"台北的通勤族在尖峰時段更喜歡搭乘準時的捷運，因為市區街道交通經常嚴重堵塞。"},{"w":"subway","p":"n.","d":"an underground railway system in a city","c":"地下鐵；地鐵","s":"During our winter holiday in New York, we bought a weekly pass to ride the underground subway across Manhattan easily.","t":"在紐約度寒假期間，我們買了一張週票，方便搭乘地下地鐵暢行曼哈頓。"},{"w":"highway","p":"n.","d":"a main public road, especially connecting major cities","c":"公路；高速公路","s":"Long-distance truck drivers usually travel along the national highway late at night when the roadway is clear of traffic.","t":"長途卡車司機通常在深夜路面車流稀少時，沿著國道高速公路行駛。"},{"w":"overpass","p":"n.","d":"a bridge that carries one road or path above another road","c":"天橋；陸橋；高架道","s":"Pedestrians are encouraged to walk across the elevated overpass to cross the dangerous ten-lane avenue safely.","t":"政府鼓勵行人走上高架天橋，以安全穿越這條危險的十線道大馬路。"},{"w":"underpass","p":"n.","d":"a tunnel or sunken roadway allowing vehicles or pedestrians to pass beneath","c":"地下道；地下車道","s":"Because the heavy monsoon storm flooded the low-lying underpass, city traffic police closed the road to prevent accidents.","t":"因為強烈的季風暴雨淹沒了低窪的地下道，市區交通警察封閉了道路以防止意外發生。"}]},{"unit":28,"theme":"Rail Transit, Travel Motion & Visual Signals","cards":[{"w":"jeep","p":"n.","d":"a sturdy motor vehicle with four-wheel drive, used over rough terrain","c":"吉普車","s":"The wildlife rangers drove a rugged open-top jeep across the rocky grassland to observe migrating wild animals.","t":"野生動物巡警駕駛著一輛耐用的敞篷吉普車穿過崎嶇的草原，觀察遷徙的野生動物。"},{"w":"railroad","p":"n.","d":"a permanent track composed of rails on which trains run; train system","c":"鐵路；鐵路系統","s":"Workers constructed the famous historic mountain railroad over a century ago to transport timber from deep alpine forests.","t":"一個多世紀前，工人們修建了這條著名的歷史登山鐵路，將木材從高山深林中運送出來。"},{"w":"platform","p":"n.","d":"a raised level surface on which people stand at a train station or stage","c":"月台；講台；平台","s":"Dozens of eager commuters stood behind the yellow safety line on the railway platform waiting for the morning express train.","t":"數十名熱切的通勤者站在鐵路月台上的黃色安全線後方，等待著早班特快列車。"},{"w":"passenger","p":"n.","d":"a traveler on a public or private conveyance other than the driver or crew","c":"乘客；旅客","s":"The flight attendant gently reminded each seated passenger to keep their seatbelts fastened during turbulent weather conditions.","t":"空服人員溫柔地提醒每一位就座的乘客，在不穩定的氣流天氣條件下務必繫好安全帶。"},{"w":"path","p":"n.","d":"a way or track laid down for walking or made by continual treading","c":"小徑；路線；道路","s":"A quiet stone path wound through the green bamboo grove, leading visitors toward an ancient wooden Buddhist monastery.","t":"一條幽靜的石砌小徑穿過翠綠的竹林，引導遊客走向一座古老的木造佛寺。"},{"w":"tunnel","p":"n. / v.","d":"an artificial underground passage, especially one built through a hill","c":"隧道；地道；挖地道","s":"The high-speed bullet train turned on its bright headlights before speeding through the long mountain tunnel.","t":"高速高鐵列車在急速駛過長長的山區隧道之前，打開了明亮的前照燈。"},{"w":"sign","p":"n. / v.","d":"a notice bearing information or instructions; to write one's name","c":"標誌；指示牌；簽署","s":"The yellow highway warning sign alerted motorists to watch out for falling rocks during heavy rainy weather.","t":"黃色公路警示標誌提醒駕駛人，在大雨滂沱的天氣中要小心落石。"},{"w":"movement","p":"n.","d":"an act of changing physical location or position; a group trend","c":"動作；移動；運動","s":"The dance instructor watched the student's graceful arm movement carefully and offered tips on keeping perfect balance.","t":"舞蹈教練仔細觀察學生優雅的手臂動作，並提供了保持完美平衡的訣竅。"},{"w":"motion","p":"n.","d":"the action or process of moving or being moved; gesture","c":"移動；動作；提議","s":"The sensor lights in the dark hallway are activated by physical motion, so they turn on whenever someone walks past.","t":"黑暗走廊裡的感應燈是由人體移動感應觸發的，因此每當有人走過時它們就會亮起。"},{"w":"effect","p":"n.","d":"a change which is a result or consequence of an action or other cause","c":"影響；效果；結果","s":"Scientific studies demonstrate that regular physical exercise has a beneficial long-term effect on cardiovascular health.","t":"科學研究顯示，規律的體能鍛鍊對心血管健康具有持久且有益的良好影響。"}]},{"unit":29,"theme":"Weather, Atmospheric Conditions & Cosmos","cards":[{"w":"climate","p":"n.","d":"the weather conditions prevailing in an area over a long period","c":"氣候","s":"The Mediterranean region is famous for its mild winter climate, which attracts millions of northern European holidaymakers each year.","t":"地中海地區以其溫和的冬季氣候聞名，每年吸引數百萬北歐度假者前來。"},{"w":"temperature","p":"n.","d":"the degree of heat or cold measured by a thermometer","c":"溫度；氣溫；體溫","s":"When the winter cold front arrived from Siberia, the nighttime temperature dropped rapidly below five degrees Celsius in the mountains.","t":"當來自西伯利亞的冬季冷鋒抵達時，山區的夜間氣溫迅速降至攝氏五度以下。"},{"w":"fog","p":"n.","d":"a thick cloud of tiny water droplets suspended in the atmosphere near earth","c":"霧；濃霧","s":"Heavy morning fog settled over the harbor, forcing ship captains to blow loud foghorns to avoid collisions with other vessels.","t":"清晨的濃霧籠罩著港口，迫使船長們鳴響響亮的霧號以避免與其他船隻相撞。"},{"w":"thunder","p":"n. / v.","d":"a loud rumbling or crashing noise heard after a lightning flash","c":"雷聲；雷鳴；打雷","s":"A sudden roll of loud thunder shook the window glass, and the frightened family rushed inside before the heavy rainfall started.","t":"一陣突如其來的滾滾雷聲震動了窗戶玻璃，受驚的全家人在暴雨降臨前匆忙躲進屋內。"},{"w":"lightning","p":"n.","d":"the natural electrical discharge of very short duration between clouds","c":"閃電","s":"A blinding flash of sharp lightning illuminated the dark midnight sky, striking a tall pine tree on the hill a second later.","t":"一道耀眼的銳利閃電照亮了漆黑的午夜天空，一秒鐘後擊中了山丘上的一棵高大松樹。"},{"w":"storm","p":"n. / v.","d":"a violent disturbance of the atmosphere with strong winds, rain, or snow","c":"暴風雨；風暴","s":"The tropical storm brought ferocious gale-force winds and heavy rain, uprooting trees and causing temporary power outages in town.","t":"熱帶風暴帶來了兇猛的狂風和暴雨，連根拔起了樹木並導致鎮上暫時停電。"},{"w":"stormy","p":"adj.","d":"characterized by violent weather with strong winds, rain, or thunder","c":"暴風雨的；波濤洶湧的","s":"The brave fishermen decided to stay safely inside the sheltered harbor because stormy seas made sailing extremely hazardous.","t":"勇敢的漁民決定安全地留在遮蔽的避風港內，因為暴風雨的洶湧大海使出航極其危險。"},{"w":"snowy","p":"adj.","d":"covered with snow, or characterized by snowfall","c":"下雪的；積雪的；多雪的","s":"Children dressed in warm wool jackets ran out into the snowy yard, joyfully building a round snowman with their neighborhood friends.","t":"穿著保暖羊毛夾克的孩子們跑進積雪的院子裡，歡天喜地與鄰居朋友一起堆起圓圓的雪人。"},{"w":"humid","p":"adj.","d":"marked by a relatively high level of water vapor in the atmosphere","c":"潮濕的；濕潤的","s":"Summer afternoons in Taipei are intensely hot and humid, so most people carry small towels and stay inside air-conditioned shops.","t":"台北夏日的午後非常炎熱潮濕，所以大多數人都隨身攜帶小毛巾並待在有冷氣的店鋪裡。"},{"w":"universe","p":"n.","d":"all existing matter, energy, and space considered as a whole; cosmos","c":"宇宙；全人類","s":"Astronomers use giant space telescopes orbiting Earth to study distant galaxies and discover the mysterious secrets of the vast universe.","t":"天文學家使用環繞地球運行的巨型太空望遠鏡研究遙遠的星系，發現浩瀚宇宙的神祕秘密。"}]},{"unit":30,"theme":"Natural Landscapes, Bodies of Water & Coastal Geography","cards":[{"w":"nature","p":"n.","d":"the physical world including plants, animals, and landscapes","c":"大自然；自然界；天性","s":"Spending a quiet weekend camping in the national park allows city residents to reconnect with the peace of nature.","t":"在國家公園度過安靜的露營週末，使城市居民能夠重新連結大自然的寧靜。"},{"w":"natural","p":"adj.","d":"existing in or caused by nature; not made or caused by humankind","c":"自然的；天然的；天生的","s":"The remote tropical island is completely surrounded by pristine natural coral reefs teeming with colorful exotic fish.","t":"這座偏遠的熱帶島嶼完全被未受破壞的天然珊瑚礁環繞，裡面充滿了色彩斑斕的奇異魚類。"},{"w":"ocean","p":"n.","d":"a very large expanse of sea, in particular each of the main areas","c":"海洋；大洋","s":"A great white shark swam gracefully beneath the surface of the Pacific ocean, hunting for seals near the coastal islands.","t":"一隻大白鯊在太平洋海面下優雅地游動，在沿海島嶼附近獵食海豹。"},{"w":"shore","p":"n.","d":"the land along the edge of a sea, lake, or other large body of water","c":"岸；濱；海岸","s":"Children took off their sandals and walked along the sandy lake shore, collecting smooth pebbles and shiny seashells in buckets.","t":"孩子們脫下涼鞋，沿著沙質湖岸漫步，把光滑的鵝卵石和閃亮的貝殼收集在水桶裡。"},{"w":"coast","p":"n.","d":"the part of the land near the sea; the edge of the land","c":"海岸；沿岸地區","s":"The eastern coast of Taiwan features dramatic rocky cliffs rising steeply from the sparkling deep blue waters.","t":"台灣東部海岸以從閃爍深藍海水中陡峭拔起的壯麗岩石峭壁為特色。"},{"w":"stream","p":"n. / v.","d":"a small, narrow river of water; continuous flow of liquid","c":"小溪；溪流；流動","s":"Hikers filled their reusable aluminum bottles with cold fresh water running down from the clean alpine mountain stream.","t":"登山客用乾淨的高山小溪流淌而下的冰涼清泉，裝滿了他們的可重複使用鋁製水壺。"},{"w":"waterfall","p":"n.","d":"a cascade of water falling from a height, formed when a river falls steeply","c":"瀑布","s":"Tourists took pictures of the breathtaking mountain waterfall, whose thundering white spray formed a vibrant rainbow in the sun.","t":"遊客拍攝了令人驚嘆的高山瀑布，其轟鳴的白色水花在陽光下形成了一道生動的彩虹。"},{"w":"pool","p":"n.","d":"a small body of still water; an artificial swimming pool","c":"水池；游泳池","s":"After swimming ten laps in the outdoor Olympic pool, Mark rested on a lounge chair beside the cool blue water.","t":"在室外奧林匹克游泳池游了十趟之後，馬克在冰涼碧藍池水旁的休閒椅上休息。"},{"w":"pond","p":"n.","d":"a small body of still water formed naturally or hollowing out","c":"池塘","s":"Green frogs croaked loudly among the blooming water lilies floating on the surface of the quiet farm pond.","t":"在靜謐農場池塘水面上漂浮的盛開睡蓮叢中，綠色的青蛙大聲地鳴叫著。"},{"w":"wave","p":"n. / v.","d":"a ridge of water moving on the surface of water; to move the hand","c":"海浪；波浪；揮手","s":"Surfers paddled their boards into the sea, waiting patiently for a massive ocean wave to carry them back to the beach.","t":"衝浪客將衝浪板划向海中，耐心等待一股巨大的海浪將他們載回海灘。"}]},{"unit":31,"theme":"Landforms, Forest Ecology & Natural Resources","cards":[{"w":"desert","p":"n. / v.","d":"a large dry area with very little rain; to leave behind","c":"沙漠；拋棄","s":"Camels can travel for several days across the hot desert without drinking water, but inexperienced tourists should never travel alone.","t":"駱駝可以在炎熱的沙漠中行走數天而不喝水，但缺乏經驗的遊客絕不應單獨旅行。"},{"w":"forest","p":"n.","d":"a large area of land covered with trees and wild plants","c":"森林","s":"The hikers walked along the mountain trail into the green forest, where many wild animals and singing birds live peacefully.","t":"健行者沿著山徑走進綠意盎然的森林，許多野生動物和歌唱的鳥類在那裡平靜地生活。"},{"w":"wood","p":"n.","d":"the hard material from tree trunks; a small forest","c":"木頭；樹林","s":"My grandfather built this sturdy dining table out of solid wood, and it has lasted in our house for over thirty years.","t":"我的祖父用實木打造了這張堅固的餐桌，它在我們家裡已經使用了超過三十年。"},{"w":"plant","p":"n. / v.","d":"a living organism grown in earth; to put seeds or plants into soil","c":"植物；種植","s":"Every spring my mother likes to plant colorful flowers in the garden, and she waters them carefully every morning.","t":"每年春天我媽媽喜歡在花園裡種植色彩繽紛的花朵，而且她每天早晨都細心地給它們澆水。"},{"w":"root","p":"n.","d":"the part of a plant that grows underground for water and support","c":"根部；根源","s":"The old banyan tree fell during the heavy typhoon because its root was not deep enough in the sandy ground.","t":"那棵老榕樹在強烈颱風中倒塌了，因為它的根部在沙質土壤中不夠深。"},{"w":"seed","p":"n.","d":"a small hard part produced by a plant that can grow into a new plant","c":"種子","s":"The farmer scattered pumpkin seed across the freshly plowed soil, and he hoped for gentle rain during the coming weekend.","t":"農夫把南瓜種子播撒在剛犁好的泥土上，並期望即將到來的週末能下起溫和的小雨。"},{"w":"rock","p":"n. / v.","d":"a large hard piece of stone; to move gently backwards and forwards","c":"岩石；搖晃","s":"The brave climber stood firmly on the huge gray rock, and he enjoyed the breathtaking sunrise above the cloudy valley.","t":"勇敢的登山者穩穩地站在巨大的灰色岩石上，並欣賞雲霧繚繞的山谷上方令人屏息的日出。"},{"w":"stone","p":"n. / v.","d":"a hard solid mineral substance found in the ground","c":"石頭；石材","s":"Local workers constructed a high stone wall around the ancient castle to protect the villagers from strong coastal winds.","t":"當地的工人們在古堡周圍建造了一堵高大的石頭圍牆，以保護村民免受強烈海風的侵襲。"},{"w":"sand","p":"n.","d":"tiny grains of broken rock found on beaches and in deserts","c":"沙子","s":"The happy children took off their shoes and ran across the golden sand, and they built several tall castles near the sea.","t":"快樂的孩子們脫下鞋子跑過金黃色的沙子，並在海邊建造了幾座高高的城堡。"},{"w":"valley","p":"n.","d":"a low area of land between hills or mountains, often with a river","c":"山谷；溪谷","s":"A clear freshwater river flows through the peaceful green valley, and local farmers grow sweet apples along both riverbanks.","t":"一條清澈的淡水河流淌過寧靜綠色的山谷，當地農民在兩側河岸種植甜蘋果。"}]},{"unit":32,"theme":"Countryside, Physical Terrain & Local Environments","cards":[{"w":"field","p":"n.","d":"an area of open land planted with crops or pasture","c":"田野；田地；領域","s":"The hardworking farmers were harvesting ripe golden wheat in the large field, and they worked until sunset.","t":"勤勞的農民們在大田地裡收割成熟的金黃色小麥，而且他們一直工作到日落。"},{"w":"plain","p":"n. / adj.","d":"a large flat area of land; simple and not decorated","c":"平原；樸素的","s":"Large herds of wild animals run freely across the vast grassy plain, which spreads for hundreds of miles.","t":"大群野生動物在遼闊廣袤的草質平原上自由奔跑，該平原向外延伸了數百英里。"},{"w":"mud","p":"n.","d":"wet, soft earth formed by mixing soil and water","c":"泥巴；泥濘","s":"Heavy rain turned the dirt playground into sticky brown mud, so all the school children had to play inside.","t":"大雨將泥土操場變成了黏稠的褐色泥巴，所以所有小學生都必須在室內玩耍。"},{"w":"hole","p":"n.","d":"an empty space in an object or opening in the ground","c":"洞穴；孔洞","s":"The clever little rabbit dug a deep hole under the wooden fence to escape from the neighbor's barking dog.","t":"聰明的小兔子在木柵欄下挖了一個深洞，以逃避鄰居家狂吠的狗。"},{"w":"environment","p":"n.","d":"the natural world in which people, animals, and plants live","c":"自然環境","s":"Everyone should reduce plastic waste to protect our natural environment, or future generations will face serious pollution.","t":"每個人都應該減少塑膠垃圾以保護我們的自然環境，否則未來世代將面臨嚴重的污染。"},{"w":"area","p":"n.","d":"a particular region or part of a town, country, or space","c":"地區；區域","s":"The city government built several new public parks in this residential area, making life much more pleasant for families.","t":"市政府在這個住宅區域建造了幾座新的公園，讓各個家庭的生活變得更加愜意。"},{"w":"spot","p":"n. / v.","d":"a particular place; a small mark; to see or notice","c":"地點；污漬；發現","s":"We found a quiet shady spot under a huge oak tree, where our family enjoyed a wonderful afternoon picnic.","t":"我們在一棵大橡樹下找到了一個安靜陰涼的地點，我們全家人在那裡享用了美好的午後野餐。"},{"w":"corner","p":"n.","d":"the place where two walls, lines, or streets meet","c":"角落；街角","s":"There is a friendly convenience store located on the street corner, and it is open twenty-four hours every day.","t":"在街道街角坐落著一家親切的便利商店，而且它每天二十四小時營業。"},{"w":"county","p":"n.","d":"an administrative division of a country or state","c":"郡；縣","s":"My grandparents have lived in this quiet farming county for sixty years, and they know almost every neighbor here.","t":"我的祖父母在這個安靜的農業縣居住了一甲子，而且他們幾乎認識這裡的每一位鄰居。"},{"w":"countryside","p":"n.","d":"land outside of cities and towns, with fields and farms","c":"鄉村；鄉下","s":"Many city residents enjoy driving out to the green countryside on weekends to breathe fresh air and escape busy crowds.","t":"許多城市居民喜歡在週末開車前往綠意盎然的鄉村，以呼吸新鮮空氣並遠離繁忙擁擠的人群。"}]},{"unit":33,"theme":"Community, Environmental Protection & Local Industry","cards":[{"w":"local","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to a particular area or neighborhood","c":"當地的；本地人","s":"The friendly local residents welcomed foreign visitors warmly, and they shared traditional homemade snacks with everyone.","t":"友善的當地居民熱情地歡迎外國訪客，並且與每個人分享傳統的手工自製點心。"},{"w":"overseas","p":"adv. / adj.","d":"in or to a foreign country across the sea","c":"在海外；海外的","s":"After graduating from high school, Emily plans to study overseas in England to improve her English language skills.","t":"高中畢業之後，艾蜜莉計劃前往英國海外留學，以提升她的英語語言能力。"},{"w":"neighbor","p":"n.","d":"a person living near or next door to someone","c":"鄰居","s":"Our next-door neighbor is a kind retired teacher who always helps water our plants when we go on vacation.","t":"我們的隔壁鄰居是一位和藹的退休老師，當我們去度假時總是幫忙替我們的植物澆水。"},{"w":"pollute","p":"v.","d":"to make air, water, or soil dirty and harmful to life","c":"污染","s":"Chemical factories must not pollute the river with untreated waste, or thousands of fish will die in the water.","t":"化學工廠絕不可用未經處理的廢棄物污染河流，否則水中成千上萬的魚群將會死亡。"},{"w":"pollution","p":"n.","d":"damage caused to water, air, or land by harmful substances","c":"污染（名詞）","s":"Heavy traffic in big cities creates severe air pollution, causing serious breathing problems for young children and elderly people.","t":"大城市的擁擠交通造成了嚴重的空氣污染，導致幼童與年長者嚴重的呼吸道問題。"},{"w":"recycle","p":"v.","d":"to collect and treat rubbish to produce useful materials again","c":"資源回收；循環再造","s":"Students are encouraged to recycle used paper and plastic bottles, which greatly helps reduce garbage in our school.","t":"學生們受到鼓勵要回收廢紙與塑膠瓶，這極大有助於減少我們學校裡的垃圾量。"},{"w":"industry","p":"n.","d":"economic activity concerned with processing raw materials and manufacturing","c":"工業；產業","s":"Taiwan is world-famous for its advanced semiconductor industry, which supplies vital computer chips to tech companies everywhere.","t":"台灣以其先進的半導體產業聞名全球，為各地的科技公司供應至關重要的電腦晶片。"},{"w":"noisy","p":"adj.","d":"making a lot of loud or unpleasant noise","c":"喧鬧的；吵雜的","s":"The downtown night market was very crowded and noisy, but we enjoyed eating delicious local street food there.","t":"市中心的夜市非常擁擠且喧鬧，但我們在那裡吃著美味的當地街頭小吃非常開心。"},{"w":"poison","p":"n. / v.","d":"a substance that causes illness or death when absorbed; to harm with it","c":"毒藥；毒害","s":"Store all household cleaning chemicals in high locked cabinets so curious young children do not accidentally drink dangerous poison.","t":"將所有家用清潔化學品存放在高處上鎖的櫥櫃中，以免好奇的年幼孩童不小心喝下危險的毒藥。"},{"w":"excellent","p":"adj.","d":"extremely good; outstanding","c":"優秀的；卓越的","s":"Grace received an excellent grade on her final science project because she worked diligently on it every single day.","t":"葛瑞絲在她的期末科學專題中獲得了優秀的成績，因為她每一天都極其勤勉地投入其中。"}]},{"unit":34,"theme":"Insects, Small Creatures & Household Pets","cards":[{"w":"ant","p":"n.","d":"a tiny insect that lives in highly organized colonies underground","c":"螞蟻","s":"A long line of tiny black ants worked together tirelessly to carry bread crumbs back to their underground nest.","t":"一長隊小黑螞蟻不知疲倦地齊心協力，把麵包屑搬回地下的蟻巢。"},{"w":"bug","p":"n. / v.","d":"any small insect; an error in software; to annoy someone","c":"小蟲；臭蟲；打擾","s":"During warm summer nights, many flying bugs gather around the porch light, so we keep the screen door shut.","t":"在溫暖的夏夜裡，許多飛蟲聚集在門廊燈周圍，所以我們把紗門緊閉。"},{"w":"butterfly","p":"n.","d":"an insect with four large, usually brightly colored wings","c":"蝴蝶","s":"A colorful butterfly landed gently on the blooming rose petal, fluttering its delicate wings in the morning sunshine.","t":"一隻五彩斑斕的蝴蝶輕輕停在盛開的玫瑰花瓣上，在晨光中輕輕拍動著嬌嫩的翅膀。"},{"w":"cockroach","p":"n.","d":"a large brown insect commonly found in houses and kitchens","c":"蟑螂","s":"When I switched on the kitchen light at midnight, an ugly brown cockroach scurried quickly behind the refrigerator.","t":"半夜我打開廚房電燈時，一隻難看的褐色蟑螂迅速竄到了冰箱後面躲藏。"},{"w":"insect","p":"n.","d":"a small creature with six legs and usually two pairs of wings","c":"昆蟲","s":"The biology teacher showed students how an insect breathes through tiny holes on the sides of its body.","t":"生物老師向學生們展示了一隻昆蟲如何透過身體兩側的微小氣孔來進行呼吸。"},{"w":"mosquito","p":"n.","d":"a small flying insect that bites skin to drink blood","c":"蚊子","s":"Remember to apply bug spray before walking near the swamp, or a hungry mosquito will bite your bare arms.","t":"走在沼澤附近前請記得噴防蚊液，否則飢餓的蚊子會叮咬你裸露的手臂。"},{"w":"snail","p":"n.","d":"a small soft creature with a spiral shell that moves slowly","c":"蝸牛","s":"After the afternoon rain shower, a little snail slid slowly across the wet garden wall leaving a shiny trail.","t":"午後陣雨過後，一隻小蝸牛在潮濕的花園圍牆上緩慢滑行，留下一道閃亮的黏液痕跡。"},{"w":"spider","p":"n.","d":"an eight-legged creature that spins silk webs to catch prey","c":"蜘蛛","s":"A patient spider spun an intricate circular web between two tree branches to catch flying flies for food.","t":"一隻有耐心的蜘蛛在兩根樹枝間織出了一張複雜精緻的圓形網，用來捕食飛蠅充飢。"},{"w":"kitten","p":"n.","d":"a young baby cat","c":"小貓；幼貓","s":"Our pet cat gave birth to four adorable kittens, and they spent all morning playing with a ball of wool.","t":"我們的寵物貓生下了四隻可愛的幼貓，牠們整個早晨都在玩一顆毛線球。"},{"w":"puppy","p":"n.","d":"a young baby dog","c":"小狗；幼犬","s":"For my brother's tenth birthday, grandfather brought home a fluffy golden retriever puppy that wagged its tail happily.","t":"在弟弟十歲生日時，祖父帶回家一隻毛茸茸且開心搖著尾巴的黃金獵犬幼犬。"}]},{"unit":35,"theme":"Marine Animals, Waterfowl & Farm Birds","cards":[{"w":"dolphin","p":"n.","d":"a highly intelligent sea mammal with a curved beak and blowhole","c":"海豚","s":"A playful dolphin leapt gracefully out of the sparkling blue waves, thrilling all the tourists on the cruise boat.","t":"一隻愛玩的海豚優雅地躍出閃爍蔚藍的海浪，讓遊輪上的所有遊客雀躍不已。"},{"w":"whale","p":"n.","d":"a very large sea mammal that breathes air through a blowhole","c":"鯨魚","s":"The blue whale is the largest animal on Earth, and it migrates thousands of miles across polar oceans.","t":"藍鯨是地球上體型最大的動物，牠會在極地海洋間進行長達數千英里的遷徙。"},{"w":"shark","p":"n.","d":"a large predatory fish with sharp teeth and a prominent dorsal fin","c":"鯊魚","s":"When the lifeguards spotted a large shark swimming near the crowded shore, they ordered all swimmers out of the water.","t":"當救生員發現一條大型鯊魚在擁擠的海岸附近游動時，他們立刻命令所有泳客離開水面。"},{"w":"shrimp","p":"n.","d":"a small edible sea creature with a soft shell and long legs","c":"蝦子","s":"The night market food vendor fried fresh shrimp with garlic and pepper, creating a mouth-watering aroma.","t":"夜市的熟食攤販用大蒜和胡椒熱炒新鮮的蝦子，散發出一股令人垂涎欲滴的香氣。"},{"w":"crab","p":"n.","d":"a sea creature with a hard flat shell and ten legs, including two large pincers","c":"螃蟹","s":"A small red crab walked sideways across the wet sand, using its sharp claws to catch tiny morsels.","t":"一隻紅色的小螃蟹在濕潤的沙灘上橫著行走，用牠鋒利的雙螯捕捉細小的食物碎屑。"},{"w":"turtle","p":"n.","d":"a slow-moving reptile with a hard bony shell protecting its body","c":"烏龜；海龜","s":"A green sea turtle crawled slowly up onto the sandy beach at night to lay dozens of round white eggs.","t":"一隻綠蠵龜在夜間緩慢爬上沙灘，在沙坑中產下了數十顆圓形的白卵。"},{"w":"duck","p":"n.","d":"a common water bird with webbed feet and a broad flat beak","c":"鴨子","s":"A mother duck led her six fluffy yellow ducklings across the calm pond, quacking softly to keep them close.","t":"一隻鴨媽媽帶著她六隻毛茸茸的黃色小鴨橫渡平靜的池塘，輕聲嘎嘎叫著以讓牠們跟緊。"},{"w":"goose","p":"n.","d":"a large water bird with a long neck, larger than a duck","c":"鵝（複數為 geese）","s":"A flock of wild geese flew overhead in a neat V-shaped pattern as cold winter approached the northern lakes.","t":"寒冬逼近北方湖泊之際，一群野生鵝在上空以整齊的V字隊形向南方振翅翱翔。"},{"w":"swan","p":"n.","d":"a large graceful water bird with long neck and white feathers","c":"天鵝","s":"A beautiful white swan glided smoothly across the mirror-like lake, bending its long neck into the cool water.","t":"一隻美麗的白天鵝在如鏡面般的湖水上平穩滑行，並將修長的頸部探入清涼的水中。"},{"w":"hen","p":"n.","d":"an adult female chicken kept for producing eggs or meat","c":"母雞","s":"The farmer feeds each speckled hen with cracked corn every morning, and he collects fresh eggs every afternoon.","t":"農夫每天早晨用碎玉米餵養每一隻斑紋母雞，並且在每天下午收集新鮮的雞蛋。"}]},{"unit":36,"theme":"Wild Animals, Forest Creatures & Zoo Mammals","cards":[{"w":"turkey","p":"n.","d":"a large American bird with naked head and tail feathers, eaten as food","c":"火雞","s":"American families traditionally roast a large stuffed turkey for dinner on Thanksgiving Day every November.","t":"美國家庭傳統上在每年十一月的感恩節晚餐時，都會烤一隻碩大且塞滿餡料的火雞。"},{"w":"frog","p":"n.","d":"a tailless amphibious creature with long legs for jumping and a croak","c":"青蛙","s":"A small green frog hopped quickly off the broad lily pad into the pond when a snake came near.","t":"當一條蛇靠近時，一隻綠色小青蛙迅速從寬大的荷葉上跳進了池塘裡。"},{"w":"kangaroo","p":"n.","d":"a large Australian herbivore that moves by leaping with strong hind legs","c":"袋鼠","s":"An Australian mother kangaroo carried her tiny baby inside her front pouch while hopping across the dry grassy plains.","t":"一隻澳洲袋鼠媽媽在乾草平原上跳躍前進時，在前腹的育兒袋裡懷抱著她的小寶寶。"},{"w":"wolf","p":"n.","d":"a wild predatory canine that hunts cooperatively in a pack","c":"狼（複數為 wolves）","s":"On freezing winter nights, a hungry pack of gray wolves howled eerily at the full moon across the snowy valley.","t":"在酷寒的冬夜裡，一群飢餓的灰狼隔著積雪覆蓋的山谷，對著滿月發出令人毛骨悚然的嚎叫。"},{"w":"fox","p":"n.","d":"a small carnivorous canine with a bushy tail and a clever, sneaky reputation","c":"狐狸","s":"A clever red fox stole silently into the chicken coop after midnight and caught two fat roosting hens.","t":"一隻聰明伶俐的紅狐狸在半夜悄悄溜進雞舍，抓走了兩隻肥胖停棲的母雞。"},{"w":"panda","p":"n.","d":"a large black-and-white bear native to China that feeds on bamboo","c":"熊貓；大貓熊","s":"The chubby giant panda sat quietly on the grassy zoo lawn, munching happily on fresh green bamboo stalks.","t":"圓滾滾的大貓熊安靜地坐在動物園的草坪上，津津有味地大口啃食著新鮮翠綠的竹莖。"},{"w":"koala","p":"n.","d":"an Australian tree-dwelling marsupial with gray fur that eats eucalyptus leaves","c":"無尾熊","s":"A sleepy gray koala clung tightly to the tall eucalyptus tree branch and dozed peacefully under the warm sun.","t":"一隻睡眼惺忪的灰色無尾熊緊緊抱住高高的尤加利樹枝，在溫暖的陽光下安詳打盹。"},{"w":"donkey","p":"n.","d":"a domesticated hoofed mammal related to the horse, with long ears","c":"驢子","s":"The stubborn brown donkey refused to move forward along the steep mountain path until the farmer offered it a juicy apple.","t":"那隻頑固的褐色驢子拒絕沿著陡峭山徑往前走，直到農夫遞給牠一顆多汁的蘋果才肯邁步。"},{"w":"zebra","p":"n.","d":"an African wild horse with distinct black and white vertical stripes","c":"斑馬","s":"A herd of African zebras stood close together near the waterhole, their black and white stripes confusing watching predators.","t":"一群非洲斑馬在水坑邊緊緊聚集在一起，牠們的黑白條紋讓伺機而動的掠食者眼花撩亂。"},{"w":"hippopotamus","p":"n.","d":"a huge thick-skinned African mammal that lives mostly in rivers","c":"河馬","s":"The massive gray hippopotamus submerged its heavy body in the muddy river, keeping only its eyes and nostrils above water.","t":"龐大的灰色河馬將沉重的身軀浸泡在泥濘的河水中，僅僅把眼睛和鼻孔露出水面。"}]},{"unit":37,"theme":"Mammals, Birds of Prey & Avian Anatomy","cards":[{"w":"lamb","p":"n.","d":"a young sheep; meat from a young sheep","c":"小羊；羊肉","s":"The gentle white lamb followed its mother across the green hillside, skipping playfully over small rocks.","t":"溫順的白色小羊跟著母親穿過綠色的山坡，歡快地在小石頭上方跳躍。"},{"w":"deer","p":"n.","d":"a graceful hoofed mammal with antlers on males","c":"鹿（單複數同形）","s":"A quiet wild deer stepped cautiously out from the dense pine trees to drink fresh spring water from the stream.","t":"一隻安靜的野生鹿謹慎地從茂密的松樹林中踏出步履，從溪流中飲用清澈的泉水。"},{"w":"ox","p":"n.","d":"a large domesticated bovine animal used for heavy farm work","c":"公牛；閹牛（複數為 oxen）","s":"The hardworking farmer used a strong ox to pull the heavy iron plow through the muddy paddy field.","t":"辛勤工作的農夫使用一頭強壯的公牛拉動沉重的鐵犁，翻耕泥濘的稻田。"},{"w":"rat","p":"n.","d":"a rodent resembling a large mouse with a long bare tail","c":"大老鼠","s":"The old warehouse was overrun by dirty rat, so the storage manager called a professional pest controller immediately.","t":"老舊的倉庫裡擠滿了骯髒的大老鼠，所以倉儲經理立刻打電話給專業的除蟲專家處理。"},{"w":"bat","p":"n.","d":"a nocturnal flying mammal with leathery wings; wooden club for baseball","c":"蝙蝠；球棒","s":"During the warm summer evening, hundreds of hungry bats flew out of the dark cave to hunt for flying mosquitoes.","t":"在溫暖的夏夜裡，數百隻飢餓的蝙蝠從黑暗的洞穴中飛出，在空中捕食飛蚊。"},{"w":"parrot","p":"n.","d":"a brightly colored tropical bird with a curved beak that can imitate speech","c":"鸚鵡","s":"The clever green parrot learned how to repeat several funny English phrases whenever visitors walked into the pet shop.","t":"這隻聰明的綠色鸚鵡學會了每當訪客走進寵物店時，便開口重複說出好幾句有趣的英語短句。"},{"w":"eagle","p":"n.","d":"a large bird of prey with massive hooked beak, keen eyesight, and broad wings","c":"老鷹；雕","s":"A majestic golden eagle soared high above the jagged mountain peaks, scanning the rocky ground below for small rabbits.","t":"一隻雄偉的金雕在高聳崎嶇的山峰上方翱翔，俯瞰下方的岩石地面搜尋野兔的蹤影。"},{"w":"pigeon","p":"n.","d":"a stout seed-eating bird with a small head, short legs, and cooing call","c":"鴿子","s":"Crowds of gentle gray pigeons gathered on the sunny city square, pecking eagerly at bread crumbs tossed by tourists.","t":"成群溫和的灰鴿子聚集在陽光明媚的城市廣場上，熱切地啄食著遊客拋撒下來的麵包屑。"},{"w":"swallow","p":"n. / v.","d":"a small migratory bird with forked tail; to cause food to pass down throat","c":"燕子；吞嚥","s":"Before the cold winter arrives, the agile swallow builds its mud nest under the roof tiles of our old house.","t":"在寒冷的冬天到來之前，敏捷的燕子會在我們老房子屋瓦下用泥土築巢。"},{"w":"wing","p":"n.","d":"one of the movable feathered or leathery limbs used for flying","c":"翅膀；機翼","s":"The injured wild seagull could not fly back to its coastal nest because its left wing had been hurt by fishing line.","t":"那隻受傷的野生海鷗無法飛回海岸上的巢穴，因為牠的左翅膀被釣魚線割傷了。"}]},{"unit":38,"theme":"Animal Anatomy, Ancient Beasts, Cages & Emotional States","cards":[{"w":"tail","p":"n.","d":"the flexible rear part extending from an animal's body","c":"尾巴","s":"The joyful puppy wagged its fluffy tail enthusiastically as soon as its owner walked through the front door.","t":"當主人一踏進前門時，那隻快樂的小狗便興奮熱情地搖動著牠毛茸茸的尾巴。"},{"w":"dragon","p":"n.","d":"a mythical giant reptile often depicted with wings, claws, and breathing fire","c":"龍","s":"In ancient Chinese culture, the magnificent golden dragon is a sacred symbol of royal power, prosperity, and good luck.","t":"在古代中國文化當中，雄偉的金龍是象徵皇家權力、繁榮昌盛與吉祥好運的神聖代表。"},{"w":"dinosaur","p":"n.","d":"an extinct prehistoric reptile that lived millions of years ago","c":"恐龍","s":"Children at the natural science museum were fascinated by the towering skeleton of a prehistoric carnivorous dinosaur.","t":"自然科學博物館裡的孩子們，被一具高聳巨大的史前肉食性恐龍骨架深深吸引著。"},{"w":"cage","p":"n.","d":"a structure made of bars or wire in which animals or birds are kept","c":"籠子；鳥籠","s":"Animal welfare advocates argue that wild exotic birds should never be kept confined inside a cramped metal cage.","t":"動物福祉倡導者主張，野生珍禽異鳥絕不應該被終身囚禁在狹窄冰冷的金屬籠子裡。"},{"w":"nest","p":"n.","d":"a structure built by birds or insects to lay eggs and shelter their young","c":"鳥巢；窩","s":"High in the oak tree branches, two mother robins carefully constructed a cozy mud and twig nest for their chicks.","t":"在高高的橡樹枝上，兩隻知更鳥媽媽用泥土和細枝細心築起了一個舒適的鳥巢給牠們的雛鳥。"},{"w":"emotion","p":"n.","d":"a strong feeling such as joy, sorrow, love, or anger","c":"情緒；感情","s":"When the Olympic champion stood on the medal podium, she was overwhelmed with strong emotion and wept tears of joy.","t":"當這位奧運冠軍站在獎牌頒獎台上時，她內心湧現出強烈澎湃的情緒，流下了喜悅的淚水。"},{"w":"sense","p":"n. / v.","d":"a physical faculty such as sight; a feeling; to perceive","c":"感覺；感官；理解力","s":"Dogs have an extraordinarily sharp sense of smell that allows police officers to track missing people through forests.","t":"狗狗擁有極為靈敏銳利的嗅覺感官，讓警員能夠循線在森林深處追蹤失蹤人員。"},{"w":"feeling","p":"n.","d":"an emotional state, physical sensation, or belief","c":"感覺；感受","s":"I had an uncomfortable gut feeling that something was wrong with our itinerary, so I rechecked all plane tickets.","t":"我心中升起一種隱隱不安的直覺感受，覺得我們的行程安排出了差錯，因此重新核對了所有機票。"},{"w":"asleep","p":"adj.","d":"in a state of sleep; not awake","c":"睡著的","s":"Exhausted after studying all night for the biology exam, Jason fell fast asleep at his desk with his textbook open.","t":"為了生物考試徹夜苦讀而筋疲力盡的傑森，攤開著教科書在書桌上沉沉睡著了。"},{"w":"mad","p":"adj.","d":"very angry; insane; wildly enthusiastic","c":"生氣的；瘋狂的","s":"Father was extremely mad when he discovered that my brother had broken the garage window with a baseball.","t":"當父親發現弟弟用棒球打破了車庫窗戶時，他感到極度生氣而暴跳如雷。"}]},{"unit":39,"theme":"Fear, Psychological Sensations & States of Mind","cards":[{"w":"frightened","p":"adj.","d":"afraid or anxious, often suddenly","c":"受驚嚇的；害怕的","s":"The frightened little boy hid behind his mother's winter coat when the neighbor's huge guard dog barked loudly.","t":"當鄰居巨大的看門狗大聲吠叫時，受驚嚇的小男孩躲在母親的冬衣外套後面。"},{"w":"fear","p":"n. / v.","d":"an unpleasant emotion caused by the threat of danger; to be afraid of","c":"恐懼；害怕","s":"Many young children have an intense fear of darkness, so their parents often leave a small lamp on in the bedroom.","t":"許多幼童對黑暗有著強烈的恐懼，所以他們的父母常在臥室裡留一盞小夜燈。"},{"w":"scared","p":"adj.","d":"fearful or frightened","c":"害怕的；提心吊膽的","s":"Emma felt very scared when the elevator stopped suddenly between floors, but she remembered to press the emergency bell.","t":"當電梯在樓層之間突然停止時，艾瑪感到非常害怕，但她記得按下緊急通報鈕。"},{"w":"terrible","p":"adj.","d":"extremely bad, serious, or unpleasant","c":"可怕的；糟糕的","s":"A terrible traffic accident blocked all three lanes on the highway this morning, causing hours of frustrating delay.","t":"今天早上高速公路上發生了一起嚴重的可怕車禍，阻塞了全部三個車道，造成數小時的延誤。"},{"w":"horrible","p":"adj.","d":"causing horror; dreadful or very shocking","c":"令人恐懼的；極糟的","s":"The smell coming from the abandoned trash container was truly horrible, so everyone held their noses while walking past.","t":"廢棄垃圾子車散發出來的氣味實在太令人作嘔可怕了，以至於每個人走過時都捏住了鼻子。"},{"w":"calm","p":"adj. / v.","d":"not showing or feeling anger, fear, or other strong emotions","c":"平靜的；鎮靜的","s":"The experienced flight captain remained completely calm during the turbulent storm, reassuring all nervous passengers.","t":"經驗豐富的機長在顛簸的暴風雨中保持著完全的冷靜鎮定，安撫了所有緊張的乘客。"},{"w":"nervous","p":"adj.","d":"easily agitated or alarmed; anxious about something","c":"緊張不安的","s":"Kevin always feels extremely nervous right before giving an oral presentation in front of the whole class.","t":"凱文在全班同學面前進行口頭報告之前，總是感到極度緊張不安。"},{"w":"pleased","p":"adj.","d":"feeling or showing pleasure and satisfaction","c":"感到欣慰滿意的","s":"Grandmother was very pleased when all her children and grandchildren returned home to celebrate her eightieth birthday.","t":"當所有兒孫都返回老家為她慶祝八十大壽時，祖母感到非常欣慰而滿心歡喜。"},{"w":"pleasant","p":"adj.","d":"giving a sense of happy satisfaction or enjoyment","c":"令人愉快的；宜人的","s":"We spent a very pleasant afternoon walking through the botanical park, enjoying the fragrant blooming flowers.","t":"我們在植物公園裡散步，度過了一個非常令人愉快的午後，盡情欣賞芳香盛開的繁花。"},{"w":"pleasure","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of happy satisfaction and enjoyment","c":"樂趣；榮幸","s":"It was an absolute pleasure to meet your parents at the school concert, and we hope to chat again soon.","t":"在學校音樂會上見到您的雙親真是莫大的榮幸與樂事，我們希望很快能再次暢談。"}]},{"unit":40,"theme":"Personal Character, Temperament & Moral Traits","cards":[{"w":"jealous","p":"adj.","d":"feeling envious of someone's achievements or possessions","c":"嫉妒的；吃醋的","s":"The spoiled child was intensely jealous when his classmate received a brand new bicycle for his birthday.","t":"當同學在生日那天收到一輛全新腳踏車時，那個被寵壞的孩子內心極度嫉妒眼紅。"},{"w":"envy","p":"n. / v.","d":"a feeling of discontented longing aroused by someone else's possessions","c":"羨慕；嫉妒","s":"I truly envy my best friend because she can speak four foreign languages fluently without any difficulty.","t":"我由衷羨慕我的摯友，因為她能夠毫不費力、流利地說四種外國語言。"},{"w":"curious","p":"adj.","d":"eager to know or learn something new","c":"好奇的","s":"The curious kitten poked its nose into the open shopping bag, sniffing every strange item inside inquisitively.","t":"好奇的小貓把鼻子探進敞開的購物袋裡，好奇地聞著裡面每一件陌生的物品。"},{"w":"generous","p":"adj.","d":"showing a readiness to give more of something than is strictly necessary","c":"慷慨的；大方的","s":"Uncle Robert is a very generous philanthropist who donates substantial funds to orphanages every winter.","t":"羅伯特叔叔是一位非常慷慨的慈善家，每年冬天都會向孤兒院捐贈大筆資金善款。"},{"w":"humorous","p":"adj.","d":"causing lighthearted laughter and amusement; comical","c":"幽默的；詼諧的","s":"Our English teacher always tells humorous stories about his college days, making everyone in class laugh out loud.","t":"我們的英語老師總是講述他大學時代的幽默詼諧故事，逗得全班同學大笑不止。"},{"w":"humor","p":"n.","d":"the quality of being amusing or comic","c":"幽默；幽默感","s":"Having a healthy sense of humor helps people cope with daily stress and maintain a sunny positive attitude.","t":"擁有健康的幽默感有助於人們應對日常壓力，並保持陽光正向的生活態度。"},{"w":"confident","p":"adj.","d":"feeling or showing certainty about something or one's own ability","c":"有信心的；自信的","s":"After practicing his violin solo every day for three months, Lucas felt completely confident on stage.","t":"在連續三個月每天苦練小提琴獨奏之後，盧卡斯在舞台上顯得完全充滿自信。"},{"w":"independent","p":"adj.","d":"free from outside control; not depending on another's authority","c":"獨立的；自主的","s":"Living alone in a foreign city taught Rachel how to cook, manage finances, and become truly independent.","t":"獨自生活在異國城市教會了瑞秋如何烹飪、打理財務，並成為一個真正獨立自主的人。"},{"w":"cruel","p":"adj.","d":"willfully causing pain or suffering to others without feeling mercy","c":"殘忍的；殘暴的","s":"Leaving a pet locked inside a hot car during summer is an unimaginably cruel and dangerous act.","t":"在炎熱夏天把寵物反鎖在悶熱的汽車裡，是一種難以想像的殘忍且極度危險的行為。"},{"w":"naughty","p":"adj.","d":"badly behaved; disobedient, especially of children","c":"頑皮的；淘氣的","s":"The naughty little boy hid his sister's favorite doll on top of the high refrigerator just to tease her.","t":"那個淘氣頑皮的小男孩把他妹妹最愛的洋娃娃藏在高高的冰箱頂上，只為了捉弄嘲弄她。"}]},{"unit":41,"theme":"Personal Character, Intelligence & Negative Traits","cards":[{"w":"rude","p":"adj.","d":"not polite; having bad manners toward others","c":"無禮的；粗魯的","s":"When the waiter dropped the tray, the angry customer shouted rude words, but everyone else remained calm and polite.","t":"當服務生打翻托盤時，憤怒的顧客大聲說出無禮的話語，但其他人都保持冷靜與禮貌。"},{"w":"unique","p":"adj.","d":"being the only one of its kind; very special","c":"獨特的；獨一無二的","s":"The small island has its own unique wildlife and culture, so thousands of scientists travel there to study each year.","t":"這座小島擁有其獨特的野生動植物與文化，因此每年都有成千上萬的科學家前往研究。"},{"w":"selfish","p":"adj.","d":"caring only about oneself and not about other people","c":"自私的","s":"The greedy boy refused to share his toys with his cousins, and his selfish behavior made everyone at the party feel unhappy.","t":"那個貪婪的男孩拒絕與他的表兄弟分享玩具，他的自私行為讓派對上的每個人都不開心。"},{"w":"stingy","p":"adj.","d":"unwilling to spend money or share things; mean","c":"小氣的；吝嗇的","s":"Although Mr. Davis earned a high salary at the bank, he was so stingy that he never bought gifts for his children.","t":"雖然戴維斯先生在銀行領取高薪，但他非常小氣，從不給他的孩子們買禮物。"},{"w":"greedy","p":"adj.","d":"wanting more money, food, or power than one needs","c":"貪婪的；貪心的","s":"The businessman was so greedy for wealth that he took illegal shortcuts, and he eventually lost everything he had owned.","t":"那位商人對財富如此貪婪，以至於採取非法捷徑，最終失去了他所擁有的一切。"},{"w":"clever","p":"adj.","d":"quick at learning and understanding things; skillful","c":"聰明的；機敏的","s":"The young detective found several clues in the quiet room, and her clever analysis helped the police catch the thief quickly.","t":"年輕女偵探在安靜的房間裡發現了幾條線索，她機敏的分析幫助警方迅速抓獲了小偷。"},{"w":"intelligent","p":"adj.","d":"having a high ability to learn, think, and understand","c":"有聰明才智的；有靈性的","s":"Dolphins are known to be highly intelligent marine animals, and they can easily communicate with one another using special sounds.","t":"海豚被公認為極富聰明才智的海洋動物，牠們能使用特殊的聲音輕鬆地相互交流。"},{"w":"diligent","p":"adj.","d":"showing care and steady effort in work or studies","c":"勤勉的；用功的","s":"Mary was a diligent student throughout high school, so she always reviewed her lessons every night and passed all exams.","t":"瑪麗在整個高中階段都是一名勤勉的學生，因此她每晚總是複習功課並通過了所有考試。"},{"w":"fool","p":"n. / v.","d":"a person without good sense; to trick someone","c":"傻瓜；愚人；愚弄","s":"Kevin pretended that he was completely sick to avoid the test, but he could not fool his experienced teacher for a minute.","t":"凱文假裝自己完全生病以逃避考試，但他連一分鐘都無法愚弄他經驗豐富的老師。"},{"w":"foolish","p":"adj.","d":"lacking good sense or judgment; silly","c":"愚蠢的；不明智的","s":"It was very foolish of Tom to drive in such heavy snow, and his car slid off the road into a ditch.","t":"湯姆在如此大雪中開車是非常愚蠢的，他的車子滑出了道路衝進了水溝。"}]},{"unit":42,"theme":"Moral Character, Politeness & Sense of Responsibility","cards":[{"w":"stupid","p":"adj.","d":"showing a lack of good judgment, sense, or thought","c":"愚蠢的；笨拙的","s":"Don't do such a stupid thing again, and always think carefully about the consequences before you act.","t":"別再做這種愚蠢的事情了，在行動之前一定要仔細考慮後果。"},{"w":"silly","p":"adj.","d":"foolish, childish, or not serious","c":"傻氣的；糊塗的","s":"The two sisters had a silly argument over who should wear the pink dress, but they made up after five minutes.","t":"兩姐妹為了誰該穿那件粉色連衣裙發生了糊塗的爭吵，但五分鐘後她們就和好了。"},{"w":"royal","p":"adj.","d":"relating to or belonging to a king, queen, or royal family","c":"皇室的；國王的","s":"Thousands of enthusiastic citizens gathered outside the palace to watch the spectacular royal parade pass by.","t":"成千上萬熱情的市民聚集在宮殿外，觀看壯觀的皇室遊行隊伍經過。"},{"w":"honesty","p":"n.","d":"the quality of being truthful, trustworthy, and fair","c":"誠實；正直","s":"My grandfather taught me that honesty is the best policy in life, and you will always earn respect by telling the truth.","t":"我的祖父教導我誠實是人生上策，而你說實話總能贏得別人的尊重。"},{"w":"dishonest","p":"adj.","d":"not honest; intending to trick or lie to people","c":"不誠實的；欺騙的","s":"The company fired the dishonest accountant immediately, because he stole money from the firm's bank account for months.","t":"公司立刻解雇了那名不誠實的會計師，因為他數月來一直從公司銀行帳戶盜取資金。"},{"w":"sincere","p":"adj.","d":"honest, genuine, and not pretending","c":"真誠的；由衷的","s":"He wrote a very sincere apology letter to his best friend, and she happily forgave him for his thoughtless mistake.","t":"他給最好的朋友寫了一封非常真誠的道歉信，她高興地原諒了他輕率的錯誤。"},{"w":"impolite","p":"adj.","d":"rude; not showing good manners toward others","c":"不禮貌的；粗魯的","s":"Leaving the dinner party without saying goodbye to the host is considered very impolite, so please stay until the dessert is served.","t":"未向主人告別就離開晚宴被認為是非常不禮貌的，所以請留下來直到甜點端上來。"},{"w":"humble","p":"adj.","d":"not proud or boastful; modest about one's abilities","c":"謙虛的；不起眼的","s":"Even after winning the Nobel Prize in physics, the elderly professor remained very humble and continued to mentor young students.","t":"即使在獲得諾貝爾物理學獎之後，那位年邁的教授依然非常謙虛，並繼續指導年輕學生。"},{"w":"responsible","p":"adj.","d":"having the obligation to take care of something; reliable","c":"負責任的；承擔責任的","s":"Every driver is personally responsible for following traffic regulations, so you must always stop when the traffic light turns red.","t":"每位駕駛人都有責任遵守交通法規，因此當交通號誌變紅時，你必須隨時停車。"},{"w":"duty","p":"n.","d":"a moral or legal obligation; something one must do","c":"職責；責任；義務","s":"It is the primary duty of police officers to protect citizens from harm and maintain peace throughout the city.","t":"警官的首要職責是保護市民免受傷害，並維持全城的安寧。"}]},{"unit":43,"theme":"Physical Appearance, Temperament & Behavior","cards":[{"w":"sneaky","p":"adj.","d":"doing things in a secret and often dishonest way","c":"鬼鬼祟祟的；狡猾的","s":"The cat made a sneaky approach across the kitchen floor, but the clever mouse escaped into its hole just in time.","t":"那隻貓在廚房地板上鬼鬼祟祟地靠近，但那隻聰明的老鼠及時逃進了洞裡。"},{"w":"evil","p":"adj. / n.","d":"morally bad, cruel, or causing harm; wickedness","c":"邪惡的；罪惡","s":"In many classic fairy tales, a brave knight fights against an evil dragon to protect innocent villagers.","t":"在許多經典童話故事中，英勇的騎士與邪惡的巨龍搏鬥，以保護無辜的村民。"},{"w":"wild","p":"adj.","d":"living in natural conditions; not tamed; uncontrolled","c":"野生的；狂野的","s":"When we walked deep into the mountain national park, we saw several wild horses grazing peacefully on the green slope.","t":"當我們深入走進高山國家公園時，我們看見幾匹野馬在綠色山坡上平靜地吃草。"},{"w":"gentle","p":"adj.","d":"calm, kind, and soft; not rough or violent","c":"溫和的；溫柔的","s":"The nurse had a very gentle touch when she cleaned the little baby's wound, so the child never cried at all.","t":"護士在清理小嬰兒的傷口時動作非常溫柔，所以孩子一點也沒有哭泣。"},{"w":"gentleman","p":"n.","d":"a polite, gracious, and honorable man","c":"紳士；有教養的男士","s":"Mr. White is a true gentleman who always holds the elevator door open for elderly neighbors and speaks respectfully.","t":"懷特先生是一位真正的紳士，他總是為年長的鄰居按住電梯門並恭敬地說話。"},{"w":"talkative","p":"adj.","d":"tending to talk a lot in social situations","c":"健談的；愛說話的","s":"My cousin is extremely talkative whenever we meet at family reunions, and she can talk about fashion for hours.","t":"每當我們在家族聚會上見面時，我的表妹都極其健談，她可以聊時尚聊上好幾個小時。"},{"w":"chubby","p":"adj.","d":"pleasantly fat and rounded, especially of children","c":"圓胖的；豐滿可愛的","s":"The six-month-old baby had chubby cheeks and bright sparkling eyes, so everyone in the room wanted to hug him.","t":"那個六個月大的嬰兒有著胖嘟嘟的臉頰和明亮的大眼睛，所以房間裡的每個人都想抱他。"},{"w":"skinny","p":"adj.","d":"very thin, often too thin or bony","c":"消瘦的；骨瘦如柴的","s":"After suffering from a high fever for two whole weeks, the poor boy looked pale and remarkably skinny.","t":"在連續發高燒整整兩週之後，那個可憐的男孩看起來臉色蒼白且非常消瘦。"},{"w":"slender","p":"adj.","d":"gracefully thin, slim, and attractive","c":"修長的；苗條優雅的","s":"The talented pianist has long, slender fingers that glide smoothly across the black and white piano keys.","t":"那位天才鋼琴家具備修長而優雅的手指，在黑白琴鍵上流暢地滑動。"},{"w":"slim","p":"adj.","d":"attractively thin; slender in build; slight","c":"苗條的；纖細的","s":"By exercising regularly and following a balanced diet, Amanda managed to maintain a healthy and slim figure.","t":"透過定期運動與均衡飲食，阿曼達成功保持了健康且苗條的身材。"}]},{"unit":44,"theme":"Human Beings, Aesthetics, Competition & Conflict","cards":[{"w":"lovely","p":"adj.","d":"attractive, delightful, or very pleasant","c":"可愛的；美好的","s":"The small mountain town looked very lovely in the autumn morning, and many tourists took wonderful pictures of the scenery.","t":"這座山區小鎮在秋天早晨看起來非常美好，許多遊客拍攝了絕妙的風景照片。"},{"w":"ugly","p":"adj.","d":"unpleasant to look at; not attractive","c":"醜陋的；難看的","s":"The old factory building was dirty and ugly, so the city council decided to rebuild it into a modern art center.","t":"那棟舊工廠建築又髒又醜陋，因此市議會決定將其改建為一座現代藝術中心。"},{"w":"winner","p":"n.","d":"a person or team that wins a game or competition","c":"贏家；勝利者","s":"When the final whistle blew, the captain of the football team stepped forward to receive the gold trophy as the proud winner.","t":"當終場哨聲響起時，足球隊隊長走上前去，作為自豪的贏家接過黃金獎盃。"},{"w":"loser","p":"n.","d":"a person or team that is defeated in a competition","c":"輸家；失敗者","s":"Nobody enjoys being the loser in a competitive match, but good sportsmanship teaches us to respect our opponents.","t":"在激烈的比賽中沒有人喜歡當失敗者，但良好的運動家精神教會我們要尊重對手。"},{"w":"race","p":"n. / v.","d":"a running contest of speed; ethnic group; to compete","c":"賽跑；競賽；種族；狂奔","s":"Hundreds of athletic students gathered on the school track to participate in the exciting annual relay race.","t":"數百名熱愛運動的學生聚集在學校跑道上，參加令人興奮的年度接力賽跑。"},{"w":"human","p":"n. / adj.","d":"a person; characteristic of people","c":"人類；人；人類的","s":"Unlike most animals, human beings have the unique ability to create complex languages and record history.","t":"與大多數動物不同，人類具備創造複雜語言並記錄歷史的獨特能力。"},{"w":"soul","p":"n.","d":"the spiritual or immaterial part of a human being","c":"靈魂；精神；心靈","s":"Listening to classical piano music late at night brought peaceful comfort to her tired soul after a long workday.","t":"深夜聆聽古典鋼琴音樂，為她漫長工作日後疲憊的心靈帶來了平靜的安慰。"},{"w":"monster","p":"n.","d":"a cruel, frightening, or imaginary creature","c":"怪獸；怪物","s":"The scary movie featured a giant green monster that rose from the deep ocean and terrified the peaceful city.","t":"那部恐怖電影描繪了一隻從深海中爬出並驚嚇寧靜城市的巨大綠色怪獸。"},{"w":"war","p":"n.","d":"armed fighting between countries or groups","c":"戰爭","s":"Peaceful negotiations were held between leaders, because nobody wanted a destructive war to ruin both nations.","t":"各國領袖之間舉行了和平談判，因為沒有人希望一場具毀滅性的戰爭摧毀兩個國家。"},{"w":"army","p":"n.","d":"a large, organized military force for fighting on land","c":"陸軍；軍隊","s":"After completing his university degree, Samuel decided to join the national army and serve his country proudly.","t":"完成大學學業後，塞繆爾決定加入國家陸軍並自豪地為國效力。"}]},{"unit":45,"theme":"Armed Forces, Warfare & National Defense","cards":[{"w":"military","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to the armed forces; soldiers collectively","c":"軍事的；軍隊","s":"All young citizens in that country must complete one year of compulsory military service after high school.","t":"該國的所有年輕公民在高中畢業後都必須完成一年的義務軍事服役。"},{"w":"soldier","p":"n.","d":"a person who serves in an army","c":"軍人；士兵","s":"The brave young soldier guarded the mountain post all night despite the freezing blizzard and strong wind.","t":"儘管遭遇嚴寒的暴風雪與強風，那位英勇的年輕士兵依然整夜守衛著哨所。"},{"w":"enemy","p":"n.","d":"a person, group, or country that fights against another","c":"敵人；敵軍","s":"The patrol unit moved quietly through the dense forest, making sure that no enemy forces were hiding nearby.","t":"巡邏隊在茂密的森林中悄悄行進，確保附近沒有隱藏任何敵軍部隊。"},{"w":"bomb","p":"n. / v.","d":"an explosive weapon; to attack with explosives","c":"炸彈；轟炸","s":"The police evacuated the busy train station immediately after finding a suspicious package suspected of being a bomb.","t":"在發現一個疑似炸彈的可疑包裹後，警方立即疏散了繁忙的火車站。"},{"w":"gun","p":"n.","d":"a weapon that shoots bullets or shells","c":"槍；手槍；步槍","s":"Strict firearm laws prevent ordinary citizens from carrying a concealed gun in crowded public shopping centers.","t":"嚴格的槍枝法律防止普通公民在擁擠的公共購物中心攜帶隱蔽手槍。"},{"w":"weapon","p":"n.","d":"any object used for fighting, attacking, or defense","c":"武器；兵器","s":"Security officers at the international airport use modern scanners to detect any dangerous concealed weapon.","t":"國際機場的安檢人員使用現代掃描器檢測任何隱藏的危險武器。"},{"w":"attack","p":"v. / n.","d":"to try to hurt or defeat using force; an assault","c":"攻擊；襲擊；進攻","s":"The enemy troops launched a sudden air attack on the harbor before dawn, damaging several transport ships.","t":"敵軍在黎明前對港口發動了突然的空中襲擊，損壞了數艘運輸船。"},{"w":"fight","p":"v. / n.","d":"to use force against an opponent (fight / fought / fought)","c":"作戰；打鬥；奮鬥","s":"Civil rights leaders fight tirelessly for racial equality, inspiring millions of people across the continent.","t":"民權領袖們為種族平等不知疲倦地奮鬥，激勵了整個大陸的數百萬人。"},{"w":"victory","p":"n.","d":"success in winning a contest, war, or struggle","c":"勝利；獲勝","s":"After months of intense political campaigning, the candidate celebrated her decisive victory in the election.","t":"經過數月激烈的政治競選，該候選人慶祝了她在選舉中的決定性勝利。"},{"w":"freedom","p":"n.","d":"the power or right to act, speak, or think without hindrance","c":"自由；獨立","s":"Democratic societies value freedom of speech as one of the most fundamental constitutional principles.","t":"民主社會將言論自由視為最基本的憲法原則之一。"}]},{"unit":46,"theme":"Success, Failure, Peace & Moral Courage","cards":[{"w":"succeed","p":"v.","d":"to achieve a desired aim or result; to follow","c":"成功；達到目的","s":"If you work diligently every day and never give up, you will definitely succeed in reaching your career goals.","t":"如果你每天勤勉工作且永不放棄，你一定會成功實現你的職業目標。"},{"w":"success","p":"n.","d":"the accomplishment of an aim; favorable outcome","c":"成功；成就","s":"Her new English novel was a tremendous commercial success, selling over one million copies in just three months.","t":"她的新英文小說獲得了巨大的商業成功，在短短三個月內就售出了超過一百萬冊。"},{"w":"fail","p":"v.","d":"to be unsuccessful in achieving a goal or passing a test","c":"失敗；不及格","s":"Peter didn't study for the driving test, so he was not surprised to fail the examination on his first attempt.","t":"彼得沒有為駕照考試讀書，所以他在第一次嘗試中沒有通過考試並不感到驚訝。"},{"w":"failure","p":"n.","d":"lack of success; an unsuccessful person or thing","c":"失敗；挫折","s":"Wise teachers remind students that failure is the mother of success, teaching us valuable lessons for future attempts.","t":"有智慧的老師提醒學生失敗是成功之母，為我們未來的嘗試提供了寶貴的教訓。"},{"w":"peace","p":"n.","d":"freedom from disturbance; tranquility; state of no war","c":"和平；平靜；安寧","s":"After decades of violent border conflict, both nations finally signed a treaty and achieved lasting peace.","t":"在經歷了數十年的激烈邊界衝突後，兩國終於簽署了條約並實現了持久和平。"},{"w":"peaceful","p":"adj.","d":"free from disturbance; calm and quiet; not involving war","c":"和平的；安詳寧靜的","s":"We rented a wooden cottage beside a peaceful mountain lake, where we spent relaxing mornings watching the birds.","t":"我們在一座寧靜的高山湖泊旁租了一間木屋，在那裡我們度過了放鬆的早晨並觀賞鳥類。"},{"w":"courage","p":"n.","d":"the ability to do something that frightens one; bravery","c":"勇氣；膽識","s":"It took immense personal courage for the whistleblower to step forward and expose corruption within the firm.","t":"舉報人鼓起了巨大的個人勇氣挺身而出，揭露了公司內部的腐敗。"},{"w":"encourage","p":"v.","d":"to give support, confidence, or hope to someone","c":"鼓勵；激勵","s":"Good parents always encourage their children to try new hobbies and express their creative ideas freely.","t":"優秀的父母總是鼓勵他們的孩子嘗試新的嗜好並自由表達創造性的想法。"},{"w":"hero","p":"n.","d":"a person admired for courage, outstanding achievements, or noble qualities","c":"英雄；受景仰的人物","s":"The brave firefighter who entered the burning apartment to rescue the trapped baby was hailed as a local hero.","t":"進入燃燒公寓營救受困嬰兒的英勇消防員被譽為當地的英雄。"},{"w":"protect","p":"v.","d":"to keep safe from harm, injury, or damage","c":"保護；守護","s":"Wearing a strong safety helmet while riding a motorcycle will effectively protect your head during an unexpected fall.","t":"騎摩托車時配戴牢固的安全帽，將在發生意外摔倒時有效保護你的頭部。"}]},{"unit":47,"theme":"Urban Architecture, Legal Facilities & Social Survival","cards":[{"w":"arrest","p":"v. / n.","d":"to seize by legal authority; legal custody","c":"逮捕；拘捕","s":"The police managed to arrest the dangerous suspect near the airport before he could board the international flight.","t":"警方在危險嫌疑人登上國際航班之前，設法在機場附近將其逮捕。"},{"w":"struggle","p":"v. / n.","d":"to make forceful efforts against difficulties; contest","c":"掙扎；奮鬥；努力","s":"The poor family had to struggle against hunger during the winter, but they supported each other through all hardship.","t":"貧困的家庭在冬天必須與飢餓作鬥爭，但他們在所有艱辛中互相支持。"},{"w":"survive","p":"v.","d":"to continue to live or exist, especially after danger","c":"倖存；存活","s":"Miraculously, all passengers managed to survive the train derailment with only minor scratches and bruises.","t":"奇蹟般地，所有乘客都在火車出軌事故中倖存下來，僅受了輕微的擦傷與瘀傷。"},{"w":"building","p":"n.","d":"a structure with a roof and walls, such as a house or factory","c":"建築物；大樓","s":"Taipei 101 is an iconic skyscraper building that incorporates advanced engineering to withstand strong typhoons and earthquakes.","t":"台北101是一座標誌性的摩天大樓建築，融合了先進工程技術以抵禦強烈颱風和地震。"},{"w":"court","p":"n.","d":"a place where legal justice is administered; playing area","c":"法院；法庭；球場","s":"The witnesses testified truthfully before the judge in court, helping the jury deliver a fair verdict.","t":"證人在法庭上面對法官如實作證，幫助陪審團做出了公正的裁決。"},{"w":"castle","p":"n.","d":"a large fortified historic building with thick walls","c":"城堡","s":"The ancient stone castle stood majestically on top of the green hill, overlooking the beautiful blue river below.","t":"古老的石頭城堡雄偉地矗立在綠色山丘頂上，俯瞰著下方美麗的藍色河流。"},{"w":"tower","p":"n.","d":"a tall, narrow building or part of a building","c":"塔；高樓；信號塔","s":"Visitors can take the high-speed glass elevator to the observation deck of the television tower to enjoy panoramic views.","t":"遊客可以搭乘高速玻璃電梯前往電視塔的觀景台，飽覽全景風光。"},{"w":"temple","p":"n.","d":"a building devoted to religious worship","c":"寺廟；神殿","s":"Devout worshipers burn fragrant incense and bow respectfully inside the historic Buddhist temple every morning.","t":"虔誠的信徒每天早晨在歷史悠久的佛教寺廟內燃燒芬芳的香火並恭敬鞠躬。"},{"w":"mall","p":"n.","d":"a large enclosed shopping area with many stores","c":"購物中心；商場","s":"Many local teenagers love to gather at the air-conditioned shopping mall on hot summer weekends to watch movies.","t":"許多當地的青少年喜歡在炎熱的夏日週末聚集在有冷氣的購物中心看電影。"},{"w":"downtown","p":"n. / adj. / adv.","d":"the central part or business center of a city","c":"市中心；鬧區","s":"Because street parking is extremely limited downtown, taking the rapid transit train is the most convenient choice.","t":"由於市中心的街邊停車位極其有限，因此搭乘捷運列車是最方便的選擇。"}]},{"unit":48,"theme":"Settlements, Domestic Layout & East Asian Geography","cards":[{"w":"village","p":"n.","d":"a small community or group of houses in a rural area","c":"村莊；鄉村","s":"My grandparents live in a peaceful fishing village where fresh seafood is sold by the dock every morning.","t":"我的祖父母住在一個寧靜的漁村，每天早晨碼頭旁都會出售新鮮的海鮮。"},{"w":"stair","p":"n.","d":"one step in a flight of steps from one level to another","c":"樓梯的階梯；樓梯","s":"Be careful not to trip over the loose carpet on the wooden stair, especially when carrying heavy groceries.","t":"搬運沉重雜貨時要小心，別被木樓梯上鬆動的地毯絆倒。"},{"w":"downstairs","p":"adv. / adj. / n.","d":"down the stairs; on a lower floor","c":"樓下；在樓下","s":"The doorbell rang while she was reading in bed, so she quickly ran downstairs to see who was at the door.","t":"當她在床上看書時門鈴響了，所以她迅速跑到樓下看看是誰在門口。"},{"w":"upstairs","p":"adv. / adj. / n.","d":"up the stairs; on an upper floor","c":"樓上；在樓上","s":"All the quiet study bedrooms are located upstairs, while the kitchen and living room are on the ground floor.","t":"所有安靜的書房臥室都位於樓上，而廚房和客廳則位於一樓。"},{"w":"Asia","p":"n.","d":"the largest continent in the world","c":"亞洲","s":"Many diverse languages, cultures, and ancient civilizations have developed across the vast continent of Asia.","t":"許多多元的語言、文化與古老文明在廣袤的亞洲大陸上孕育發展。"},{"w":"Asian","p":"adj. / n.","d":"belonging to Asia; a person of Asian descent","c":"亞洲的；亞洲人","s":"Students from various Asian countries gathered at the university to celebrate Lunar New Year traditions.","t":"來自多個亞洲國家的學生齊聚大學，共同慶祝農曆新年的傳統習俗。"},{"w":"Japan","p":"n.","d":"an island nation in East Asia famous for its culture and technology","c":"日本","s":"Thousands of travelers visit Japan every spring to admire the breathtaking pink cherry blossoms in Kyoto.","t":"每年春天，成千上萬的旅客造訪日本，欣賞京都令人屏息的粉紅櫻花。"},{"w":"Japanese","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to Japan, its people, or its language","c":"日本的；日本人；日語","s":"We enjoyed authentic Japanese ramen with tender pork slices and savory broth at the newly opened restaurant.","t":"我們在新開的餐廳享用了道地的日式拉麵，搭配鮮嫩的叉燒肉片與濃郁湯頭。"},{"w":"Korea","p":"n.","d":"a peninsula in East Asia divided into North and South","c":"韓國；朝鮮","s":"South Korea has become internationally celebrated for its energetic pop music, television dramas, and cosmetics.","t":"韓國因其充滿活力的流行音樂、電視劇和化妝品而享譽國際。"},{"w":"Korean","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to Korea, its people, or its language","c":"韓國的；韓國人；韓語","s":"Many young Taiwanese students are actively learning the Korean language so they can understand dramas without subtitles.","t":"許多台灣年輕學生正在積極學習韓語，以便能夠在沒有字幕的情況下看懂電視劇。"}]},{"unit":49,"theme":"Global Geography, European & Eurasian Nations","cards":[{"w":"Philippines","p":"n.","d":"an archipelago country in Southeast Asia","c":"菲律賓","s":"The Philippines is famous for its crystal-clear waters and hundreds of beautiful tropical islands that attract divers.","t":"菲律賓因其清澈見底的海水和數百個吸引潛水愛好者的美麗熱帶島嶼而聞名。"},{"w":"Taiwan","p":"n.","d":"an island nation in East Asia known for technology and cuisine","c":"台灣","s":"People in Taiwan are world-renowned for their hospitality, delicious night market snacks, and stunning mountain landscapes.","t":"台灣人以其熱情好客、美味的夜市小吃和壯麗的高山景觀聞名於世。"},{"w":"Taiwanese","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to Taiwan, its people, or its local culture","c":"台灣的；台灣人；台語","s":"Many foreign exchange students fall in love with traditional Taiwanese bubble tea and fried chicken cutlets.","t":"許多外國交換學生愛上了傳統的台灣珍珠奶茶與炸雞排。"},{"w":"Singapore","p":"n.","d":"an island city-state in Southeast Asia known for cleanliness","c":"新加坡","s":"Strict municipal laws and efficient public urban planning have made Singapore one of the cleanest green cities in the world.","t":"嚴格的市政法規與高效的公共城市規劃，使新加坡成為全球最乾淨的綠色城市之一。"},{"w":"Russia","p":"n.","d":"the largest country in the world, spanning Eastern Europe and Northern Asia","c":"俄羅斯","s":"Covering eleven distinct time zones across Eurasia, Russia features vast snowy pine forests and rich historic architecture.","t":"俄羅斯橫跨歐亞大陸的十一個不同時區，擁有廣袤的雪白松樹林與豐富的歷史建築。"},{"w":"Russian","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to Russia, its people, or its language","c":"俄羅斯的；俄羅斯人；俄語","s":"Tchaikovsky was a brilliant Russian composer whose classical ballet music continues to be performed across the globe.","t":"柴可夫斯基是一位才華洋溢的俄羅斯作曲家，他的古典芭蕾舞音樂繼續在全球各地演出。"},{"w":"Europe","p":"n.","d":"a continent situated entirely in the Northern Hemisphere","c":"歐洲","s":"Traveling across Europe by passenger train allows tourists to explore multiple historic nations in a single summer trip.","t":"搭乘客運火車橫穿歐洲旅行，讓遊客能夠在一次暑期旅行中探索多個歷史悠久的國家。"},{"w":"European","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to Europe, its people, or its languages","c":"歐洲的；歐洲人","s":"The European Union facilitates international trade, environmental cooperation, and peaceful travel among member nations.","t":"歐洲聯盟促進了成員國之間的國際貿易、環保合作與和平旅行。"},{"w":"Britain","p":"n.","d":"the island comprising England, Scotland, and Wales","c":"英國；大不列顛","s":"Great Britain played a major role in the global Industrial Revolution during the eighteenth and nineteenth centuries.","t":"大不列顛在十八和十九世紀的全球工業革命中發揮了重大作用。"},{"w":"British","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to Great Britain or the United Kingdom","c":"英國的；英國人","s":"Enjoying afternoon tea with freshly baked scones and strawberry jam is a quintessential British cultural tradition.","t":"享用帶有剛出爐司康餅與草莓果醬的下午茶，是一項典型的英國文化傳統。"}]},{"unit":50,"theme":"Western Nations, Nationalities & Commonwealth Countries","cards":[{"w":"England","p":"n.","d":"the largest and most populous constituent country of the United Kingdom","c":"英格蘭","s":"London is the historic capital of England, known for big red buses, the River Thames, and historic palaces.","t":"倫敦是英格蘭的歷史首都，以紅色大巴士、泰晤士河與歷史宮殿聞名。"},{"w":"Englishman","p":"n.","d":"a man who was born in or comes from England","c":"英格蘭人；英國男士","s":"The polite Englishman drank his morning tea with a dash of milk and read the daily broadsheet newspaper quietly.","t":"那位彬彬有禮的英格蘭人喝著加了一點牛奶的早茶，安靜地閱讀每日大報。"},{"w":"France","p":"n.","d":"a country in Western Europe celebrated for wine, food, and culture","c":"法國","s":"Millions of art lovers travel to France each year to admire famous masterpieces housed within the Louvre Museum.","t":"每年數百萬藝術愛好者前往法國，欣賞羅浮宮博物館收藏的著名傳世傑作。"},{"w":"French","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to France, its people, or its language","c":"法國的；法國人；法語","s":"Freshly baked French baguettes and buttery croissants are staple morning delicacies enjoyed worldwide.","t":"新鮮出爐的法國長棍麵包與奶油可頌是享譽全球的早晨代表性美食。"},{"w":"Germany","p":"n.","d":"a country in Central Europe renowned for engineering and industry","c":"德國","s":"Automotive factories across Germany produce world-famous, reliable cars known for high precision and performance.","t":"遍布德國的汽車工廠生產舉世聞名且可靠的汽車，以高精度與卓越性能著稱。"},{"w":"German","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to Germany, its people, or its language","c":"德國的；德國人；德語","s":"He studied the German language for three semesters because he plans to study mechanical engineering in Munich.","t":"他學習了三個學期的德語，因為他計劃前往慕尼黑攻讀機械工程。"},{"w":"Australia","p":"n.","d":"a continent and sovereign country surrounded by the Indian and Pacific oceans","c":"澳洲；澳大利亞","s":"Unique native wildlife such as kangaroos, wombats, and koalas flourish across the vast landscapes of Australia.","t":"袋鼠、袋熊與無尾熊等獨特的本土野生動物在澳洲廣袤的土地上繁衍生息。"},{"w":"Australian","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to Australia or its people","c":"澳洲的；澳洲人","s":"Surfers from around the world gather along the sunlit Australian coastline to ride giant waves during the summer.","t":"來自世界各地的衝浪愛好者在夏季聚集在陽光普照的澳洲海岸線挑戰巨浪。"},{"w":"Canada","p":"n.","d":"the second-largest country in the world by total area, located in North America","c":"加拿大","s":"Known for vast wilderness and natural beauty, Canada produces the vast majority of the world's sweet maple syrup.","t":"以廣闊荒野與自然美景聞名的加拿大，生產了全球絕大多數香甜的楓糖漿。"},{"w":"Canadian","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to Canada or its people","c":"加拿大的；加拿大人","s":"Ice hockey is deeply ingrained in Canadian culture, and millions of passionate fans watch games every winter.","t":"冰上曲棍球在加拿大文化中根深蒂固，數百萬熱情的球迷每年冬天都會觀看比賽。"}]},{"unit":51,"theme":"Global Metropolises, International Commerce & Mechanical Tools","cards":[{"w":"Hong Kong","p":"n.","d":"a major international financial center and city in southern China","c":"香港","s":"Many international banking companies set up their regional headquarters in Hong Kong because of its active harbor and free trade.","t":"許多國際銀行公司因為其繁忙的港口和自由貿易而在______設立了區域總部。"},{"w":"New York","p":"n.","d":"the most populous city and financial center in the United States","c":"紐約","s":"The Broadway theater district in New York attracts millions of tourists every year, and people come from everywhere to watch musical shows.","t":"______的百老匯劇院區每年吸引數百萬遊客，人們從各地前來觀賞音樂劇。"},{"w":"Paris","p":"n.","d":"the capital city of France, famous for fashion and art","c":"巴黎","s":"We enjoyed drinking hot coffee at an outdoor cafe in Paris, and later in the afternoon we walked toward the famous Eiffel Tower.","t":"我們在______的一家戶外咖啡館享用熱咖啡，隨後在下午走向著名的艾菲爾鐵塔。"},{"w":"London","p":"n.","d":"the capital city of the United Kingdom, located on the River Thames","c":"倫敦","s":"Tourists gathered along the River Thames in London to take photographs of Big Ben, but a sudden fog covered the historic bridge.","t":"遊客聚集在______泰晤士河畔拍攝大笨鐘的照片，但一陣突如其來的濃霧籠罩了這座歷史悠久的大橋。"},{"w":"international","p":"adj.","d":"relating to, involving, or between two or more nations","c":"國際的","s":"The foreign trade fair was an important international event for local exporters, and business leaders signed multiple trade agreements there.","t":"這場對外貿易展覽會對本地出口商而言是一次重要的______盛事，商業領袖在會上簽署了多項貿易協議。"},{"w":"tool","p":"n.","d":"a handheld device used to carry out a particular mechanical function","c":"工具","s":"The clever mechanic selected the correct repair tool from his heavy toolbox, and he tightened the loose metal screw on the engine.","t":"這位熟練的技工從他沉重的工具箱中挑選出正確的維修______，並鎖緊了引擎上鬆動的金屬螺絲。"},{"w":"instrument","p":"n.","d":"a tool or device used for delicate scientific, medical, or musical work","c":"儀器；樂器","s":"The hospital laboratory installed a precise scientific instrument yesterday, and doctors can now test medical samples much faster.","t":"這家醫院實驗室昨天安裝了一台精密的科學______，醫生們現在可以更快地檢測醫療樣本。"},{"w":"hammer","p":"n. / v.","d":"a heavy hand tool with a metal head used for pounding nails","c":"鐵鎚；鎚打","s":"The carpenter used a steel hammer to drive several long nails into the wooden frame, and the bookshelf became very steady.","t":"木匠使用一把鋼______將幾根長釘敲進木框中，書架頓時變得非常穩固。"},{"w":"rope","p":"n.","d":"a strong, thick cord made by twisting together strands of hemp or wire","c":"繩索","s":"The brave mountain climbers tied a strong nylon rope around their waists, so they could safely cross the dangerous snowy ridge.","t":"勇敢的登山客在腰間繫上堅韌的尼龍______，這樣他們就能安全地穿越危險的積雪山脊。"},{"w":"pump","p":"n. / v.","d":"a mechanical machine used to move liquids or gases; to move fluid","c":"幫浦；抽水機；充氣","s":"My bicycle tire was completely flat this morning, so my brother used a hand pump to fill it with air before school.","t":"我的腳踏車輪胎今天早上完全沒氣了，所以我哥哥在上學前用一把手動______幫它充飽氣。"}]},{"unit":52,"theme":"Engines, Industrial Materials, Metals & Mechanical Power","cards":[{"w":"engine","p":"n.","d":"a machine with moving parts that converts power into motion","c":"引擎；發動機","s":"The driver turned the key to start the car engine, and the vehicle moved smoothly onto the highway toward Taipei.","t":"司機轉動鑰匙發動了汽車______，車輛便平穩地駛上前往台北的公路。"},{"w":"rubber","p":"n. / adj.","d":"a tough, elastic substance made from the sap of tropical trees","c":"橡膠；橡膠的","s":"Waterproof boots are usually made of thick rubber, so factory workers can keep their feet dry when working in wet areas.","t":"防水靴通常由厚______製成，因此工廠工人在潮濕區域工作時能保持雙腳乾燥。"},{"w":"wheel","p":"n.","d":"a circular object that revolves on an axle to allow movement","c":"車輪；方向盤","s":"The bicycle mechanic quickly replaced the damaged front wheel so that the boy could ride safely around the neighborhood.","t":"自行車技工迅速更換了損壞的前______，好讓小男孩可以在社區附近安全騎車。"},{"w":"iron","p":"n. / v.","d":"a strong, hard magnetic silver-gray metal; to smooth clothes","c":"鐵；熨斗；熨燙","s":"My grandmother asked me to iron my school uniform shirts before Monday morning so they would look neat and clean.","t":"我祖母要求我在星期一早上之前先______好學校制服襯衫，這樣看起來才會整潔乾淨。"},{"w":"metal","p":"n. / adj.","d":"a solid material that is hard, shiny, and good at conducting heat","c":"金屬；金屬製的","s":"Heavy cooking pots are usually made of strong metal, and they conduct heat quickly over an open kitchen fire.","t":"厚重的烹飪鍋通常由堅固的______製成，它們在開放的廚房爐火上能快速導熱。"},{"w":"force","p":"n. / v.","d":"physical strength or power; to compel someone to do something","c":"力量；武力；強迫","s":"The fierce typhoon wind struck the coastal town with enormous force, and several old trees were blown down onto the street.","t":"猛烈的颱風以巨大的______襲擊了沿海小鎮，幾棵老樹被吹倒在街道上。"},{"w":"power","p":"n.","d":"the ability to do something or act in a particular way; energy","c":"力量；電力；權力","s":"The sudden summer thunderstorm knocked down electrical wires, and the whole neighborhood lost electrical power for two hours.","t":"突如其來的夏日雷陣雨擊斷了電線，整個社區失去了電______長達兩小時。"},{"w":"powerful","p":"adj.","d":"having great power, strength, influence, or physical force","c":"強大的；強而有力的","s":"The cargo truck has a very powerful diesel engine, so it can easily carry tons of heavy building supplies up steep mountain roads.","t":"這輛貨車配備了非常______的柴油引擎，因此能輕鬆運載數噸沉重的建築材料攀登陡峭山路。"}]},{"unit":53,"theme":"Manufacturing, Operations, Technology Maintenance & Historical Periods","cards":[{"w":"operation","p":"n.","d":"the action of functioning; a medical surgery or organized process","c":"操作；運作；手術","s":"The surgical team performed a difficult heart operation yesterday morning, and the patient is now resting quietly in the hospital.","t":"手術團隊昨天早上執行了一場難度很高的心臟______，病人現在正在醫院裡安靜休養。"},{"w":"robot","p":"n.","d":"a machine capable of carrying out a complex series of actions automatically","c":"機器人","s":"The modern electronics factory uses an intelligent industrial robot to assemble delicate computer parts with high precision.","t":"這座現代電子工廠使用一台智慧型工業______，以極高的精確度組裝精密的電腦零件。"},{"w":"maintain","p":"v.","d":"to cause or enable a condition or state of affairs to continue; service","c":"維持；保養；維修","s":"Building owners must regularly maintain their fire alarm systems, so everyone inside the high-rise can evacuate quickly in an emergency.","t":"大樓業主必須定期______他們的火警系統，以便高樓內的所有人在緊急情況下能迅速疏散。"},{"w":"produce","p":"v. / n.","d":"to make or manufacture from components or raw materials; fresh food","c":"生產；製造；農產品","s":"The fertile agricultural valley can produce tons of fresh sweet melons each summer, which are shipped to supermarkets nationwide.","t":"這座肥沃的農業山谷每年夏天都能______數噸新鮮甜瓜，並運往全國各地的超市。"},{"w":"production","p":"n.","d":"the action of manufacturing from raw materials, or a theatrical work","c":"生產；製造；產量","s":"The local car factory temporarily stopped automobile production because of a severe worldwide shortage of essential computer chips.","t":"這家本地汽車工廠暫時停止了汽車______，因為全球嚴重短缺關鍵電腦晶片。"},{"w":"repair","p":"v. / n.","d":"to restore something damaged, faulty, or worn to a good condition","c":"修理；修復","s":"The experienced mechanic needed three hours to repair the cracked water pipe, and clean water flowed into our house again.","t":"經驗豐富的技工花了三個小時才______好破裂的水管，乾淨的水隨後又流進了我們家。"},{"w":"ancient","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to the very distant past and no longer in existence","c":"古代的；古老的","s":"Archaeologists discovered an ancient stone tomb buried deep beneath the desert sand, which contained valuable gold artifacts.","t":"考古學家在沙漠深處發現了一座埋藏很深的______石墓，裡面藏有珍貴的黃金文物。"},{"w":"recent","p":"adj.","d":"having happened, begun, or been done not long ago or lately","c":"最近的；近來的","s":"A recent medical study indicates that walking for thirty minutes every day greatly reduces the risk of heart disease.","t":"一項______醫學研究指出，每天散步三十分鐘可顯著降低罹患心臟病的風險。"},{"w":"calendar","p":"n.","d":"a chart or series of pages showing the days, weeks, and months of a year","c":"日曆；行事曆","s":"Teacher Linda marked the upcoming school sports day on her desk calendar, reminding all the students to practice running.","t":"琳達老師在她桌上的______上標記了即將到來的學校運動會，提醒所有學生練習跑步。"},{"w":"period","p":"n.","d":"a length or portion of time; a punctuation mark","c":"期間；時代；句點","s":"The famous artist lived in Paris for a brief period during his youth, where he created his finest oil paintings.","t":"這位著名藝術家在青年時期曾在巴黎度過了一段短暫的______，在那裡他創作了他最好的油畫。"}]},{"unit":54,"theme":"Time Units, Academic Scheduling & Educational Subjects","cards":[{"w":"daily","p":"adj. / adv.","d":"done, produced, or occurring every day or every weekday","c":"每日的；日常的","s":"The city newspaper publishes a daily evening edition, providing commuters with the latest traffic and economic news.","t":"這家市立報社發行______晚報，為通勤族提供最新的交通與經濟新聞。"},{"w":"weekly","p":"adj. / adv.","d":"done, produced, or occurring once every week","c":"每週的；週報","s":"Our English teacher assigned a weekly reading journal, and each student must summarize a storybook every Friday.","t":"我們的英語老師指派了一份______閱讀日誌，每位學生每週五都必須總結一本故事書。"},{"w":"weekday","p":"n.","d":"any day of the week except Sunday and Saturday","c":"平日；工作日","s":"The public library is usually very quiet on a weekday, but on weekends it fills with noisy children and readers.","t":"公共圖書館在______通常非常安靜，但一到週末就擠滿了喧鬧的孩子和讀者。"},{"w":"monthly","p":"adj. / adv.","d":"done, produced, or occurring once every month","c":"每月的；月刊","s":"My family pays a fixed monthly rent for our downtown apartment, which is due on the first day of each calendar month.","t":"我的家人為我們市中心的公寓支付固定的______租金，該租金在每個曆月的第一天到期。"},{"w":"yearly","p":"adj. / adv.","d":"done, produced, or occurring once every year; annual","c":"每年的；一年一度的","s":"The international tech company holds its yearly sales convention in Tokyo, inviting top regional branch managers.","t":"這家跨國科技公司在東京舉辦其______銷售大會，邀請各地的優秀分公司經理。"},{"w":"century","p":"n.","d":"a period of one hundred years","c":"世紀；一百年","s":"This majestic Gothic cathedral was built in the twelfth century, and its stone towers have stood firm for hundreds of years.","t":"這座宏偉的哥德式大教堂建於十二______，其石塔數百年來一直屹立不搖。"},{"w":"midnight","p":"n.","d":"twelve o'clock in the middle of the night","c":"午夜；半夜十二點","s":"The diligent university student stayed up until midnight studying chemistry, but she still woke up early the next morning.","t":"那位勤奮的大學生熬夜研讀化學直到______，但第二天早晨她依然很早就醒來了。"},{"w":"dawn","p":"n. / v.","d":"the first appearance of light in the sky before sunrise","c":"黎明；拂曉；破曉","s":"Fishermen launched their wooden boats into the bay at dawn, hoping to catch fresh tuna before the morning sun rose high.","t":"漁民們在______將木船駛入海灣，希望能趕在清晨太陽升起之前捕獲新鮮的鮪魚。"},{"w":"course","p":"n.","d":"a series of lessons or lectures; path or trajectory","c":"課程；路線；進程","s":"Mary enrolled in an intensive conversation course this winter, and her spoken English improved significantly in eight weeks.","t":"瑪麗今年冬天報名了一門密集會話______，她的英語口說能力在八週內有了顯著進步。"},{"w":"subject","p":"n.","d":"a branch of knowledge studied in a school or college; topic","c":"學科；科目；主題","s":"Mathematics is my brother's favorite academic subject, because he loves solving challenging number puzzles and geometry problems.","t":"數學是我弟弟最喜歡的學術______，因為他熱愛解答具有挑戰性的數字謎題和幾何題目。"}]},{"unit":55,"theme":"Academic Disciplines, Languages, Linguistics & Literary Forms","cards":[{"w":"biology","p":"n.","d":"the scientific study of living organisms and life processes","c":"生物學","s":"Students in the advanced biology class dissected a frog yesterday to examine how its internal organs function.","t":"進階______課的學生昨天解剖了一隻青蛙，以檢視其內部器官如何運作。"},{"w":"geography","p":"n.","d":"the study of the physical features of the earth and its atmosphere","c":"地理學","s":"Our teacher used a colorful globe during our geography lesson to explain how ocean currents affect global weather patterns.","t":"我們的老師在______課上使用彩色地球儀，向大家解釋洋流如何影響全球天氣型態。"},{"w":"physics","p":"n.","d":"the scientific study of matter, energy, motion, and force","c":"物理學","s":"Albert Einstein made revolutionary contributions to modern physics, altering how scientists understand time and gravity.","t":"愛因斯坦對現代______做出了革命性的貢獻，改變了科學家對時間和引力的理解。"},{"w":"PE","p":"n.","d":"physical education; instruction in physical exercise and sports at school","c":"體育；體育課","s":"The boys played basketball during their afternoon PE class, while the girls practiced volleyball on the court.","t":"男生們在下午的______課上打籃球，而女生們則在球場上練習排球。"},{"w":"science","p":"n.","d":"the systematic study of the physical and natural world through observation","c":"科學","s":"Medical science has developed effective vaccines that protect millions of children from dangerous infectious diseases.","t":"醫學______已經研發出有效的疫苗，保護數百萬兒童免受危險傳染病的侵害。"},{"w":"Mandarin","p":"n.","d":"the official standard form of Chinese spoken across Taiwan and China","c":"國語；華語；普通話","s":"The foreign exchange student practiced speaking Mandarin every day, and she can now order food fluently at night markets.","t":"那位外籍交換學生每天練習講______，她現在在夜市點餐已經非常流利了。"},{"w":"alphabet","p":"n.","d":"a set of letters used for writing a language","c":"字母表","s":"Kindergarten children sing a cheerful song to memorize the twenty-six letters of the English alphabet.","t":"幼兒園的孩子們唱著歡快的歌曲，以背熟英語______的二十六個字母。"},{"w":"vocabulary","p":"n.","d":"the body of words known and used by a particular person or group","c":"字彙；單字","s":"Reading English novels every week helps students expand their active vocabulary, making writing essays much easier.","t":"每週閱讀英文小說有助於學生擴充他們的積極______，讓撰寫作文變得容易許多。"},{"w":"poem","p":"n.","d":"a piece of writing that expresses feelings and ideas using rhythm and metaphor","c":"詩歌；韻文","s":"Emily wrote a romantic poem about the golden autumn sunset and recited it aloud in front of her classmates.","t":"艾蜜莉寫了一首關於金黃秋日落日的浪漫______，並在同學們面前大聲朗誦出來。"},{"w":"novel","p":"n.","d":"a fictitious prose narrative of book length, typically representing characters","c":"小說","s":"The young writer spent two years writing an exciting mystery novel, which quickly became a national bestseller.","t":"這位年輕作家花了兩年時間撰寫了一本刺激的懸疑______，該書很快便成為全國暢銷書。"}]},{"unit":56,"theme":"Public Discourse, Media Publications, Reports & Textbook Sections","cards":[{"w":"speech","p":"n.","d":"a formal address or discourse delivered to an audience","c":"演講；演說","s":"The brave student president delivered an inspiring speech at the graduation ceremony, encouraging everyone to pursue their dreams.","t":"勇敢的學生會長在畢業典禮上發表了一場振奮人心的______，鼓勵大家勇敢追求夢想。"},{"w":"discuss","p":"v.","d":"to talk about something with another person or in a group","c":"討論；商討","s":"The marketing team will gather in the conference room to discuss new promotional strategies for our summer campaign.","t":"行銷團隊將在會議室集合，以______我們夏季活動的新宣傳策略。"},{"w":"discussion","p":"n.","d":"the action or process of talking about something to reach a decision","c":"討論；研討","s":"After two hours of lively class discussion, students finally reached a consensus on the topic of their science project.","t":"經過兩小時熱烈的課堂______後，學生們終於就他們的科學專案主題達成了共識。"},{"w":"debate","p":"n. / v.","d":"a formal discussion on a particular matter in a public meeting","c":"辯論；爭辯","s":"The two political candidates participated in a televised presidential debate, exchanging opinions on education and taxation.","t":"兩位政治候選人參加了一場電視轉播的總統大選______，就教育與稅收問題交換意見。"},{"w":"newspaper","p":"n.","d":"a printed publication containing news, feature articles, and advertisements","c":"報紙","s":"My grandfather enjoys reading the morning newspaper over hot tea, checking local sports scores and economic editorials.","t":"我祖父喜歡邊喝熱茶邊看早______，查看本地體育比分與經濟社論。"},{"w":"magazine","p":"n.","d":"a periodical publication containing articles and illustrations","c":"雜誌；期刊","s":"Sarah subscribed to a popular fashion magazine, and she eagerly waits for the glossy issue to arrive in the mail every month.","t":"莎拉訂閱了一本受歡迎的時尚______，每個月都熱切期盼精裝期號寄到信箱。"},{"w":"report","p":"n. / v.","d":"a formal account or statement of the results of an investigation; to state","c":"報告；報導","s":"The environmental agency published an alarming report on river pollution, urging the government to shut down illegal factories.","t":"環保局發布了一份關於河流污染的令人警惕的______，敦促政府關閉非法工廠。"},{"w":"article","p":"n.","d":"a piece of writing included with others in a newspaper or magazine","c":"文章；報導；冠詞","s":"David wrote an insightful article about artificial intelligence, which was featured prominently on the front page of the journal.","t":"戴維寫了一篇關於人工智慧的深刻______，該文顯著地刊登在期刊的頭版上。"},{"w":"unit","p":"n.","d":"an individual thing or person regarded as single and complete; book division","c":"單元；單位","s":"Our English textbook is divided into twelve thematic units, each focusing on practical everyday conversational skills.","t":"我們的英文教科書分為十二個主題______，每個單元都著重於實用的日常會話技能。"},{"w":"chapter","p":"n.","d":"a main division of a book, typically with a number or title","c":"章節；篇章","s":"Before going to sleep, I read the final dramatic chapter of the adventure novel to find out if the hero survived.","t":"在睡覺之前，我讀完了這本冒險小說最後一個引人入勝的______，以查明主人公是否生還。"}]},{"unit":57,"theme":"Information Organization, Documents, Diagrams & Semantics","cards":[{"w":"volume","p":"n.","d":"amount of sound; a single book in a set; quantity of space","c":"音量；卷；冊；容量","s":"The library was very quiet, so the librarian asked the student to turn down the volume on his headphones.","t":"圖書館裡非常安靜，因此圖書館員要求那位學生將耳機上的______調小。"},{"w":"chart","p":"n. / v.","d":"a sheet of information in the form of a table, graph, or diagram","c":"圖表；排行榜","s":"The economics teacher projected a detailed bar chart on the screen, showing the steady rise in inflation over ten years.","t":"經濟學老師在螢幕上投影了一張詳細的長條______，顯示過去十年來通貨膨脹的持續上升。"},{"w":"title","p":"n.","d":"the name of a book, composition, or other artistic work; formal rank","c":"標題；書名；頭銜","s":"The mystery novel had an intriguing book title, which immediately caught my attention at the university bookstore.","t":"這本懸疑小說有一個引人入勝的書______，在大學書店裡立刻吸引了我的注意。"},{"w":"topic","p":"n.","d":"a matter dealt with in a text, discourse, or conversation; subject","c":"主題；話題","s":"Renewable solar energy was the chosen topic for our debate, and each student presented evidence regarding installation costs.","t":"可再生太陽能是我們這次辯論所選定的______，每位學生都提出了有關安裝成本的證據。"},{"w":"note","p":"n. / v.","d":"a brief record of points written down; a short informal letter","c":"筆記；便條；注意","s":"During the lecture, diligent students took careful notes on key vocabulary, reviewing them thoroughly before the exam.","t":"在演講期間，勤奮的學生們認真記下了重點單字的______，並在考試前徹底複習。"},{"w":"document","p":"n. / v.","d":"a piece of written, printed, or electronic matter providing information","c":"文件；公文；證件","s":"The lawyer asked his client to sign the legal document before submitting the property contract to the city court.","t":"律師要求其客戶在將不動產合約提交給地方法院之前，先簽署這份法律______。"},{"w":"symbol","p":"n.","d":"a mark or character used as a conventional representation of an object","c":"象徵；符號","s":"The white dove is recognized worldwide as a gentle symbol of peace, often released at international sporting events.","t":"白鴿在全世界都被公認為和平的溫柔______，經常在國際體育賽事中被放飛。"},{"w":"meaning","p":"n.","d":"what is meant by a word, text, concept, or action; significance","c":"意思；含義；意義","s":"When you encounter an unfamiliar English word while reading, you should look up its exact meaning in a dictionary.","t":"當你在閱讀時遇到不熟悉的英文字詞時，你應該在字典裡查閱其確切的______。"},{"w":"opinion","p":"n.","d":"a view or judgment formed about something, not necessarily based on fact","c":"意見；看法","s":"Everyone in the seminar was encouraged to express an honest opinion about the new school dress code policy.","t":"研討會上的每個人都被鼓勵針對學校的新制服政策發表坦率的______。"},{"w":"information","p":"n.","d":"facts provided or learned about something or someone; data","c":"資訊；消息；資料","s":"The tourist visitor center provides travelers with free map brochures and useful information about scenic local mountain trails.","t":"遊客服務中心為旅客提供免費的地圖手冊以及關於本地風景優美的山徑的實用______。"}]},{"unit":58,"theme":"Early Childhood Education, Exams, Playground Equipment & Scoring","cards":[{"w":"instance","p":"n.","d":"an example or single occurrence of something","c":"例子；實例","s":"The science teacher cited several clear instancess of global warming melting polar ice sheets, convincing the entire class.","t":"自然老師舉出了全球暖化融化極地冰原的幾個明確______，使全班同學心服口服。"},{"w":"quiz","p":"n. / v.","d":"a quick or informal test of knowledge or comprehension; to test","c":"隨堂測驗；小考","s":"Our geography teacher gave us an unannounced pop quiz on world capitals, but most students answered all questions correctly.","t":"我們的地理老師對世界各國首都進行了一次突擊隨堂______，但大多數學生都正確回答了所有問題。"},{"w":"exam","p":"n.","d":"a formal test of a person's knowledge or proficiency in a subject","c":"考試；測驗","s":"University students spent two weeks in the quiet library preparing for their final chemistry exam, studying late into the night.","t":"大學生們在安靜的圖書館度過了兩週時間，準備期末化學______，每天都讀書研習到深夜。"},{"w":"score","p":"n. / v.","d":"the number of points, goals, or runs achieved in a game; to gain points","c":"分數；得分；成績","s":"Kevin achieved a perfect score on his mathematics midterm, earning praise from both his proud parents and his teacher.","t":"凱文在數學期中考中獲得了滿分______，贏得了自豪的父母和老師的一致讚揚。"},{"w":"record","p":"n. / v.","d":"the best performance achieved; an account kept in writing; audio","c":"紀錄；記錄；唱片","s":"The Jamaican sprinter broke the world 100-meter running record yesterday, crossing the finish line in under ten seconds.","t":"牙買加短跑選手昨天打破了世界百公尺賽跑______，在十秒以內衝過了終點線。"},{"w":"kindergarten","p":"n.","d":"a school or class for young children, usually aged five to six","c":"幼兒園","s":"The excited five-year-old boy carried his colorful lunchbox into kindergarten this morning, meeting his new classmates cheerfully.","t":"興奮的五歲小男孩今天早上帶著色彩繽紛的便當盒走進______，開心地與新同學們見面。"},{"w":"seesaw","p":"n.","d":"a long wooden plank balanced on a central point for children to play on","c":"翹翹板","s":"Two happy little girls sat on opposite ends of the park seesaw, giggling loudly as they pushed themselves up and down.","t":"兩個快樂的小女孩坐在公園______的兩端，一邊上下擺動一邊大聲咯咯笑著。"},{"w":"swing","p":"n. / v.","d":"a seat suspended by ropes or chains for swinging back and forth","c":"鞦韆；擺動","s":"Children rushed toward the playground swing as soon as the afternoon school bell rang, eager to soar high into the air.","t":"下午放學鐘聲一響，孩子們便奔向操場上的______，渴望高高盪向空中。"},{"w":"balloon","p":"n.","d":"a small rubber bag filled with air or helium, used as a child's toy","c":"氣球","s":"The birthday clown handed each cheerful child a colorful helium balloon shaped like a funny cartoon animal.","t":"生日派對上的小丑遞給每個開心的小孩一個形狀像搞笑卡通動物的彩色氦氣______。"},{"w":"education","p":"n.","d":"the process of receiving or giving systematic instruction, especially at school","c":"教育","s":"The government invested millions of tax dollars into public education, ensuring that every rural school has modern computers.","t":"政府在公共______方面投入了數百萬稅收，確保每所偏鄉學校都能擁有現代化的電腦。"}]},{"unit":59,"theme":"Higher Education, University Facilities & Academic Terms","cards":[{"w":"attend","p":"v.","d":"to be present at an event, meeting, or function; to go regularly","c":"出席；參加；就讀","s":"All international students must attend the orientation seminar on Monday morning to learn about campus safety rules.","t":"所有國際學生必須______星期一早上的新生說明會，以了解校園安全規定。"},{"w":"attention","p":"n.","d":"notice taken of someone or something; mental focus or awareness","c":"注意；專注力；注意力","s":"The chemistry professor raised her voice to capture the attention of the noisy students sitting in the back row.","t":"化學教授提高了說話的音量，以吸引坐在後排吵鬧學生的______。"},{"w":"college","p":"n.","d":"an educational institution offering higher education or professional training","c":"學院；大學","s":"After graduating from high school, my older sister decided to attend a prestigious medical college in Taipei.","t":"高中畢業之後，我的姊姊決定前往台北一所著名的醫科______就讀。"},{"w":"university","p":"n.","d":"a high-level educational institution where students study for degrees","c":"大學；綜合大學","s":"National Taiwan university is renowned worldwide for its distinguished professors, advanced research, and historic library.","t":"國立台灣______以其傑出的教授、尖端的研究和歷史悠久的圖書館而聞名全球。"},{"w":"department","p":"n.","d":"a specialized division of a large organization, university, or store","c":"學系；部門；科系","s":"Professor Lin has served as the chairperson of the English department for five years, designing creative literature courses.","t":"林教授擔任英國語文______主任已有五年之久，期間設計了許多富創意的文學課程。"},{"w":"semester","p":"n.","d":"a half-year term in a school or college, typically lasting 15 to 18 weeks","c":"學期","s":"During the spring semester, students take five academic courses and participate in several extracurricular clubs.","t":"在春季______期間，學生修讀五門學術課程，並參與數個課外社團。"},{"w":"term","p":"n.","d":"a fixed or limited period for which something lasts; word or phrase","c":"學期；任期；專門術語","s":"The mayor's four-year official term will conclude next December, and citizens will elect a new city leader.","t":"市長為期四年的法定公職______將於明年十二月結束，市民屆時將選出新的城市領導人。"},{"w":"campus","p":"n.","d":"the grounds and buildings of a university, college, or school","c":"校園；校區","s":"Students love relaxing on the grassy lawns of the university campus between afternoon classes when the weather is sunny.","t":"天氣晴朗時，學生們喜歡在下午課堂空檔於大學______青翠的草坪上放鬆休息。"},{"w":"gym","p":"n.","d":"a gymnasium; a hall or building equipped for physical exercise and sports","c":"體育館；健身房","s":"Jason works out at the neighborhood fitness gym three times a week, lifting weights and running on the treadmill.","t":"傑森每週前往社區健身______運動三次，進行重量訓練並在跑步機上跑步。"},{"w":"hall","p":"n.","d":"a large room used for public gatherings, lectures, or concerts; corridor","c":"大廳；禮堂；走廊","s":"Hundreds of eager concertgoers filled the grand performance hall to enjoy the philharmonic orchestra's symphony.","t":"數百名熱切的音樂會觀眾擠滿了宏偉的演出______，欣賞愛樂樂團的交響樂。"}]},{"unit":60,"theme":"Visual Arts, Monetary Currency, Household Income & Commercial Fees","cards":[{"w":"photograph","p":"n. / v.","d":"a picture made using a camera; to take a picture","c":"照片；相片；攝影","s":"The tourist asked a friendly passerby to take a photograph of his family standing in front of Taipei 101.","t":"這位遊客請一位好心的路人幫他站在台北101前面的家人拍一張______。"},{"w":"picture","p":"n. / v.","d":"a visual representation of something produced on a surface; photo","c":"圖片；畫像；照片","s":"The children drew a colorful picture of a green dragon and pinned it proudly to the classroom art board.","t":"孩子們畫了一張綠色飛龍的彩色______，並自豪地用圖釘釘在教室的藝術展示欄上。"},{"w":"painting","p":"n.","d":"the action or skill of using paint; a painted picture","c":"油畫；繪畫；畫作","s":"The national art gallery purchased an expensive oil painting painted by a renowned eighteenth-century European master.","t":"國家美術館購買了一幅由十八世紀著名的歐洲繪畫大師所創作的昂貴油畫______。"},{"w":"crayon","p":"n.","d":"a pencil or stick of colored chalk or wax, used for drawing","c":"蠟筆","s":"Little Emma opened her brand-new box of wax crayonss and began coloring the sunshine bright golden yellow.","t":"小艾瑪打開了她嶄新的蠟______盒，開始將陽光塗成鮮豔的金黃色。"},{"w":"bill","p":"n.","d":"a printed statement of the money owed for goods or services; paper money","c":"帳單；紙鈔；法案","s":"After finishing our delicious Italian dinner, father asked the polite waiter to bring our dinner bill.","t":"在享用完美味的義大利晚餐後，父親請有禮貌的服務生送上我們的晚餐______。"},{"w":"cash","p":"n. / v.","d":"money in coins or notes, as distinct from checks, credit cards, or debt","c":"現金；兌現","s":"The night market stall only accepts payment in cash, so tourists should carry sufficient coins and paper notes.","t":"夜市攤位只接受用______付款，因此遊客應該隨身攜帶足夠的硬幣與紙鈔。"},{"w":"coin","p":"n. / v.","d":"a flat, typically round piece of metal with an official stamp, used as money","c":"硬幣；投幣","s":"I dropped a ten-dollar metal coin into the vending machine, and a can of cold green tea dropped into the tray.","t":"我將一枚十元金屬______投入販賣機，一罐冰綠茶隨即便掉進托盤中。"},{"w":"income","p":"n.","d":"money received, especially on a regular basis, for work or investments","c":"收入；所得","s":"A progressive tax system requires families with higher annual income to pay a larger proportion of their earnings in tax.","t":"累進稅率制度要求每年有較高______的家庭繳納其薪資所得中較大比例的稅款。"},{"w":"charge","p":"n. / v.","d":"a price asked for goods or services; to demand an amount","c":"費用；收費；控告；衝鋒","s":"The hotel provides free Wi-Fi internet access to all guests without any additional hourly charge.","t":"這家飯店向所有住客提供免費無線網路連線服務，完全不收任何額外的每小時______。"},{"w":"fee","p":"n.","d":"a payment made to a professional person or institution for advice or services","c":"規費；手續費；學雜費","s":"University students must pay their tuition fee at the bank before the first week of classes begins.","t":"大學生必須在開學第一週上課開始前，至銀行繳清他們的學雜______。"}]},{"unit":61,"theme":"Units of Measurement, Numbers, Quantities & Addition","cards":[{"w":"meter","p":"n.","d":"a standard unit of length equal to 100 centimeters","c":"公尺；計量器","s":"The city built a new twenty-five meter swimming pool in the sports park, so local students can practice there every weekend.","t":"該市在體育公園新建了一座二十五公尺長的游泳池，因此當地學生每個週末都可以在那裡練習。"},{"w":"centimeter","p":"n.","d":"a metric unit of length equal to one hundredth of a meter","c":"公分","s":"The tailor carefully measured my sleeve length down to the last centimeter, and then he marked the fabric with yellow chalk.","t":"裁縫師仔細測量了我的袖長精確至最後一公分，然後他用黃色粉筆在布料上做了記號。"},{"w":"kilometer","p":"n.","d":"a metric unit of length equal to 1,000 meters","c":"公里","s":"My uncle drives thirty kilometer along the coastal highway every morning, but the fresh sea breeze always keeps him awake.","t":"我叔叔每天早晨沿著濱海公路開車三十公里，但是清新的海風總是讓他保持清醒。"},{"w":"inch","p":"n.","d":"a unit of length equal to 2.54 centimeters","c":"英吋","s":"The carpenter trimmed one inch off the wooden door, and then it finally fit into the old doorframe smoothly.","t":"木匠把木門切掉了一英吋，然後這扇門終於順暢地嵌進了舊門框中。"},{"w":"liter","p":"n.","d":"a metric unit of volume equal to 1,000 cubic centimeters","c":"公升","s":"During the intense summer marathon, each runner was handed half a liter of mineral water at every rest station.","t":"在炎熱激烈的夏季馬拉松比賽中，每個休息站都會遞給每位跑者半公升的礦泉水。"},{"w":"item","p":"n.","d":"an individual article or unit in a list or collection","c":"項目；物品","s":"Mother carefully checked every single item on her grocery list, and then she walked toward the supermarket checkout counter.","t":"母親仔細核對了採購清單上的每一個項目，然後她朝著超級市場的收銀櫃台走去。"},{"w":"double","p":"adj. / v.","d":"twice as much or as many; to become twice as great","c":"雙倍的；加倍","s":"The hotel receptionist politely offered us a comfortable double room with two large beds and a wonderful mountain view.","t":"飯店櫃檯接待員禮貌地為我們提供了一間帶有兩張大床和美麗山景的舒適雙人房。"},{"w":"quarter","p":"n.","d":"one of four equal parts of something; fifteen minutes","c":"四分之一；一刻鐘","s":"David saves a quarter of his monthly allowance to buy English novels, and he puts the remaining coins into a ceramic bank.","t":"戴維每月省下四分之一的零用錢來買英文小說，並將剩餘的硬幣存入陶瓷存錢筒。"},{"w":"zero","p":"n. / adj.","d":"the number or symbol 0; nil; nothing","c":"零；零度","s":"The temperature on the high mountain dropped to five degrees below zero last night, so all the outdoor water pipes froze.","t":"昨晚高山上的氣溫降到了零下五度，因此戶外所有的水管都結凍了。"},{"w":"add","p":"v.","d":"to put something with another thing to increase the size or amount","c":"添加；增加；相加","s":"If the tomato soup tastes slightly too plain, you can add a little sea salt and black pepper to improve the flavor.","t":"如果番茄湯嚐起來稍微太淡，你可以添加少許海鹽和黑胡椒以增添風味。"}]},{"unit":62,"theme":"Mathematics, Geometric Shapes, Lines & Completeness","cards":[{"w":"equal","p":"adj. / v.","d":"the same in quantity, size, or value; to be the same as","c":"相等的；等於","s":"In a fair democracy, all citizens should enjoy equal legal rights under the law regardless of their background.","t":"在公平的民主制度下，無論背景為何，所有公民在法律面前都應享有平等的法律權利。"},{"w":"entire","p":"adj.","d":"whole or complete, with nothing missing","c":"整個的；完全的","s":"The dedicated scientist spent the entire weekend in the university laboratory to complete her physics experiment.","t":"這位敬業的科學家在大學實驗室度過了整個週末，以完成她的物理實驗。"},{"w":"maximum","p":"adj. / n.","d":"the greatest possible amount, degree, or number","c":"最大的；最高極限","s":"The highway patrol officer stated that the maximum speed limit on this bridge is eighty kilometers per hour.","t":"公路巡警指出這座橋上的最高速限為每小時八十公里。"},{"w":"total","p":"adj. / n.","d":"complete; including everything; the whole amount","c":"總計的；總數","s":"After buying textbooks and school uniforms, the total cost came to over three thousand dollars.","t":"在購買了教科書與學校制服後，總計費用超過了三千元。"},{"w":"amount","p":"n.","d":"a quantity of something, especially something that cannot be counted","c":"數量；總額","s":"Drinking a generous amount of warm water each morning helps maintain digestion and promotes physical health.","t":"每天早晨飲用足量的溫水有助於維持消化並促進身體健康。"},{"w":"curve","p":"n. / v.","d":"a line or surface that bends smoothly without sharp angles","c":"曲線；彎曲","s":"The coastal mountain road has a dangerous sharp curve near the cliff, so drivers must slow down considerably.","t":"這條濱海山路在懸崖附近有一個危險的急轉彎曲線，因此駕駛人必須大幅減速。"},{"w":"straight","p":"adj. / adv.","d":"continuing in one direction without bending or turning","c":"筆直的；直接","s":"The art teacher asked the students to draw a straight pencil line across the paper before painting the landscape.","t":"美術老師要求學生在繪畫風景之前，先用鉛筆在紙上畫出一條筆直的線。"},{"w":"underline","p":"v.","d":"to draw a line under a word to give it emphasis","c":"畫底線；強調","s":"You should take a fluorescent highlighter and underline the key grammatical rules while reviewing each chapter.","t":"在複習每個章節時，你應該拿螢光筆在重點文法規則下方畫底線以加強記憶。"},{"w":"triangle","p":"n.","d":"a flat geometric shape with three straight sides and three angles","c":"三角形","s":"The primary school students learned how to calculate the area of a triangle by multiplying base times height and dividing by two.","t":"小學生學會了如何藉由底乘以高除以二來計算三角形的面積。"},{"w":"rectangle","p":"n.","d":"a flat geometric shape with four straight sides and four right angles","c":"長方形；矩形","s":"The new living room rug is shaped like a large rectangle, and it fits neatly under the glass coffee table.","t":"新客廳地毯的形狀像一個大長方形，它整齊地鋪在玻璃咖啡桌下方。"}]},{"unit":63,"theme":"Dimensions, Spatial Measurements, Broadcasting & Navigation","cards":[{"w":"narrow","p":"adj. / v.","d":"limited in width; not wide; to become less wide","c":"狹窄的；使變窄","s":"The old mountain trail became extremely narrow near the rock cliff, so hikers had to walk in single file.","t":"靠近岩石懸崖邊的老山徑變得極其狹窄，因此登山者不得不排成單行前進。"},{"w":"wide","p":"adj. / adv.","d":"measuring a lot from side to side; broad; fully","c":"寬闊的；廣泛地","s":"The city government built a wide new boulevard with dedicated bicycle lanes and bright streetlights.","t":"市政府建造了一條設有專用自行車道和明亮路燈的寬闊新林蔭大道。"},{"w":"width","p":"n.","d":"the distance or measurement from side to side","c":"寬度","s":"The interior designer measured the exact width of the living room window before ordering custom silk curtains.","t":"室內設計師在訂製絲綢窗簾之前，測量了客廳窗戶的精確寬度。"},{"w":"length","p":"n.","d":"the measurement of something from end to end","c":"長度","s":"The luxury sailing yacht measures over twenty meters in length, and it can accommodate twelve passengers comfortably.","t":"這艘豪華帆船遊艇長度超過二十公尺，可舒適容納十二名乘客。"},{"w":"height","p":"n.","d":"the measurement of someone or something from base to top","c":"高度；身高","s":"My younger brother has grown so fast this year that he is now almost the same height as our father.","t":"我的弟弟今年長得非常快，以至於他現在的身高幾乎和我們父親一樣高了。"},{"w":"scale","p":"n. / v.","d":"a weighing device; relative size or extent; to climb","c":"磅秤；規模；比例尺","s":"The doctor asked the patient to step onto the medical scale to record his body weight before the examination.","t":"醫生請病人在檢查前站上醫療用磅秤，以便記錄他的體重。"},{"w":"broad","p":"adj.","d":"wide in extent from side to side; spacious","c":"寬廣的；廣泛的","s":"The professional swimmer has very broad shoulders and muscular arms from years of rigorous daily training.","t":"這位專業游泳選手由於多年嚴格的日常訓練，擁有非常寬廣的肩膀與肌肉發達的雙臂。"},{"w":"broadcast","p":"v. / n.","d":"to transmit programs on television or radio","c":"廣播；播送","s":"The national television station will broadcast the exciting international baseball championship live from Tokyo tonight.","t":"國家電視台今晚將從東京現場實況轉播激動人心的國際棒球錦標賽。"},{"w":"address","p":"n. / v.","d":"the details of where someone lives; to speak formally to","c":"地址；致詞；處理","s":"Please write your permanent home address and contact telephone number clearly at the top of the registration form.","t":"請在註冊表格頂端清楚寫下您的戶籍地址與聯絡電話號碼。"},{"w":"direct","p":"adj. / v.","d":"going in a straight line without stopping; to guide","c":"直達的；指引；引導","s":"Passengers traveling on business prefer to take a direct flight to London because it saves several hours of layover time.","t":"出差旅行的乘客偏好搭乘直飛倫敦的航班，因為這樣可以節省數小時的中途轉機時間。"}]},{"unit":64,"theme":"Cardinal Directions, Entrances, Exits & Social Invitations","cards":[{"w":"direction","p":"n.","d":"the course along which someone or something moves; instructions","c":"方向；指示","s":"The wind changed its direction suddenly during the sailing race, so the crew had to adjust their main sail quickly.","t":"在帆船比賽中風向突然改變，因此船員們必須迅速調整他們的主帆。"},{"w":"eastern","p":"adj.","d":"located in or facing toward the east","c":"東方的；東部的","s":"The eastern coast of Taiwan is renowned for its magnificent rocky cliffs and stunning Pacific Ocean sunrise views.","t":"台灣東部海岸以其壯麗的岩石懸崖和令人驚嘆的太平洋日出景色而聞名遐邇。"},{"w":"western","p":"adj.","d":"located in or facing toward the west","c":"西方的；西部的","s":"In modern medicine, doctors often combine traditional herbal remedies with advanced western medical techniques.","t":"在現代醫學中，醫生常將傳統草本療法與先進的西方醫療技術相互結合。"},{"w":"southern","p":"adj.","d":"located in or facing toward the south","c":"南方的；南部的","s":"Many retired couples choose to spend their winters in southern California because the climate is warm and sunny.","t":"許多退休夫婦選擇在加州南部度過冬天，因為當地的氣候溫暖而陽光明媚。"},{"w":"northern","p":"adj.","d":"located in or facing toward the north","c":"北方的；北部的","s":"The expedition team traveled across northern Europe to study migratory arctic birds during their breeding season.","t":"探險隊橫越北歐，以研究北極候鳥在繁殖季節期間的習性。"},{"w":"entrance","p":"n.","d":"an opening, such as a door or gate, through which one enters","c":"入口；門口","s":"Visitors must show their identification cards at the main entrance before entering the government building.","t":"訪客在進入政府大樓之前，必須在主要入口處出示身分證件。"},{"w":"gate","p":"n.","d":"a hinged barrier used to close an opening in a wall or fence","c":"大門；出入口","s":"The school security guard locks the front iron gate at seven in the evening, so late students must register.","t":"學校警衛在晚上七點將前鐵大門鎖上，因此遲到的學生必須進行登記。"},{"w":"exit","p":"n. / v.","d":"a passage or doorway by which one leaves; to depart","c":"出口；離開","s":"Every modern movie theater is equipped with clearly illuminated green exit signs above all emergency doors.","t":"每家現代電影院在所有緊急逃生門上方，都配備有清晰亮著的綠色出口標示。"},{"w":"invite","p":"v.","d":"to ask someone politely to come to an event or participate","c":"邀請","s":"Jenny plans to invite all her close high school classmates to her eighteenth birthday dinner celebration.","t":"珍妮計畫邀請她所有的高中摯友，參加她十八歲的生日晚餐慶祝活動。"},{"w":"invitation","p":"n.","d":"a written or verbal request inviting someone to attend an event","c":"邀請卡；請帖","s":"We received a formal printed wedding invitation in the mail yesterday, and we immediately sent our congratulations.","t":"我們昨天在郵件中收到了正式印製的結婚請帖，並立即寄出了我們的祝賀。"}]},{"unit":65,"theme":"Law, Justice, Government Systems & Civil Society","cards":[{"w":"far","p":"adj. / adv.","d":"at, to, or by a great distance in space or time","c":"遙遠的；遠地","s":"The isolated mountain cabin was situated on the far side of the wide valley, far away from city noise.","t":"那座偏僻的山間小屋坐落在寬廣山谷遙遠的一側，遠離城市的喧囂。"},{"w":"distance","p":"n.","d":"the amount of space between two points or places","c":"距離","s":"When driving on the highway during heavy rain, drivers should always keep a safe distance from the vehicle in front.","t":"在大雨期間於高速公路上行駛時，駕駛人應始終與前車保持安全距離。"},{"w":"legal","p":"adj.","d":"permitted by law; relating to the law","c":"合法的；法律的","s":"Before signing any commercial contract, you should seek professional advice from an experienced legal expert.","t":"在簽署任何商業合約之前，你應該向經驗豐富的法律專家尋求專業建議。"},{"w":"crime","p":"n.","d":"an illegal action or activity for which a person can be punished","c":"罪行；犯罪","s":"The city police department launched an intensive public campaign to fight street crime and protect local businesses.","t":"市警局發起了一場密集的公眾宣傳運動，以打擊街頭犯罪並保護當地企業。"},{"w":"prison","p":"n.","d":"a building to which people are legally committed as a punishment for crimes","c":"監獄","s":"The convicted burglar was sentenced by the criminal court to five years in prison for breaking into private residences.","t":"這名被定罪的竊賊因闖入私人住宅，被刑事法院判處在監獄服刑五年。"},{"w":"democracy","p":"n.","d":"a system of government by the whole population, usually through elected representatives","c":"民主；民主政治","s":"In a healthy modern democracy, citizens exercise their political power by participating freely in national elections.","t":"在健全的現代民主制度中，公民藉由自由參與國家選舉來行使他們的政治權力。"},{"w":"government","p":"n.","d":"the governing body of a nation, state, or community","c":"政府","s":"President Lincoln once stated that true democracy is a government of the people, by the people, and for the people.","t":"林肯總統曾表示，真正的民主乃是民有、民治、民享的政府。"},{"w":"kingdom","p":"n.","d":"a country, state, or territory ruled by a king or queen","c":"王國","s":"The ancient island kingdom was ruled peacefully by a wise monarch who cared deeply about his people's welfare.","t":"這個古老的島嶼王國由一位深切關懷人民福祉的賢明君主所和平統治。"},{"w":"organization","p":"n.","d":"an organized body of people with a particular purpose, such as a business or charity","c":"組織；機構","s":"Taiwan has been an active member of the World Trade organization and continues to expand its international business partnerships.","t":"台灣一直是世界貿易組織的活躍成員，並持續拓展其國際商業夥伴關係。"},{"w":"society","p":"n.","d":"the aggregate of people living together in a more or less ordered community","c":"社會","s":"Education plays a vital role in modern society, helping young individuals become responsible and productive citizens.","t":"教育在現代社會中扮演著至關重要的角色，幫助年輕個體成長為負責任且富有成效的公民。"}]},{"unit":66,"theme":"Civic Duties, Elections, Demographics & Public Crowds","cards":[{"w":"social","p":"adj.","d":"relating to society, its organization, or companionship","c":"社會的；社交的","s":"Spending all day alone indoors is not healthy, so teenagers should participate in more outdoor social activities.","t":"整天獨自待在室內對健康無益，因此青少年應該多參加戶外社交活動。"},{"w":"law","p":"n.","d":"the system of rules which a particular country or community recognizes","c":"法律；法規","s":"Citizens must obey the traffic law at all times, or they will face hefty fines and loss of driving licenses.","t":"公民必須始終遵守交通法律，否則他們將面臨高額罰款與吊銷駕照的處分。"},{"w":"policy","p":"n.","d":"a course or principle of action adopted by a government or business","c":"政策；方針","s":"The ministry of education introduced a new bilingual education policy to enhance high school students' global competence.","t":"教育部推出了一項新的雙語教育政策，以提升高中學生的全球競爭力。"},{"w":"vote","p":"v. / n.","d":"to express a choice in an election; a formal choice","c":"投票；選票","s":"Every eligible citizen over the age of twenty has the constitutional right to vote in national presidential elections.","t":"凡年滿二十歲的合格公民，均享有在國家總統大選中進行投票的憲法權利。"},{"w":"elect","p":"v.","d":"to choose someone for public office by voting","c":"選舉；推選","s":"The high school students will elect their new student council president during the school assembly this Friday.","t":"高中學生將於本週五的學校朝會上，推選出他們的新任學生會主席。"},{"w":"population","p":"n.","d":"all the inhabitants of a particular town, area, or country","c":"人口","s":"Tokyo has a massive metropolitan population of over fourteen million residents living within its urban borders.","t":"東京擁有超過一千四百萬居民生活在其城市邊界內的龐大都市人口。"},{"w":"citizen","p":"n.","d":"a legally recognized subject or national of a state or commonwealth","c":"公民；市民","s":"As a responsible and proactive citizen, Mr. Lin volunteers at the neighborhood community center every Saturday morning.","t":"作為一名負責任且積極主動的公民，林先生每個星期六早晨都在鄰里社區中心擔任志工。"},{"w":"crowd","p":"n. / v.","d":"a large number of people gathered together; to pack into","c":"人群；聚集","s":"A cheering crowd of thousands of enthusiastic music fans waited outside the concert stadium for their favorite band.","t":"數千名熱情歡呼的音樂迷人群聚集在演唱會體育場外，等候著他們最喜愛的樂團。"},{"w":"crowded","p":"adj.","d":"full of people, leaving little or no room for movement","c":"擁擠的","s":"The downtown night market gets extremely crowded on holiday evenings, making it difficult to walk without bumping into people.","t":"市中心的夜市在假日夜晚變得極為擁擠，使人難以行走而不撞到其他人。"},{"w":"jam","p":"n. / v.","d":"a traffic blockage; a sweet fruit spread; to squeeze tightly","c":"交通堵塞；果醬；卡住","s":"We were stuck in a terrible highway traffic jam for more than two hours due to an overturned delivery truck.","t":"由於一輛翻覆的送貨卡車，我們在嚴重的高速公路交通堵塞中受困了兩個多小時。"}]},{"unit":67,"theme":"Academic Review, Revision, Decision-Making & Interpersonal Attitudes","cards":[{"w":"review","p":"v. / n.","d":"to examine or study again; a formal assessment","c":"複習；審查；評論","s":"The teacher advised students to review chapter five thoroughly before taking the monthly English examination.","t":"老師建議學生在參加每月英文測驗之前，徹底複習第五章。"},{"w":"revise","p":"v.","d":"to alter or edit something to make it better","c":"修訂；校訂","s":"The author spent two weeks to revise her short story, making the ending much more dramatic and touching.","t":"作者花了兩週時間修改她的小說，使結局更加戲劇化且感人。"},{"w":"improve","p":"v.","d":"to make or become better in quality or performance","c":"改進；提高","s":"If you practice writing short essays every evening, your English vocabulary and grammatical accuracy will certainly improve.","t":"如果你每天晚上練習寫短文，你的英文詞彙量與文法準確性肯定會有所提升。"},{"w":"progress","p":"n. / v.","d":"forward movement toward a destination or goal","c":"進步；進展","s":"With patient guidance from his violin tutor, the young musician has made remarkable progress this semester.","t":"在小提琴家教的耐心指導下，這位年輕音樂家本學期取得了顯著的進步。"},{"w":"refuse","p":"v.","d":"to indicate that one is not willing to do something","c":"拒絕","s":"Although the salary was very attractive, Mr. Huang had to refuse the foreign job offer because his parents were sick.","t":"儘管薪水非常誘人，黃先生不得不拒絕國外的工作邀請，因為他的雙親生病了。"},{"w":"reject","p":"v.","d":"to dismiss or refuse to agree to a proposal or idea","c":"駁回；摒棄","s":"The city planning board voted to reject the controversial highway expansion proposal due to strong environmental concerns.","t":"由於強烈的環境顧慮，城市規劃委員會投票否決了那項有爭議的公路擴建提案。"},{"w":"accept","p":"v.","d":"to consent to receive a thing offered; to agree to","c":"接受；贊同","s":"After considering all possible alternatives, the research committee decided to accept the professor's innovative proposal.","t":"在考量了所有可能的替代方案後，研究委員會決定採納教授創新的提案。"},{"w":"doubt","p":"n. / v.","d":"a feeling of uncertainty or lack of conviction","c":"懷疑；不確定","s":"Because she has practiced rigorously every day, I have no doubt that she will pass the difficult piano certification.","t":"因為她每天嚴格練習，我毫不懷疑她一定會通過那場難度極高的小提琴認證考試。"},{"w":"trust","p":"n. / v.","d":"firm belief in the reliability, truth, or ability of someone","c":"信任；信賴","s":"A lasting friendship must be built on mutual trust, honest communication, and deep shared respect.","t":"持久的友誼必須建立在相互信任、坦誠溝通和深厚共同尊重的基礎之上。"},{"w":"respect","p":"n. / v.","d":"a feeling of deep admiration for someone elicited by their abilities","c":"尊重；敬重","s":"Students should always show sincere respect for their teachers and listen attentively during class discussions.","t":"學生應始終對老師表示由衷的敬意，並在課堂討論中全神貫注地傾聽。"}]},{"unit":68,"theme":"Vocal Expressions, Regret, Apologies, Crimes & Harmful Actions","cards":[{"w":"bark","p":"v. / n.","d":"the loud harsh cry of a dog; to make this sound","c":"狗叫；吠叫","s":"The guard dog began to bark fiercely at the front gate when an unfamiliar stranger approached the yard.","t":"當一位陌生的外人走近院子時，警衛犬開始在前門兇猛地吠叫。"},{"w":"shout","p":"v. / n.","d":"to utter a loud cry or call; a loud cry","c":"大喊；呼喊","s":"When the fire broke out in the basement, the neighbors began to shout loudly to warn everyone inside.","t":"當地下室起火時，鄰居們開始大聲呼喊以警告裡面的所有人。"},{"w":"blame","p":"v. / n.","d":"to hold responsible for a fault or wrong; responsibility","c":"責怪；歸咎","s":"You should not blame your little sister for breaking the ceramic cup, because it was an accident.","t":"你不應該責怪你年幼的妹妹打破了陶瓷杯，因為那純粹是一場意外。"},{"w":"regret","p":"v. / n.","d":"to feel sorry about something that occurred","c":"後悔；遺憾","s":"If you spend all your money on video games now, you will definitely regret it when you need to buy textbooks.","t":"如果你現在把所有的錢都花在電玩遊戲上，當你需要買教科書時你肯定會後悔。"},{"w":"apologize","p":"v.","d":"to express regret for something that one has done wrong","c":"道歉","s":"The polite young gentleman walked over to apologize sincerely to the lady for spilling cold tea on her coat.","t":"這位有禮貌的年輕紳士走上前去，真誠地向那位女士道歉，因為他不小心把冰茶潑到了她的外套上。"},{"w":"satisfy","p":"v.","d":"to meet the expectations, needs, or desires of someone","c":"使滿意；滿足","s":"It is almost impossible to satisfy greedy individuals because they always demand more than they actually need.","t":"要滿足貪婪的人幾乎是不可能的，因為他們索取的總是遠多於他們實際所需。"},{"w":"rob","p":"v.","d":"to take property unlawfully from a person or place by force","c":"搶劫","s":"Two masked criminals attempted to rob the neighborhood convenience store late at night, but the police arrived quickly.","t":"兩名戴面具的罪犯企圖在深夜搶劫社區便利商店，但警察迅速趕到了現場。"},{"w":"steal","p":"v.","d":"to take another person's property without permission","c":"偷竊","s":"The cunning thief managed to steal a diamond necklace from the jewelry shop without setting off the alarm.","t":"這名狡猾的竊賊設法從珠寶店偷走了一條鑽石項鍊，而沒有觸動警報器。"},{"w":"waste","p":"v. / n.","d":"to use or expend carelessly or to no purpose","c":"浪費；廢棄物","s":"Please turn off the water faucet while brushing your teeth, and do not waste precious drinking water.","t":"刷牙時請關閉水龍頭，不要浪費寶貴的飲用水資源。"},{"w":"ruin","p":"v. / n.","d":"to destroy, damage severely, or spoil something completely","c":"毀滅；毀壞","s":"The unexpected heavy downpour threatened to ruin our outdoor wedding ceremony, so we moved all the chairs inside.","t":"這場突如其來的傾盆大雨險些毀了我們的戶外婚禮儀式，所以我們把所有椅子都搬到了室內。"}]},{"unit":69,"theme":"Theatrical Performance, Social Behavior, Damage & Story Structure","cards":[{"w":"damage","p":"n. / v.","d":"physical harm caused to something; to inflict harm","c":"損害；毀壞","s":"The severe summer typhoon caused extensive damage to local fruit orchards, destroying thousands of mango trees.","t":"這場強烈的夏季颱風對當地的果園造成了廣泛的損害，摧毀了數千棵芒果樹。"},{"w":"behave","p":"v.","d":"to act or conduct oneself in a specified way","c":"表現；守規矩","s":"The teacher reminded the primary school students to behave politely during their annual field trip to the science museum.","t":"老師提醒小學生在參觀科學博物館的年度校外教學期間，要表現得彬彬有禮。"},{"w":"act","p":"v. / n.","d":"to take action; to perform in a play; a deed","c":"行動；演戲；行為","s":"The young firefighter was awarded a medal for his selfless act of courage in rescuing children from the blazing building.","t":"這位年輕消防員因其從燃燒的大樓中救出兒童的無私英勇行為，被授予了一枚勳章。"},{"w":"action","p":"n.","d":"the process of doing something, typically to achieve an aim","c":"行動；動作","s":"A popular English proverb wisely states that action speaks louder than words when demonstrating genuine commitment.","t":"一則著名的英語諺語明智地指出，在展現真正的承諾時，行動勝於空談。"},{"w":"role","p":"n.","d":"an actor's part in a play; the function assumed by someone","c":"角色；作用","s":"Parents play an essential role in shaping their children's moral character, personal values, and study habits.","t":"父母在塑造子女的道德品格、個人價值觀與學習習慣方面，扮演著至關重要的角色。"},{"w":"stage","p":"n. / v.","d":"a raised floor or platform on which actors perform","c":"舞台；階段","s":"The talented young pianist walked confidently across the wooden stage and bowed politely to the waiting audience.","t":"這位才華洋溢的年輕鋼琴家自信地走過木製舞台，並禮貌地向等待的觀眾鞠躬致意。"},{"w":"audience","p":"n.","d":"the assembled spectators or listeners at a public event","c":"觀眾；聽眾","s":"At the conclusion of the thrilling theatrical drama, the entire audience stood up and gave the actors a standing ovation.","t":"在這齣扣人心弦的話劇結尾，全體觀眾起立為演員們起立鼓掌。"},{"w":"beginning","p":"n.","d":"the point in time or space at which something starts","c":"開始；起初","s":"For the young university graduate, moving to this new city marked the exciting beginning of an independent career.","t":"對這位年輕的大學畢業生而言，搬到這座新城市標誌著一段獨立職業生涯的令人興奮的開始。"},{"w":"end","p":"n. / v.","d":"the final part of something; to terminate","c":"結束；末端","s":"The championship soccer match remained scoreless until the very end of the second half, when a striker scored.","t":"這場足球冠軍賽一直未分勝負，直到下半場即將結束之際，一名前鋒攻進了一球。"},{"w":"pause","p":"v. / n.","d":"a temporary stop in action or speech; to stop briefly","c":"暫停；停頓","s":"The eloquent speaker made a dramatic pause before revealing the final conclusion of his environmental research.","t":"這位雄辯的演講者在透露其環境研究的最終結論之前，戲劇性地停頓了一下。"}]},{"unit":70,"theme":"Perseverance, Completion, Invention, Design & Creative Excellence","cards":[{"w":"continue","p":"v.","d":"to keep happening or existing without stopping","c":"繼續；持續","s":"Although heavy snow fell across the highway, the rescue team decided to continue their search for the missing hikers.","t":"儘管大雪降在公路上，搜救隊仍決定繼續搜尋失蹤的登山客。"},{"w":"complete","p":"v. / adj.","d":"to finish making or doing; having all parts","c":"完成；完整的","s":"The architect expects the engineering team to complete the construction of the new community center before December.","t":"建築師期望工程團隊在十二月前完成新社區中心的建設。"},{"w":"obey","p":"v.","d":"to submit to the authority of someone or comply with rules","c":"服從；遵守","s":"Soldiers in military training are taught to obey their commander's orders immediately and without hesitation.","t":"接受軍事訓練的士兵被教導要毫不猶豫且立即服從指揮官的命令。"},{"w":"bother","p":"v. / n.","d":"to take the trouble to do something; to annoy; trouble","c":"打擾；麻煩；費心","s":"I am very sorry to bother you while you are reading, but could you please lend me your English dictionary?","t":"非常抱歉在你閱讀時打擾你，但能否請你把你的英文詞典借給我？"},{"w":"imagine","p":"v.","d":"to form a mental image or concept of something","c":"想像","s":"Can you imagine living on a tropical island with turquoise ocean waters, gentle breezes, and no internet access?","t":"你能想像生活在一個擁有青綠色海水、柔和微風且沒有網路的熱帶島嶼上嗎？"},{"w":"invent","p":"v.","d":"to create or design something that has not existed before","c":"發明；創造","s":"Alexander Graham Bell worked for years in his workshop to invent the first practical electrical telephone.","t":"亞歷山大·格拉漢姆·貝爾在他的工作室中鑽研了多年，發明了第一部實用的電動電話。"},{"w":"create","p":"v.","d":"to bring something into existence through skill or imagination","c":"創造；建立","s":"The innovative graphic artist used digital software to create a series of breathtaking animations for the video game.","t":"這位極具創新精神的平面藝術家利用數位軟體，為這款電玩遊戲創造了一系列令人驚嘆的動畫。"},{"w":"design","p":"v. / n.","d":"to plan and make artistic drawings for a product; a plan","c":"設計；構思","s":"A famous Italian architect was hired to design the modern glass facade of the international art museum.","t":"一位著名的義大利建築師受聘為這座國際藝術博物館設計現代化的玻璃外牆。"},{"w":"single","p":"adj.","d":"only one; not accompanied by others; unmarried","c":"單一的；單身的","s":"The hotel receptionist politely asked the business traveler whether he needed a single room or a double suite.","t":"飯店櫃檯接待員禮貌地詢問這位出差旅客，他是需要單人房還是雙人套房。"},{"w":"perfect","p":"adj.","d":"having all the desirable elements, qualities, or characteristics","c":"完美的；極佳的","s":"With a clear blue sky, warm sunshine, and mild breeze, this afternoon is the perfect weather for an outdoor picnic.","t":"藍天晴朗、陽光溫暖、微風輕和，今天下午是進行戶外野餐的完美天氣。"}]},{"unit":71,"theme":"Social Etiquette, Greetings, Body Language & Marriage","cards":[{"w":"partner","p":"n.","d":"a person who takes part in an undertaking with another","c":"夥伴；搭檔；伴侶","s":"David and his business partner established an online software company together, and their profits grew rapidly in the first year.","t":"大衛和他的商業【夥伴】一起創立了一家線上軟體公司，他們的利潤在第一年迅速增長。"},{"w":"friendship","p":"n.","d":"the state of being friends; a close relationship","c":"友誼；交情","s":"True friendship is built upon trust and mutual respect, and it often grows stronger whenever friends overcome difficulties together.","t":"真正的【友誼】建立在信任與相互尊重之上，而且每當朋友們一起克服困難時，它往往會變得更加深厚。"},{"w":"marry","p":"v.","d":"to become the husband or wife of someone in a legal ceremony","c":"結婚；嫁；娶","s":"After dating happily for six years, Michael decided to marry Sarah, and they planned a beautiful garden ceremony for next spring.","t":"在愉快交往了六年之後，麥可決定與莎拉【結婚】，他們計畫在明年春天舉行一場美麗的花園典禮。"},{"w":"marriage","p":"n.","d":"the formal state of being married as husband and wife","c":"婚姻；婚姻生活","s":"A long and happy marriage requires patience and honest communication, so both partners must work together through life challenges.","t":"一段長久而幸福的【婚姻】需要耐心與坦誠的溝通，因此雙方伴侶都必須共同面對生活中的各項挑戰。"},{"w":"congratulations","p":"n.","d":"words expressing praise or good wishes on a special occasion","c":"祝賀；恭喜","s":"The principal offered warm congratulations to all the graduating students, and the proud parents took memorable photographs outside the auditorium.","t":"校長向所有畢業生致以熱烈的【祝賀】，驕傲的家長們在大禮堂外拍下了值得留念的照片。"},{"w":"clap","p":"v.","d":"to strike the palms of the hands together with a sudden sharp sound","c":"鼓掌；拍手","s":"When the young pianist finished her difficult musical performance, the entire audience stood up to clap enthusiastically.","t":"當那位年輕的鋼琴家結束她難度極高的音樂演奏時，全體觀眾紛紛起立熱情地【鼓掌】。"},{"w":"bow","p":"v. / n.","d":"to bend the body or head forwards as a sign of respect","c":"鞠躬；鞠躬致敬","s":"Before beginning their traditional Japanese tea ceremony, the hosts and their honored guests exchanged a formal polite bow.","t":"在開始傳統的日本茶道之前，主人與他們尊貴的賓客互相行了一個正式且有禮的【鞠躬】。"},{"w":"shake","p":"v.","d":"to move with quick, short movements from side to side or up and down","c":"搖動；握手","s":"When meeting the foreign business executive for the first time, you should smile politely and shake hands firmly.","t":"第一次與外國企業高層主管見面時，你應該禮貌地微笑並堅定地【握手】。"},{"w":"greet","p":"v.","d":"to welcome or say hello to someone with words or actions","c":"問候；迎接；打招呼","s":"Every weekday morning, the friendly hotel manager stands near the front entrance to greet all the international guests with a warm smile.","t":"每個工作日早晨，這位友善的飯店經理都會站在正門附近，帶著溫暖的微笑【問候】所有國際賓客。"},{"w":"hey","p":"interj.","d":"an informal exclamation used to attract attention or express greeting","c":"嘿（打招呼或引起注意）","s":"\"hey, look across the street right now, because your favorite movie star is signing autographs for waiting fans!\" whispered Jerry excitedly.","t":"「【嘿】，現在快看街道對面，因為你最喜歡的電影明星正在為等候的粉絲簽名！」傑瑞興奮地低語道。"}]},{"unit":72,"theme":"Actions, Financial Earnings, Loss & Discovery","cards":[{"w":"roll","p":"v. / n.","d":"to move along by turning over and over; a small bread roll","c":"滾動；捲；麵包捲","s":"The cheerful children ran up the grassy green hill, and then they giggled happily as they began to roll down together.","t":"活潑的孩子們跑上長滿青草的山丘，然後當他們開始一起往下【滾動】時開心地咯咯笑了起來。"},{"w":"earn","p":"v.","d":"to obtain money in return for labor or services","c":"賺取；賺得；贏得","s":"Although Brian is only a university student, he works hard at night to earn enough money for his living expenses.","t":"雖然布萊恩只是一名大學生，但他晚上努力工作以【賺取】足夠的生活費用。"},{"w":"gain","p":"v. / n.","d":"to obtain or acquire something desirable; an increase","c":"獲得；增加；獲利","s":"Working on the international volunteer team helped Linda gain valuable life experience and improved her spoken English significantly.","t":"在國際志工團隊工作幫助琳達【獲得】了寶貴的人生經驗，並顯著提升了她的英語口說能力。"},{"w":"provide","p":"v.","d":"to make available for use; to supply","c":"提供；供應","s":"The local community center decided to provide free warm meals and temporary blankets for homeless people during the cold winter.","t":"當地社區中心決定在寒冬期間為無家可歸者【提供】免費熱食與臨時保暖毛毯。"},{"w":"offer","p":"v. / n.","d":"to present something for acceptance or refusal; a proposal","c":"提議；提供；出價","s":"The tech company was deeply impressed by Kevin's computer skills, so the manager decided to offer him a high-paying job.","t":"這家科技公司對凱文的電腦技術留下了深刻印象，因此經理決定向他【提供】一份高薪工作。"},{"w":"missing","p":"adj.","d":"not present or unable to be found; lost","c":"失蹤的；找不到的","s":"The worried family searched everywhere across the neighborhood, but their missing pet dog was nowhere to be found until morning.","t":"焦急的家人在社區裡四處尋找，但直到早晨他們那隻【失蹤的】寵物狗依然無影無蹤。"},{"w":"disappear","p":"v.","d":"to cease to be visible; to vanish from sight","c":"消失；不見","s":"The huge ship sailed slowly toward the distant horizon, and it finally seemed to disappear completely into the thick coastal fog.","t":"那艘巨大的輪船緩緩駛向遠方的地平線，最後似乎完全【消失】在濃厚的沿海霧氣之中。"},{"w":"discover","p":"v.","d":"to find or learn something unexpectedly or in the course of a search","c":"發現；發掘","s":"Archaeologists traveled deep into the jungle last summer, and they were amazed to discover an ancient stone temple hidden by vines.","t":"考古學家去年夏天深入叢林，驚訝地【發現】了一座被藤蔓掩蓋的古代石造神廟。"},{"w":"raise","p":"v. / n.","d":"to lift or move to a higher position; an increase in salary","c":"舉起；提高；加薪","s":"If any student knows the correct answer to this grammar question, please raise your right hand and speak clearly.","t":"如果任何學生知道這個文法題目的正確答案，請【舉起】你的右手並清晰發言。"},{"w":"lift","p":"v. / n.","d":"to raise to a higher position; a ride in a car","c":"舉起；抬起；搭便車","s":"The wooden carton was packed with heavy science textbooks, so Jonathan asked his brother to help him lift it into the truck.","t":"木箱裡裝滿了沉重的科學教科書，因此強納森請他弟弟幫忙一起將它【抬起】搬上卡車。"}]},{"unit":73,"theme":"Physical Actions, Travel, Tourism & Guidance","cards":[{"w":"lay","p":"v.","d":"to put something down gently or flat in a particular place","c":"放置；鋪設；產卵","s":"The caring mother gently began to lay the sleeping baby in the crib, and then she quietly closed the bedroom door.","t":"關懷備至的母親輕輕地開始將熟睡的嬰兒【放置】在嬰兒床上，然後她悄悄關上了臥室的門。"},{"w":"throw","p":"v.","d":"to send something through the air with force by the hand","c":"投擲；丟；扔","s":"When the baseball coach signaled from the bench, the young pitcher prepared to throw the ball across the plate.","t":"當棒球教練從長凳上給予信號時，年輕的投手準備將球【投擲】穿過本壘板。"},{"w":"slide","p":"v. / n.","d":"to move smoothly along a surface; a playground apparatus","c":"滑動；滑行；溜滑梯","s":"Because the mountain highway was covered with slippery ice, the red car began to slide dangerously toward the roadside.","t":"因為山區公路覆蓋著濕滑的冰，那輛紅色轎車開始危險地朝路邊【滑行】。"},{"w":"shut","p":"v. / adj.","d":"to close something so that it is not open","c":"關閉；闔上；關閉的","s":"Before the cold winter storm arrived, the farmer remembered to shut all the wooden barn windows securely.","t":"在寒冷的冬季暴風雨抵達之前，農夫記得將所有木質穀倉的窗戶牢牢【關閉】。"},{"w":"treat","p":"v. / n.","d":"to behave towards someone; to buy food for someone; a pleasant event","c":"對待；請客；款待","s":"Since it was Peter's twenty-first birthday, his generous uncle offered to treat the entire family to a luxurious seafood feast.","t":"因為今天是彼得的二十一歲生日，他慷慨的叔叔主動提出要【請客】招待全家人享用一頓豪華海鮮大餐。"},{"w":"travel","p":"v. / n.","d":"to make a journey, typically of some length","c":"旅行；行進；遊歷","s":"After graduating from college with honors, Lisa decided to travel across Europe for three months to experience new cultures.","t":"在以優異成績從大學畢業後，麗莎決定橫跨歐洲【旅行】三個月以體驗新的文化。"},{"w":"tour","p":"n. / v.","d":"a journey for pleasure in which several places are visited","c":"導覽；巡迴；觀光","s":"The friendly foreign student signed up for a guided walking tour of the historic district, and he took many photographs.","t":"那位友善的外國學生報名參加了歷史街區的有導遊步行的【導覽】，並且拍了許多照片。"},{"w":"sail","p":"v. / n.","d":"to travel in a boat or ship using wind power or an engine","c":"航行；揚帆行駛；帆","s":"The courageous captain prepared to sail across the wide ocean, although heavy storm warnings were announced on the radio.","t":"儘管廣播中發布了嚴重的暴風雨警報，英勇的船長依然準備好【航行】橫跨遼闊的海洋。"},{"w":"guide","p":"v. / n.","d":"to direct or show the way; a person who shows the way","c":"引導；指引；導遊","s":"The experienced mountain volunteer agreed to guide the foreign hikers safely through the foggy canyon trails.","t":"那位經驗豐富的登山志工同意【指引】外國登山客安全穿過多霧的峽谷步道。"},{"w":"chase","p":"v. / n.","d":"to pursue in order to catch or catch up with","c":"追逐；追趕；追捕","s":"The clever farm dog started to chase the stray fox away from the chicken coop, barking loudly across the orchard.","t":"那隻聰明的農場牧羊犬開始將流浪狐狸從雞舍旁【追趕】開來，在果園裡大聲吠叫。"}]},{"unit":74,"theme":"Pursuit, Movement, Physical Actions & Consequences","cards":[{"w":"trap","p":"v. / n.","d":"to catch an animal in a trap; a device for catching animals","c":"設陷阱捕捉；陷阱；使受困","s":"When the old apartment building caught fire, thick smoke began to trap several terrified residents on the top floor.","t":"當這棟老舊公寓大樓失火時，濃煙開始將幾名驚恐的住戶【受困】在頂樓。"},{"w":"hunt","p":"v. / n.","d":"to pursue and kill a wild animal for food or sport","c":"打獵；搜尋；狩獵","s":"In ancient times, forest tribes used handmade bows and arrows to hunt wild deer and boars for winter survival.","t":"在古代，森林部落使用手工製作的弓箭【打獵】野鹿和野豬以在冬季生存。"},{"w":"search","p":"v. / n.","d":"to look through carefully in order to find something or someone","c":"搜尋；搜查；尋找","s":"Police officers and rescue volunteers organized a wide line to search the snowy mountain slope for the missing climbers.","t":"警員與搜救志工排成寬闊的一字隊形，在白雪覆蓋的山坡上【搜尋】失蹤的登山客。"},{"w":"seek","p":"v.","d":"to attempt to find or obtain something","c":"尋找；尋求；謀求","s":"If high school students feel overwhelmed by academic stress, they should always seek advice from counselors or teachers.","t":"如果高中生感到學業壓力過大難以承受，他們應該隨時向輔導老師或教師【尋求】建議。"},{"w":"object","p":"n. / v.","d":"a material thing that can be seen and touched; to express disapproval","c":"物體；物件；反對","s":"The science teacher brought a mysterious metal object into the classroom to demonstrate how magnetic forces work.","t":"理化老師把一個神秘的金屬【物件】帶進教室，以展示磁力是如何運作的。"},{"w":"hop","p":"v. / n.","d":"to move by jumping on one foot or all feet together","c":"單腳跳；跳躍","s":"The fluffy white rabbit began to hop across the vegetable garden, searching eagerly for fresh green lettuce.","t":"那隻毛茸茸的白兔開始在菜園裡一跳一跳地【跳躍】，急切地尋找新鮮翠綠的萵苣。"},{"w":"slip","p":"v. / n.","d":"to slide accidentally, causing a fall; a small piece of paper","c":"滑倒；滑落；紙條","s":"The elderly man happened to slip on the wet kitchen tiles this morning, and he unfortunately bruised his left knee.","t":"那位年邁的先生今天早上碰巧在濕滑的廚房磁磚上【滑倒】，不幸挫傷了他的左膝蓋。"},{"w":"surf","p":"v. / n.","d":"to ride on waves; to browse information on the internet","c":"衝浪；在網路瀏覽","s":"Young people who live near Kenting love to surf big waves on sunny summer weekends with their colorful boards.","t":"住在墾丁附近的年輕人喜歡在陽光明媚的夏季週末帶著鮮豔的衝浪板去大浪中【衝浪】。"},{"w":"beat","p":"v. / n.","d":"to strike repeatedly; to defeat someone; the rhythm of the heart","c":"敲打；擊敗；心跳跳動","s":"Our school basketball team played with tremendous determination and managed to beat their rivals in the final seconds.","t":"我們學校的籃球隊展現了無比的決心，並在最後幾秒鐘成功【擊敗】了他們的對手。"},{"w":"punish","p":"v.","d":"to inflict a penalty or sanction on someone for an offense","c":"處罰；懲戒","s":"Parents should teach their children with patience rather than punish them harshly whenever they make honest mistakes.","t":"每當孩子犯了無心之過時，父母應該耐心教導孩子，而不是嚴厲地【處罰】他們。"}]},{"unit":75,"theme":"Interpersonal Communication, Secrets, Humor & Decision Making","cards":[{"w":"rush","p":"v. / n.","d":"to move or act with urgent haste; a sudden rapid movement","c":"匆忙；急速前進；匆促","s":"Because the airport express train was departing in ten minutes, the travelers had to rush through the busy station hall.","t":"因為機場快線列車在十分鐘內就要發車，旅客們不得不【匆忙】穿過繁忙的車站大廳。"},{"w":"interrupt","p":"v.","d":"to stop the continuous progress of an activity or speaker","c":"打斷；中斷；打擾","s":"It is considered very impolite to interrupt the teacher while she is explaining an important math concept to the class.","t":"在老師向全班講解重要數學觀念時【打斷】她，被認為是非常不禮貌的行為。"},{"w":"conversation","p":"n.","d":"a talk, especially an informal one, between two or more people","c":"談話；對話；交談","s":"While waiting for their flight at the departure gate, the two tourists had an enjoyable conversation about cultural traditions.","t":"在登機門等候班機時，兩位遊客就文化傳統進行了一場愉快的【交談】。"},{"w":"joke","p":"n. / v.","d":"a thing that someone says to cause amusement or laughter","c":"笑話；開玩笑","s":"The cheerful uncle loved to tell a funny joke at the dinner table, making all his young nephews laugh out loud.","t":"那位開朗的叔叔喜歡在餐桌上講有趣的【笑話】，把他所有的小侄子們逗得哈哈大笑。"},{"w":"trick","p":"n. / v.","d":"a cunning act intended to deceive; to deceive someone","c":"把戲；惡作劇；騙局；欺騙","s":"The clever street magician performed an amazing coin trick, and none of the spectators could figure out how he did it.","t":"那位聰明的街頭魔術師表演了一套神奇的硬幣【把戲】，現場沒有任何觀眾能看穿他是如何辦到的。"},{"w":"secret","p":"n. / adj.","d":"something that is kept unknown or unseen by others","c":"秘密；保密的","s":"Emma promised her best friend that she would keep the surprise party a strict secret until Saturday evening arrived.","t":"艾瑪向她最好的朋友保證，在週六傍晚到來之前，她一定會對這場驚喜派對嚴加【保密】。"},{"w":"silence","p":"n. / v.","d":"complete absence of sound; to make someone stop speaking","c":"寂靜；沉默；使安靜","s":"When the stern judge entered the courtroom and sat down, a sudden respectful silence fell over the entire audience.","t":"當神情嚴肅的法官走進法庭並坐下時，全場旁聽群眾頓時陷入一片恭敬的【寂靜】。"},{"w":"message","p":"n.","d":"a verbal, written, or recorded communication sent to someone","c":"訊息；留言","s":"Since Dr. Lin was performing surgery in the operating room, his assistant asked the caller to leave a brief message.","t":"由於林醫生正在手術室進行手術，他的助理請打電話的人留下一則簡短的【留言】。"},{"w":"choose","p":"v.","d":"to pick out or select as being the best or most appropriate","c":"選擇；挑選","s":"Students in the language department are allowed to choose between French, German, and Spanish for their second foreign language.","t":"語言學系的學生被允許在法語、德語和西班牙語之間【選擇】作為他們的第二外語。"},{"w":"choice","p":"n.","d":"an act of selecting or making a decision when faced with possibilities","c":"選擇；抉擇","s":"Having a diverse menu with vegetarian options gives restaurant customers a much wider choice for their daily lunch.","t":"擁有包含素食選項的豐富菜單，為餐廳顧客的每日午餐提供了更廣泛的【選擇】。"}]},{"unit":76,"theme":"Selection, Advice, Military Commands & Medical Care","cards":[{"w":"select","p":"v.","d":"to carefully choose as being the best or most suitable","c":"挑選；選拔；精選","s":"The panel of music professors convened yesterday morning to select the three most talented pianists for the scholarship.","t":"音樂教授評審團昨天上午召開會議，以【選拔】三位最具才華的鋼琴家獲頒獎學金。"},{"w":"avoid","p":"v.","d":"to keep away from or stop oneself from doing something","c":"避開；避免；預防","s":"Drivers should reduce their speed on icy roads to avoid dangerous accidents during severe winter weather.","t":"駕駛在結冰路面上應降低車速，以【避免】在惡劣冬天天氣下發生危險事故。"},{"w":"omit","p":"v.","d":"to leave out or exclude someone or something either intentionally or forgetfully","c":"省略；遺漏；略去","s":"When filling out this formal visa application, be very careful not to omit any required personal information.","t":"填寫這份正式簽證申請表時，請格外小心，千萬不要【遺漏】任何必要的個人資訊。"},{"w":"command","p":"n. / v.","d":"an authoritative order; to give an authoritative order to","c":"命令；指揮；控制","s":"The brave military officer issued a clear command to his soldiers to retreat to safe positions behind the hill.","t":"英勇的軍官向部下士兵下達了明確的【命令】，要求撤退到山丘後方的安全陣地。"},{"w":"comment","p":"n. / v.","d":"a verbal or written remark expressing an opinion or reaction","c":"評論；意見；發表評論","s":"The government spokesperson declined to make any official comment regarding ongoing sensitive diplomatic negotiations.","t":"政府發言人拒絕對正在進行中的敏感外交談判發表任何官方【評論】。"},{"w":"advise","p":"v.","d":"to offer suggestions about the best course of action to someone","c":"建議；勸告；忠告","s":"Because of high cholesterol levels, the doctor had to advise my father to eat less red meat and exercise daily.","t":"因為膽固醇過高，醫生不得不【建議】我父親少吃紅肉並每天運動。"},{"w":"advice","p":"n.","d":"guidance or recommendations offered with regard to prudent future action","c":"建議；忠告；勸告","s":"My experienced elder sister gave me valuable advice on how to prepare effectively for competitive university entrance exams.","t":"經驗豐富的姐姐給了我寶貴的【建議】，指導我如何有效準備具競爭力的大學入學考試。"},{"w":"truth","p":"n.","d":"the quality or state of being in accordance with fact or reality","c":"真相；事實；真實","s":"In a court of law, every witness is sworn to speak the honest truth before testifying about the crime.","t":"在法庭上，每位證人在就罪行作證之前，都必須宣誓陳述坦率的【真相】。"},{"w":"cure","p":"n. / v.","d":"a substance or treatment that ends a disease; to relieve a person of symptoms","c":"治癒方法；特效藥；治癒","s":"Medical researchers around the globe are working tirelessly to discover an effective cure for Alzheimer's disease.","t":"全球各地的醫學研究人員正不知疲倦地工作，希望能發現阿茲海默症的有效【治癒方法】。"},{"w":"treatment","p":"n.","d":"medical care given to a patient for an illness or injury","c":"治療；療程；處置","s":"The patient responded remarkably well to the physical therapy treatment, and she was able to walk without crutches in a month.","t":"這位病患對物理治療【療程】反應極佳，不到一個月她就能不用拐杖行走了。"}]},{"unit":77,"theme":"Goals, Focus, Categories, Investigation & Realization","cards":[{"w":"focus","p":"v. / n.","d":"to adapt to see clearly; the center of interest or activity","c":"集中；聚焦；焦點","s":"During final exam week, diligent students must focus their attention entirely on their textbooks and avoid social media distractions.","t":"在期末考週期間，勤奮的學生必須將注意力完全【集中】在課本上，並避開社交媒體的干擾。"},{"w":"goal","p":"n.","d":"the object of a person's ambition or effort; an aim or desired result","c":"目標；球門；得分","s":"Setting a clear long-term goal at the beginning of the semester helps learners organize their daily study schedules effectively.","t":"在學期初設定明確的長期【目標】，有助於學習者有效地安排他們的日常讀書計畫。"},{"w":"aim","p":"v. / n.","d":"to point or direct a weapon or effort; a purpose or intention","c":"瞄準；旨在；目標；目的","s":"This community health program is designed to aim at improving physical fitness and dietary nutrition among local senior citizens.","t":"這項社區健康計畫旨在【致力於】提升當地年長者的身體體能與飲食營養。"},{"w":"target","p":"n. / v.","d":"a person or thing aimed at; an objective or result towards which efforts are directed","c":"靶子；目標；針對","s":"The experienced archer drew his wooden bow smoothly and released the arrow directly toward the center of the paper target.","t":"經驗豐富的射手流暢地拉開木弓，將箭矢直接射向紙製【靶子】的中心。"},{"w":"type","p":"n. / v.","d":"a category of people or things having common characteristics; to write with a keyboard","c":"類型；種類；打字","s":"Our school library categorizes books according to their specific literary type, making it easier for students to find research materials.","t":"我們學校的圖書館根據書籍特定的文學【類型】進行分類，使學生更容易找到研究資料。"},{"w":"case","p":"n.","d":"an instance of a particular situation; a legal lawsuit; a container","c":"實例；案件；情況；箱子","s":"The police detective reviewed every detail of the mysterious theft case, searching for clues that previous officers had missed.","t":"刑警仔細審查了這起神秘竊盜【案件】的每個細節，尋找先前警官遺漏的線索。"},{"w":"dot","p":"n. / v.","d":"a small round mark or spot; to mark with a small spot","c":"小圓點；點綴","s":"Linda wore a fashionable vintage blue dress covered with tiny white dot patterns to her best friend's birthday party.","t":"琳達穿著一件點綴著微小白【點】圖案的時尚復古藍色連身裙，去參加她最好朋友的生日派對。"},{"w":"row","p":"n. / v.","d":"a number of people or things in a straight line; to propel a boat with oars","c":"一排；一行；划船","s":"The excited students stood quietly in a neat row outside the museum entrance, waiting patiently for the doors to open.","t":"興奮的學生們在博物館門口安靜地排成整齊的【一排】，耐心等候大門開啟。"},{"w":"trace","p":"v. / n.","d":"to find or discover by investigation; a mark or sign left by something","c":"追蹤；查出；微量；痕跡","s":"Rescue officers used tracking dogs to trace the missing hikers through the snowy canyon, following footprints along the riverbank.","t":"搜救人員使用搜救犬沿著河岸的腳印，在白雪覆蓋的峽谷中【追蹤】失蹤登山客的行蹤。"},{"w":"realize","p":"v.","d":"to become fully aware of something as a fact; to fulfill a dream","c":"意識到；發覺；實現（夢想）","s":"After reviewing his monthly budget statement, Kevin began to realize how much unnecessary money he had spent on restaurant takeout.","t":"在審查了每月預算報表後，凱文開始【意識到】自己在餐廳外賣上花費了多少不必要的金錢。"}]},{"unit":78,"theme":"Mental Perceptions, Cognitive Thought & Expressive Speech","cards":[{"w":"forgive","p":"v.","d":"to stop feeling angry or resentful towards someone for an offense","c":"原諒；寬恕","s":"Although Jack felt deeply hurt by his brother's harsh words, he chose to forgive him and restore their family harmony.","t":"雖然傑克被哥哥嚴厲的話語深深傷害，但他選擇【原諒】他並恢復家庭和睦。"},{"w":"seem","p":"v.","d":"to give the impression of being something; to appear","c":"似乎；看起來好像","s":"The difficult math problems seem very complicated at first glance, but they become much easier once you understand the formula.","t":"這些數學難題乍看之下【似乎】非常複雜，但一旦你理解了公式，它們就會變得簡單許多。"},{"w":"assume","p":"v.","d":"to suppose to be the case without proof","c":"假定；設想；以為","s":"You should never assume that a quiet person lacks opinions, because many thoughtful people simply prefer to listen carefully.","t":"你絕不應該【以為】沉默的人沒有主見，因為許多有思想的人只是更喜歡仔細傾聽。"},{"w":"consider","p":"v.","d":"to think carefully about something, typically before making a decision","c":"考慮；斟酌；認為","s":"Before purchasing that expensive sports car, you must carefully consider whether you can afford the monthly maintenance costs.","t":"在購買那輛昂貴的跑車之前，你必須仔細【考慮】自己是否負擔得起每月的維護保養費用。"},{"w":"expect","p":"v.","d":"to regard something as likely to happen; to anticipate","c":"預期；期待；指望","s":"Meteorologists report that cold mountain winds are moving south, so residents should expect heavy snowfall throughout the weekend.","t":"氣象學家報告指出寒冷的山風正往南移動，因此居民們應【預期】整個週末都會降下大雪。"},{"w":"express","p":"v. / adj. / adv.","d":"to convey a thought or feeling in words or gestures; rapid","c":"表達；表示；快速的；特快","s":"Art classes in junior high school provide creative students with an ideal medium to express their complex inner emotions.","t":"國中的美術課程為富有創造力的學生提供了一個理想的媒介，以【表達】他們複雜的內心感受。"},{"w":"inspire","p":"v.","d":"to fill someone with the urge or ability to do or feel something creative","c":"鼓舞；啟發；激勵","s":"The brave Paralympic athlete's triumphant life story continues to inspire millions of young people around the world.","t":"那位殘奧勇敢運動員輝煌的人生故事，持續在全世界【激勵】著數百萬名年輕人。"},{"w":"promise","p":"v. / n.","d":"to assure someone that one will definitely do something; an assurance","c":"承諾；答應；保證","s":"Before leaving for boarding school, the young boy made a sincere promise to write letters to his parents every Sunday.","t":"在啟程前往寄宿學校之前，那名小男孩鄭重地許下了【承諾】，保證每週日都會寫信給父母。"},{"w":"remind","p":"v.","d":"to cause someone to remember someone or something","c":"提醒；使想起","s":"Please set an alarm on your digital phone to remind you to take your heart medication after eating dinner.","t":"請在你的智慧型手機上設定鬧鐘，以【提醒】你在吃完晚餐後服用心臟藥物。"},{"w":"emphasize","p":"v.","d":"to give special importance or prominence to something in speaking or writing","c":"強調；著重","s":"Our English teacher repeatedly uses red markers on the whiteboard to emphasize the importance of mastering irregular verbs.","t":"我們的英文老師反覆在白板上使用紅色白板筆，以【強調】掌握不規則動詞的重要性。"}]},{"unit":79,"theme":"Psychological Reactions, Physical Strikes, Communication & Handling","cards":[{"w":"compare","p":"v.","d":"to estimate, measure, or note the similarity or dissimilarity between","c":"比較；對照；比擬","s":"Consumer advocacy groups advise shoppers to compare prices across several online platforms before making big purchases.","t":"消費者權益倡導團體建議購物者在進行大宗消費之前，應先在數個網路平台之間【比較】價格。"},{"w":"confuse","p":"v.","d":"to make someone bewildered, perplexed, or unable to think clearly","c":"使困惑；使混亂；弄錯","s":"The twin brothers looked remarkably alike in their blue school uniforms, which continued to confuse their new math teacher.","t":"這對雙胞胎兄弟穿著藍色校服時模樣驚人地相似，這讓他們的新數學老師持續感到【困惑】。"},{"w":"excite","p":"v.","d":"to cause strong feelings of enthusiasm, eagerness, or excitement","c":"使興奮；激起；刺激","s":"News of the upcoming musical concert featuring famous rock singers will definitely excite thousands of teenagers across the city.","t":"即將舉辦由著名搖滾歌手主演的音樂演唱會的消息，肯定會【使】全城數千名青少年【興奮】不已。"},{"w":"strike","p":"v. / n.","d":"to hit forcibly; an organized refusal to work by employees","c":"打擊；罷工；襲擊","s":"Railway workers decided to go on strike this Monday morning to demand safer working environments and better compensation.","t":"鐵路工人決定在週一上午發動【罷工】，以爭取更安全的工作環境與更佳的報酬。"},{"w":"effect","p":"n. / v.","d":"a change which is a result or consequence of an action or other cause","c":"效果；影響；產生","s":"Scientists warn that excessive screen time before bedtime can have a very negative effect on children's natural sleep cycles.","t":"科學家警告，睡前過度使用螢幕會對兒童的自然睡眠週期產生極為負面的【影響】。"},{"w":"desire","p":"n. / v.","d":"a strong feeling of wanting to have something or wishing for something","c":"渴望；慾望；期望","s":"From a very young age, Maria harbored a passionate desire to become a medical doctor and serve impoverished rural communities.","t":"從很小的時候起，瑪麗亞就懷著成為一名醫生並為貧困鄉村社區服務的熱切【渴望】。"},{"w":"cancel","p":"v.","d":"to decide or announce that a planned event will not take place","c":"取消；廢止","s":"Because an unexpected super typhoon was approaching the island, the airline was forced to cancel all domestic flights.","t":"由於一場出乎意料的強烈颱風正逼近該島，航空公司不得不【取消】所有國內航班。"},{"w":"dial","p":"v. / n.","d":"to call a telephone number; a face of a clock or gauge","c":"撥電話；刻度盤；儀表盤","s":"In cases of severe fire emergencies, citizens in Taiwan should immediately dial 119 for immediate rescue assistance.","t":"在發生嚴重火災緊急情況時，台灣民眾應立即【撥打】119 以尋求即刻的救援協助。"},{"w":"comb","p":"n. / v.","d":"a toothed strip of plastic or metal used for styling hair; to search","c":"梳子；梳理頭髮；仔細搜查","s":"Before stepping onto the stage for his graduation speech, Kevin used a wooden comb to arrange his messy hair neatly.","t":"在步上舞台發表畢業演講之前，凱文用一把木【梳子】將凌亂的頭髮梳理整齊。"},{"w":"handle","p":"v. / n.","d":"to manage or deal with; the part by which a thing is held","c":"處理；應對；把手；柄","s":"Experienced hotel managers know how to handle angry customer complaints with calmness, patience, and professional diplomacy.","t":"經驗豐富的飯店經理懂得如何以冷靜、耐心與專業圓融來【處理】憤怒顧客的抱怨。"}]},{"unit":80,"theme":"Daily Tasks, Clothing, Speech, Delivery & Problem Solving","cards":[{"w":"button","p":"n. / v.","d":"a small disc used to fasten clothes; to fasten clothes","c":"鈕扣；按鈕；扣上鈕扣","s":"Before stepping out into the chilly winter wind, remember to securely button your wool coat up to your neck.","t":"在踏入刺骨的冬風之前，請記得將你的羊毛大衣【扣上鈕扣】一路扣到脖子。"},{"w":"fit","p":"v. / adj.","d":"to be of the right size or shape for; in good physical health","c":"合身；合適；健康的","s":"The stylish leather jacket was too small to fit Jason comfortably, so he had to exchange it for a larger size.","t":"那件時尚的皮夾克太小了不【合身】，傑森穿起來不舒服，所以他只得換成更大的尺寸。"},{"w":"pronounce","p":"v.","d":"to make the sound of a word or letter in a particular way","c":"發音；讀音；宣判","s":"Foreign language students often find it challenging to correctly pronounce French words with silent final consonants.","t":"外語學生經常發現在遇到結尾有不發音子音的法語單字時，要正確地【發音】是相當具有挑戰性的。"},{"w":"deliver","p":"v.","d":"to bring and hand over a letter, parcel, or goods to the proper recipient","c":"遞送；運送；發表（演說）","s":"The friendly courier promised to deliver the urgent legal documents directly to the client's office before noon.","t":"親切的快遞員保證會在中午之前將這份緊急法律文件直接【遞送】到客戶的辦公室。"},{"w":"receive","p":"v.","d":"to be given, presented with, or paid something","c":"收到；接收；得到","s":"Every registered participant in the academic conference will receive an official certificate of completion and study materials.","t":"學術研討會的每位註冊與會者都將【收到】一份正式的結業證書與學習教材。"},{"w":"depend","p":"v.","d":"to be determined or decided by something else; to rely on","c":"取決於；依賴；依靠","s":"Whether our high school baseball team can practice outdoors this afternoon will completely depend on the weather conditions.","t":"我們高中棒球隊今天下午能否在室外進行練球，將完全【取決於】天氣狀況。"},{"w":"guard","p":"v. / n.","d":"to watch over in order to protect or control; a protector","c":"守衛；保衛；警衛","s":"Two armed security officers were hired by the national museum to guard the priceless diamond exhibition day and night.","t":"國家博物館聘請了兩名武裝警衛人員，日夜【守衛】這場價值連城的鑽石展覽。"},{"w":"rent","p":"v. / n.","d":"to pay someone for the use of something; a regular payment","c":"租用；出租；租金","s":"During their summer road trip along the Pacific coast, the college students decided to rent a camper van.","t":"在沿著太平洋海岸進行夏季公路旅行期間，大學生們決定【租用】一輛露營車。"},{"w":"solve","p":"v.","d":"to find an answer to, explanation for, or means of dealing with a problem","c":"解決；解答；解開","s":"Dedicated environmental engineers are working hard to solve the serious groundwater pollution problem in this industrial town.","t":"敬業的環境工程師們正努力工作，以【解決】這個工業城鎮嚴重的地下水污染問題。"},{"w":"solution","p":"n.","d":"a means of solving a problem or dealing with a difficult situation","c":"解決方法；解答；溶液","s":"Installing solar panels on the school roof provided an eco-friendly and cost-effective solution for high electricity bills.","t":"在學校屋頂安裝太陽能電池板，為高昂的電費帳單提供了一個環保且具成本效益的【解決方法】。"}]},{"unit":81,"theme":"Physical Actions, Movement Dynamics & Natural Phenomena","cards":[{"w":"include","p":"v.","d":"to contain or make someone or something part of a group","c":"包含；包括","s":"The full registration fee will include all seminar materials and warm buffet lunches, but hotel rooms must be booked separately.","t":"全額註冊費將會包含所有研討會資料和熱騰騰的自助午餐，但飯店房間必須分開預訂。"},{"w":"mix","p":"v. / n.","d":"to combine different things together; a combination","c":"混合；混合物","s":"You should gently mix the fresh flour and eggs in a large glass bowl before you add milk to bake the cake.","t":"在加入牛奶烘烤蛋糕之前，你應該先在一個大玻璃碗中輕輕混合新鮮麵粉和雞蛋。"},{"w":"rise","p":"v. / n.","d":"to move upwards; to increase in level or amount","c":"上升；升起","s":"When morning comes over the eastern hills, the bright sun begins to rise slowly, and songbirds start singing loudly in the forest.","t":"當清晨降臨在東方山丘上時，明亮的太陽開始緩緩升起，而鳴鳥也開始在森林中大聲歌唱。"},{"w":"rub","p":"v. / n.","d":"to move your hand or an object back and forth across a surface","c":"摩擦；搓揉","s":"Because the cold winter wind made his hands freeze, Jimmy had to rub his palms together quickly to produce some warmth.","t":"因為寒冷的冬風讓他的雙手凍僵，吉米不得不迅速搓揉手掌以產生些許溫暖。"},{"w":"shoot","p":"v.","d":"to fire a bullet or arrow; to kick or hit a ball toward a goal","c":"射擊；發射；射門","s":"The brave soldier received a strict military command not to shoot his rifle unless the enemy forces entered the border zone.","t":"這位英勇的士兵接到了嚴格的軍事命令，除非敵軍進入邊境地帶，否則不得發射步槍。"},{"w":"shock","p":"n. / v.","d":"a sudden violent shaking; a state of extreme surprise","c":"震驚；使震驚","s":"The tragic news of the plane crash came as a terrible shock to everyone in town, and neighbors gathered in tears to support the family.","t":"空難的悲慘消息給鎮上的每個人帶來極大的震驚，鄰居們含著淚水聚集在一起支持家屬。"},{"w":"shine","p":"v. / n.","d":"to produce or reflect light; brightness","c":"發光；照耀","s":"After three rainy days on the island, the afternoon sun began to shine through the clouds, and children ran outside happily.","t":"在島上下了三天的雨之後，午後的陽光開始穿透雲層照耀，孩子們高興地跑到戶外玩耍。"},{"w":"print","p":"v. / n.","d":"to produce words or pictures on paper using a machine","c":"印刷；列印","s":"Before the board meeting begins tomorrow morning, our office secretary needs to print thirty copies of the annual financial report.","t":"在明天早上的董事會開始之前，我們的辦公室秘書需要列印三十份年度財務報告。"},{"w":"printer","p":"n.","d":"a machine connected to a computer for producing text or pictures","c":"印表機","s":"Our department purchased a high-speed laser printer yesterday, and it works quietly and saves lots of valuable time for our staff.","t":"我們部門昨天採購了一台高速雷射印表機，它運作安靜且為我們的員工節省了許多寶貴的時間。"},{"w":"burst","p":"v. / n.","d":"to break open suddenly and violently; a sudden display","c":"爆裂；突然爆發","s":"The red party balloon was blown up too large by the careless boy, and it suddenly burst with a very loud noise.","t":"那個粗心的小男孩把紅色的派對氣球吹得太大了，結果它突然爆裂並發出很大的聲響。"}]},{"unit":82,"theme":"Cultural Traditions, Customs, Social Etiquette & Household Safety","cards":[{"w":"appreciate","p":"v.","d":"to recognize the good qualities of someone or something; to be grateful for","c":"感激；欣賞","s":"The foreign exchange student was very polite, and she wrote a heartfelt thank-you card to appreciate the kindness of her host family.","t":"這位外國交換學生非常懂禮貌，她寫了一張由衷的感謝卡以感激寄宿家庭的善意。"},{"w":"introduce","p":"v.","d":"to make someone known by name to another person","c":"介紹；引進","s":"When you arrive at the international business conference tomorrow, our team manager will gladly introduce you to our overseas clients.","t":"當你明天到達國際商業會議時，我們的團隊經理會很高興將你介紹給我們的海外客戶。"},{"w":"decorate","p":"v.","d":"to make something more attractive by adding pretty things","c":"裝飾；佈置","s":"Before the festive holiday dinner begins on Christmas Eve, the children always gather in the living room to decorate the tall tree.","t":"在平安夜節日晚餐開始之前，孩子們總是聚集在客廳裝飾那棵高大的樹。"},{"w":"mask","p":"n. / v.","d":"a covering worn over all or part of the face; to hide something","c":"面具；口罩；遮掩","s":"To protect elderly family members from the seasonal influenza virus, everyone was advised to wear a protective medical mask in public.","t":"為了保護年長的家庭成員免受季節性流感病毒的侵害，建議大家在公共場合佩戴醫療防護口罩。"},{"w":"alarm","p":"n. / v.","d":"a warning sound or device; a feeling of sudden fear","c":"警報；警鈴；使驚恐","s":"Every residential apartment in the modern building is equipped with a sensitive smoke alarm to detect dangerous fires quickly.","t":"現代化大樓中的每間住宅公寓都配備了靈敏的煙霧警報器，以便快速發現危險火災。"},{"w":"culture","p":"n.","d":"the customs, beliefs, art, and way of life of a particular society","c":"文化","s":"Traveling to different countries allows students to learn about foreign culture and understand diverse lifestyles with open minds.","t":"到不同的國家旅行可以讓學生了解外國文化，並以開放的心態理解多樣的生活方式。"},{"w":"tradition","p":"n.","d":"a belief, principle, or way of acting that has continued for a long time","c":"傳統","s":"Eating mooncakes and watching the bright full moon with relatives is an ancient cultural tradition celebrated across Taiwan every autumn.","t":"與親戚一起吃月餅和賞滿月是每年秋天全台灣都慶祝的古老文化傳統。"},{"w":"custom","p":"n.","d":"a way of behaving or a belief that has been established for a long time","c":"習俗；慣例","s":"Taking off shoes before entering someone's private home is an important local custom that visitors must follow respectfully.","t":"進入他人的私人住宅前脫鞋是一項重要的當地習俗，訪客必須恭敬遵守。"},{"w":"pattern","p":"n.","d":"a repeated decorative design; a particular way in which something is done","c":"圖案；花樣；模式","s":"The traditional silk dress had an intricate flower pattern woven with golden threads that caught everyone's admiration at the party.","t":"這件傳統絲綢連衣裙織有用金線編織的複雜花朵圖案，在派對上贏得所有人的讚賞。"},{"w":"manner","p":"n.","d":"the way in which something is done; polite ways of behaving","c":"方式；禮貌；規矩","s":"Parents should teach their young children good table manner so that they do not talk loudly with their mouths full of food.","t":"父母應該教導幼童良好的餐桌禮貌，這樣他們就不會在嘴裡塞滿食物時大聲說話。"}]},{"unit":83,"theme":"Architecture, Construction Materials, Scale & Mathematics","cards":[{"w":"style","p":"n.","d":"a particular way in which something is done, created, or performed","c":"風格；式樣","s":"The famous Taiwanese architect designed the library in a modern minimalist style, with floor-to-ceiling glass windows and wooden walls.","t":"這位著名的台灣建築師以現代極簡風格設計了這座圖書館，配有落地玻璃窗和木質牆壁。"},{"w":"plus","p":"prep. / n.","d":"added to; with the addition of; an advantage","c":"加；加上；優勢","s":"The total price of the set lunch is two hundred dollars plus ten percent for the service charge, which is reasonable.","t":"這份套餐的總價是兩百元加上百分之十的服務費，價格十分合理。"},{"w":"minus","p":"prep. / n.","d":"reduced by; subtracting; a disadvantage","c":"減；減去；缺點","s":"During freezing winter nights in high mountains, the outside temperature often drops to minus five degrees Celsius.","t":"在寒冷的冬夜裡，高山上的室外氣溫經常降至零下五度。"},{"w":"straw","p":"n.","d":"dried yellow stems of wheat; a thin plastic tube for drinking","c":"稻草；吸管","s":"Because the young child could not hold the cold glass steadily, the friendly waitress kindly brought her a flexible drinking straw.","t":"因為那個幼童拿不穩冰涼的玻璃杯，和藹的女服務生好心地拿來了一根可彎曲的飲用吸管。"},{"w":"brick","p":"n.","d":"a rectangular block of hard clay used for building walls","c":"磚塊","s":"In the famous children's fairy tale, the third little pig worked hard and built a solid house made of red brick.","t":"在著名的童話故事中，第三隻小豬辛勤工作，建造了一座用紅磚砌成的堅固房屋。"},{"w":"tiny","p":"adj.","d":"extremely small in size or amount","c":"極小的；微小的","s":"When the newborn kitten opened its round eyes for the first time, it made a tiny meow and snuggled next to its mother.","t":"當剛出生的小貓第一次睜開圓圓的眼睛時，牠發出了一聲微弱的喵叫，並依偎在母親身邊。"},{"w":"grand","p":"adj.","d":"impressive and large or important; splendid","c":"雄偉的；宏大的","s":"The foreign president and his wife attended the grand opening ceremony of the new national performing arts center last night.","t":"外國總統和他的妻子昨晚出席了國家表演藝術中心落成啟用的宏大開幕典禮。"},{"w":"giant","p":"adj. / n.","d":"extremely large; a huge person, animal, or corporation","c":"巨大的；巨人；巨擘","s":"Visitors can see two giant pandas eating fresh green bamboo leaves happily inside the spacious enclosure at Taipei Zoo.","t":"遊客可以在台北動物園寬敞的圍欄內看到兩隻大貓熊高興地吃著新鮮的綠色竹葉。"},{"w":"allow","p":"v.","d":"to give permission for someone to do something","c":"允許；准許","s":"Strict safety regulations in the chemical factory do not allow visitors to enter the testing area without safety goggles.","t":"化學工廠嚴格的安全規定不允許訪客在未佩戴護目鏡的情況下進入測試區域。"},{"w":"arrange","p":"v.","d":"to plan, prepare, or organize something in advance","c":"安排；籌備；整理","s":"Our school counselor will gladly arrange a private face-to-face consultation for parents who need advice on university admissions.","t":"我們的學校輔導老師會很樂意為需要大學入學建議的家長安排私人的面對面諮詢。"}]},{"unit":84,"theme":"Limits, Value, Treasured Memories & Overseas Studies","cards":[{"w":"limit","p":"n. / v.","d":"the greatest amount, number, or speed allowed; to restrict","c":"界限；限制","s":"Drivers must strictly obey the posted speed limit when passing school zones, or they will be fined heavily by the traffic police.","t":"駕駛人行經學校區域時必須嚴格遵守公告的速限，否則將會受到交通警察的重罰。"},{"w":"thought","p":"n.","d":"an idea, opinion, or mental consideration","c":"想法；思維；沉思","s":"After giving careful thought to the job offer in Singapore, David decided to accept it to broaden his international horizons.","t":"在對新加坡的工作錄取進行慎重考慮之後，戴維決定接受它以拓展自己的國際視野。"},{"w":"treasure","p":"n. / v.","d":"valuable things such as gold or gems; to cherish something deeply","c":"寶藏；珍寶；珍視","s":"The pirate captain buried his iron chest full of gold treasure on a remote desert island where no explorer could ever find it.","t":"海盜船長將裝滿黃金寶藏的鐵箱埋在一個沒有探險家能找到的偏僻荒島上。"},{"w":"prize","p":"n.","d":"an award given to a winner of a competition or race","c":"獎品；獎項","s":"The talented Taiwanese violin student practiced for six hours every day and won first prize in the international youth music contest.","t":"這位才華橫溢的台灣小提琴學生每天練習六小時，並在國際青年音樂大賽中獲得了一等獎。"},{"w":"value","p":"n. / v.","d":"the worth of something in money or importance; to appreciate","c":"價值；重視；估價","s":"Real estate experts predict that the market value of commercial apartments near the new metro station will increase rapidly this year.","t":"房地產專家預測，新地鐵站附近的商務公寓的市場價值今年將會快速增長。"},{"w":"worth","p":"prep. / adj.","d":"having a particular value in money or usefulness","c":"值……錢；值得的","s":"This rare historical stamp collection is worth hundreds of thousands of dollars, but the elderly collector refuses to sell it.","t":"這套稀有的歷史郵票收藏價值數十萬美元，但這位年邁的收藏家拒絕將其出售。"},{"w":"precious","p":"adj.","d":"of great value because of being rare, expensive, or important","c":"珍貴的；寶貴的","s":"Clean drinking water is the most precious natural resource on earth, so everyone should avoid wasting water in daily life.","t":"乾淨的飲用水是地球上最寶貴的自然資源，因此每個人在日常生活中都應避免浪費水資源。"},{"w":"positive","p":"adj.","d":"full of hope and confidence; certain; good","c":"正面的；積極的；確信的","s":"Maintaining an optimistic and positive attitude helps patients recover faster from serious illnesses, according to medical researchers.","t":"醫學研究人員指出，保持樂觀且積極的態度有助於病患更快地從嚴重疾病中康復。"},{"w":"negative","p":"adj.","d":"bad or harmful; expressing disagreement; pessimistic","c":"負面的；消極的；否定的","s":"Prolonged lack of proper sleep can have a very negative impact on teenagers' physical health and their academic performance at school.","t":"長期缺乏適當的睡眠會對青少年的身體健康和學校學業表現產生非常負面的影響。"},{"w":"abroad","p":"adv.","d":"in or to a foreign country","c":"在國外；到國外","s":"Many ambitious university graduates hope to study abroad in Europe or America to acquire advanced degrees and improve their language skills.","t":"許多有抱負的大學畢業生希望去歐美留學，以取得進階學位並提升其外語能力。"}]},{"unit":85,"theme":"Individual Identity, Personal Grooming & Supermarket Sections","cards":[{"w":"alone","p":"adj. / adv.","d":"without other people; by yourself","c":"單獨的；獨自地","s":"Although traveling alone in a foreign country can be exciting, you should always stay alert and keep your phone charged.","t":"雖然在國外獨自旅行可能令人興奮，但你應隨時保持警惕並確保手機電量充足。"},{"w":"personal","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to or relating to a particular person","c":"個人的；私人的","s":"You should never share your personal bank passwords or national identification numbers with strangers on the telephone.","t":"你絕不應該在電話中與陌生人分享你的個人銀行密碼或身分證字號。"},{"w":"individual","p":"n. / adj.","d":"a single person considered separately from a group; separate","c":"個人；個別的","s":"The dedicated teacher respected the individual learning needs of each student and gave extra after-school tutoring patiently.","t":"這位敬業的老師尊重每位學生的個別學習需求，並耐心地提供額外的課後輔導。"},{"w":"owner","p":"n.","d":"someone who possesses or legally owns something","c":"主人；業主；擁有人","s":"The friendly pet dog waited patiently beside the front gate every afternoon until its owner returned home from office work.","t":"這隻友善的寵物狗每天下午都在大門旁耐心等待，直到牠的主人下班回家。"},{"w":"haircut","p":"n.","d":"the act of cutting the hair, or the style in which it is cut","c":"理髮；髮型","s":"Before attending his sister's formal wedding banquet, Jason went to the local barber shop to get a neat haircut.","t":"在參加姊姊隆重的婚宴之前，傑森去當地的理髮店剪了一個俐落的髮型。"},{"w":"toothbrush","p":"n.","d":"a small brush used for cleaning teeth","c":"牙刷","s":"Dentists recommend replacing your manual toothbrush every three months, or the worn-out bristles will not clean your teeth properly.","t":"牙醫建議每三個月更換一次手動牙刷，否則磨損的刷毛將無法適當清潔牙齒。"},{"w":"napkin","p":"n.","d":"a piece of cloth or paper used at meals to wipe fingers or lips","c":"餐巾；餐巾紙","s":"After finishing the juicy grilled steak, the dinner guest took a paper napkin to wipe sauce stains gently from his lips.","t":"吃完多汁的烤牛排後，這位晚餐賓客拿了一張餐巾紙輕輕擦拭嘴唇上的醬汁污漬。"},{"w":"part","p":"n. / v.","d":"some but not all of a thing; to separate","c":"部分；零件；分開","s":"Reading English storybooks for thirty minutes before sleeping has become an essential part of Kevin's daily evening routine.","t":"睡前閱讀三十分鐘英文故事書已經成為凱文每天晚間作息中不可或缺的一部分。"},{"w":"section","p":"n.","d":"one of the parts into which something is divided","c":"區塊；部門；專區","s":"Mother walked directly to the fresh seafood section of the supermarket to buy Atlantic salmon for our family dinner.","t":"母親直接走到超市的新鮮海鮮專區，為我們的家庭晚餐採買大西洋鮭魚。"},{"w":"event","p":"n.","d":"an important happening or planned public occasion","c":"事件；大事；活動","s":"Winning the national science championship was a life-changing event that opened up many scholarship opportunities for Linda.","t":"贏得全國科學大賽冠軍是一件改變人生的大事，為琳達開啟了許多獎學金機會。"}]},{"unit":86,"theme":"Daily Records, Cable Communications, Science & Humanitarian Aid","cards":[{"w":"accident","p":"n.","d":"an unexpected event that causes damage or injury","c":"意外；交通事故","s":"Because the mountain road was very slippery from the rain, a minor traffic accident occurred between two delivery trucks yesterday.","t":"由於山路因雨變得十分濕滑，昨天兩輛貨車之間發生了一起輕微的交通事故。"},{"w":"album","p":"n.","d":"a book for keeping photographs or stamps; a collection of audio tracks","c":"相簿；音樂專輯","s":"Grandmother opened the dusty photo album on her lap and showed the young children black-and-white pictures of their ancestors.","t":"祖母在大腿上打開積滿灰塵的相簿，給小孩子們看他們祖先的黑白照片。"},{"w":"diary","p":"n.","d":"a book in which you record your daily thoughts and experiences","c":"日記","s":"Ever since she entered junior high school, Emily has kept a private diary to record her personal feelings and daily school life.","t":"自從進入初中以來，艾蜜莉一直寫私人日記來記錄她的個人感受和日常學校生活。"},{"w":"cable","p":"n.","d":"a strong, thick rope of wire; television signals sent through wires","c":"電纜；有線電視","s":"The technical worker carefully replaced the damaged underground telephone cable to restore internet connections across the town.","t":"技術工人小心地更換了受損的地下電話電纜，以恢復全鎮的網際網路連線。"},{"w":"primary","p":"adj.","d":"more important than anything else; basic or earliest","c":"主要的；首要的；初等的","s":"The primary goal of the national environmental project is to reduce greenhouse gas emissions and protect natural water resources.","t":"國家環境專案的首要目標是減少溫室氣體排放並保護自然水資源。"},{"w":"chemical","p":"adj. / n.","d":"relating to chemistry; a substance produced by or used in chemistry","c":"化學的；化學品","s":"Factory workers must wear thick protective rubber gloves when handling hazardous chemical liquids in the research laboratory.","t":"工廠工人在研究實驗室處理危險化學液體時，必須戴上厚實的橡膠防護手套。"},{"w":"error","p":"n.","d":"a mistake, especially one that causes problems","c":"錯誤；失誤","s":"Because of a typographical error in the bank transaction system, the accountant spent three hours rechecking all the balances.","t":"由於銀行交易系統中的排印錯誤，會計師花了三個小時重新檢查所有餘額。"},{"w":"fault","p":"n.","d":"responsibility for a mistake or bad situation; a weakness","c":"過錯；缺點；故障","s":"It was entirely my fault that the front glass door was left unlocked overnight, and I sincerely apologize to my coworkers.","t":"前玻璃門整夜未鎖完全是我的過錯，我由衷向我的同事們道歉。"},{"w":"false","p":"adj.","d":"not true or correct; artificial","c":"錯誤的；假的；虛偽的","s":"Spreading false rumors about other students on social media platforms is considered cyberbullying and will be punished by school rules.","t":"在社群媒體平台上散佈關於其他學生的虛假謠言被視為網路霸凌，將受到校規懲處。"},{"w":"aid","p":"n. / v.","d":"help, support, or financial assistance; to help someone","c":"援助；救援；幫助","s":"International humanitarian organizations sent medical teams and emergency food aid to the victims of the severe earthquake.","t":"國際人道組織向強烈地震的災民派遣了醫療隊和緊急糧食援助。"}]},{"unit":87,"theme":"Scientific Methods, Research Projects, Samples & Physical States","cards":[{"w":"favor","p":"n. / v.","d":"an act of kindness beyond what is due; to prefer or support","c":"恩惠；幫忙；偏袒","s":"Could you please do me a small personal favor and look after my pet cat while I travel to Tainan this weekend?","t":"你能幫我一個小小的個人忙，在我這週末前往台南旅遊時照顧我的寵物貓嗎？"},{"w":"method","p":"n.","d":"a particular way of doing something, especially a systematic one","c":"方法；方式","s":"The science teacher taught the high school students a systematic method for testing the cleanliness of drinking water.","t":"自然老師教授了高中生一套用來檢驗飲用水清潔度的系統性方法。"},{"w":"project","p":"n. / v.","d":"a planned piece of work that has a specific purpose","c":"專案；計畫；研討題目","s":"Our environmental biology team worked hard for three months to complete the research project on river pollution.","t":"我們的環境生物團隊辛勤工作了三個月，完成了關於河流污染的研究專案。"},{"w":"sample","p":"n. / v.","d":"a small amount of a substance showing what the whole is like","c":"樣本；樣品；品嚐","s":"The department store cosmetic counter gave free skin lotion sample to customers who filled out a short survey.","t":"百貨公司化妝品專櫃向填寫簡短問卷的顧客發放了免費的護膚乳液樣品。"},{"w":"screen","p":"n. / v.","d":"the flat surface on a computer or television; to filter or test","c":"螢幕；紗窗；篩選","s":"Looking continuously at a bright smartphone screen in the dark before sleeping can cause severe eyestrain.","t":"睡前在黑暗中持續盯著明亮的手機螢幕會造成嚴重的眼睛疲勞。"},{"w":"steam","p":"n. / v.","d":"the hot gas that water turns into when boiled; to cook with steam","c":"水蒸氣；蒸煮","s":"Hot white steam rose from the boiling kettle in the kitchen, signaling that the morning tea was ready.","t":"熱騰騰的白色水蒸氣從廚房沸騰的水壺中升起，示意晨茶已經準備好了。"},{"w":"tank","p":"n.","d":"a large container for holding liquid or gas; an armored fighting vehicle","c":"儲水槽；油箱；坦克","s":"The apartment building maintenance team cleaned the large rooftop water tank thoroughly yesterday morning.","t":"公寓大樓維護團隊昨天早上徹底清洗了屋頂上的大型儲水槽。"},{"w":"pile","p":"n. / v.","d":"a mass of things heaped together on top of one another","c":"一堆；堆疊","s":"A tall pile of dirty clothing lay beside the washing machine waiting to be washed on Sunday afternoon.","t":"一大堆髒衣服堆在洗衣機旁，等待著在星期天下午清洗。"},{"w":"bundle","p":"n. / v.","d":"a number of things tied or wrapped together","c":"一捆；一束；包裹","s":"The volunteer workers tied a thick bundle of old newspapers with plastic ropes before sending them to the recycling center.","t":"志工們在將大捆舊報紙送往回收中心之前，先用塑膠繩將它們捆綁整齊。"},{"w":"liquid","p":"n. / adj.","d":"a substance that flows freely, such as water or oil","c":"液體；液態的","s":"You should drink plenty of warm liquids such as honey water and chicken broth when you have a fever.","t":"當你發燒時，你應該多喝溫熱的液體，例如蜂蜜水和雞湯。"}]},{"unit":88,"theme":"Depth, Totality, Safety Precautions, Differences & Book Fairs","cards":[{"w":"deep","p":"adj. / adv.","d":"going far down from the top or surface; profound","c":"深的；深沉地","s":"The mountain river looks very calm on the surface, but it is actually ten meters deep and dangerous for young swimmers.","t":"這條山間河流表面看起來十分平靜，但實際上深達十公尺，對年幼的游泳者來說相當危險。"},{"w":"altogether","p":"adv.","d":"completely; considering everything; in total","c":"完全；總共；總而言之","s":"After adding up the cost of flight tickets, hotel rooms, and dining, our family vacation cost thirty thousand dollars altogether.","t":"在合計機票、飯店房間和餐飲費用後，我們的家庭度假總共花費了三萬元。"},{"w":"extra","p":"adj. / n.","d":"more than is usual, expected, or needed","c":"額外的；額外的事物","s":"Because the temperature dropped suddenly last night, the hotel receptionist provided an extra woolen blanket for our bed.","t":"因為昨晚氣溫驟降，飯店接待人員為我們的床鋪提供了一條額外的羊毛毯。"},{"w":"final","p":"adj. / n.","d":"coming at the end of a series; the last exam or game","c":"最後的；決賽；期末考","s":"Senior high school students are studying diligently in the school library to prepare for their final graduation exams next week.","t":"高中高年級學生正在學校圖書館裡勤奮讀書，為下週的畢業期末考試做準備。"},{"w":"lack","p":"n. / v.","d":"the state of being without something; to not have enough","c":"缺乏；缺少","s":"The young job applicant had great enthusiasm for graphic design, but his lack of practical experience made hiring difficult.","t":"這位年輕的求職者對平面設計充滿熱情，但他缺乏實務經驗使得錄取變得困難。"},{"w":"safety","p":"n.","d":"the state of being protected from danger or harm","c":"安全；平安","s":"Construction workers are strictly required to wear yellow hard hats to ensure their personal safety at the building site.","t":"建築工人被嚴格要求戴上黃色安全帽，以確保他們在建築工地的個人安全。"},{"w":"similar","p":"adj.","d":"looking or being almost, but not exactly, the same","c":"相似的；類似的","s":"Although the two twin sisters wore similar pink dresses to the party, their hairstyles and personalities were quite different.","t":"雖然這對雙胞胎姊妹穿著相似的粉色洋裝去參加派對，但她們的髮型和性格卻大不相同。"},{"w":"difference","p":"n.","d":"the way in which two or more things are not like each other","c":"差異；不同處","s":"Can you explain the main grammatical difference between the present perfect tense and the simple past tense in English?","t":"你能解釋一下英語中現在完成式與簡單過去式之間的主要文法差異嗎？"},{"w":"branch","p":"n. / v.","d":"a part of a tree that grows out from the trunk; a local office","c":"樹枝；分行；分部","s":"The international commercial bank decided to open a new customer service branch in the busy financial district of Taichung.","t":"這家國際商業銀行決定在台中繁華的金融區開設一家新的客戶服務分行。"},{"w":"fair","p":"adj. / n.","d":"treating people equally; a public event for trade or fun","c":"公平的；展覽會；市集","s":"Thousands of enthusiastic book lovers visited the Taipei International Book fair to purchase newly published novels at a discount.","t":"數千名熱情的愛書人參觀了台北國際書展，以折扣價格購買新出版的小說。"}]},{"unit":89,"theme":"Media Channels, Social Influence, Purpose & Personal Absences","cards":[{"w":"channel","p":"n.","d":"a television or radio station; a system for communication","c":"頻道；管道；途徑","s":"My grandfather picked up the remote control and switched to the news channel to watch the weather forecast for tomorrow.","t":"我祖父拿起遙控器切換到新聞頻道，觀看明天的天氣預報。"},{"w":"difficulty","p":"n.","d":"the state of being hard to do or understand; an obstacle","c":"困難；難題","s":"Because the foreign language textbook was full of advanced words, the beginner had great difficulty understanding the chapter.","t":"因為這本外語教科書充滿了進階單字，初學者在理解該章節時遇到了很大的困難。"},{"w":"influence","p":"n. / v.","d":"the power to have an effect on people or things","c":"影響；感化","s":"Dedicated teachers have a profound influence on their students' future career choices and ethical character development.","t":"敬業的教師對學生未來的職業選擇和品德塑造有著深遠的影響。"},{"w":"link","p":"n. / v.","d":"a connection between two things; to connect together","c":"連結；關聯；繫結","s":"The high-speed rail line provides an essential transportation link connecting the major metropolitan cities of Taiwan.","t":"高鐵提供了一條不可或缺的交通連結，聯繫著台灣各大都會城市。"},{"w":"pardon","p":"n. / v.","d":"forgiveness for an offense; an expression used to ask someone to repeat","c":"原諒；寬恕；請再說一遍","s":"I beg your pardon, but could you please speak a little louder because the traffic noise outside is very loud?","t":"請原諒我（請再說一遍），但你能否稍微說大聲一點，因為外面的車流噪音非常吵雜？"},{"w":"purpose","p":"n.","d":"the reason for which something is done or created","c":"目的；意圖","s":"The primary purpose of this community health seminar is to teach residents how to prepare balanced and nutritious meals.","t":"本社區健康研討會的主要目的是教導居民如何準備均衡且營養的餐點。"},{"w":"reason","p":"n. / v.","d":"a cause or explanation for an action or event; to think logically","c":"理由；原因；推理","s":"The school principal explained the main reason why cell phone usage was prohibited inside classrooms during lecture hours.","t":"校長解釋了在講課時間內教室禁止使用手機的主要原因。"},{"w":"shower","p":"n. / v.","d":"a device that sprays water for washing; a brief fall of rain","c":"淋浴；陣雨；下陣雨","s":"Taking a warm relaxing shower after a tiring day of physical labor helps soothe tense muscles and promotes deep sleep.","t":"在經歷了一整天辛勞的體力勞動後，洗個舒適的溫水澡有助於舒緩緊繃的肌肉並促進深度睡眠。"},{"w":"absent","p":"adj.","d":"not present in a place, especially school or work","c":"缺席的；不在場的","s":"Three students were absent from English class yesterday morning because they had caught a contagious seasonal flu virus.","t":"昨天早上有三名學生在英語課上缺席，因為他們感染了傳染性極強的季節性流感病毒。"},{"w":"blank","p":"adj. / n.","d":"empty; without any writing, print, or marks","c":"空白的；空格","s":"Please fill in each numbered blank on the test sheet with the most suitable English vocabulary word from the box.","t":"請在測驗卷上的每個編號空格中填入方框中最合適的英語單字。"}]},{"unit":90,"theme":"Classical Music, Risk Perception, Leadership & Academic Majors","cards":[{"w":"classical","p":"adj.","d":"traditional in style or form; relating to serious orchestral music","c":"古典的；傳統的","s":"Listening to soothing classical piano music by Mozart helps many students concentrate while preparing for exams.","t":"聆聽莫札特舒緩的古典鋼琴音樂有助於許多學生在準備考試時集中注意力。"},{"w":"danger","p":"n.","d":"the possibility of suffering harm, injury, or death","c":"危險；威脅","s":"Tourists were warned not to hike near the active volcano because of the severe danger of poisonous sulfur gas leaks.","t":"遊客被警告不要在活火山附近健行，因為存在有毒硫磺氣體洩漏的嚴重危險。"},{"w":"former","p":"adj. / n.","d":"having previously been a particular thing; the first mentioned","c":"從前的；前者的；前任的","s":"The former prime minister delivered an inspiring speech on world peace at the international diplomatic summit yesterday.","t":"前首相昨天在國際外交峰會上就世界和平發表了激勵人心的演講。"},{"w":"impossible","p":"adj.","d":"not able to occur, exist, or be done","c":"不可能的；辦不到的","s":"Without modern satellite GPS navigation, finding a safe path across the vast snowy wilderness would be completely impossible.","t":"如果沒有現代衛星 GPS 導航，要在廣袤的白雪荒原中找到安全的道路將是完全不可能的。"},{"w":"instant","p":"adj. / n.","d":"happening immediately; prepared quickly; a moment","c":"立即的；速食的；瞬間","s":"College dorm students often boil water to make instant noodles when they study late at night and feel hungry.","t":"大學宿舍學生深夜讀書感到飢餓時，經常燒開水煮泡麵吃。"},{"w":"mass","p":"n. / adj.","d":"a large amount of something; bulk; relating to large numbers","c":"大量；群眾；大眾的","s":"The metropolitan city launched a new mass rapid transit network to ease chronic traffic congestion on the roads.","t":"這座大都會城市啟動了新的大眾捷運系統網路，以緩解道路上長期的交通壅塞。"},{"w":"chief","p":"adj. / n.","d":"most important; the leader or head of an organization","c":"首要的；首領；長官","s":"Air pollution from industrial coal-burning plants is the chief cause of chronic respiratory diseases in the region.","t":"工業燃煤電廠排放的空氣污染是該地區慢性呼吸道疾病的首要病因。"},{"w":"main","p":"adj.","d":"most important, largest, or most significant","c":"主要的；最重要的","s":"The main entrance of the national library was decorated with vibrant floral banners for the cultural festival.","t":"國家圖書館的正門入口處裝飾著充滿活力的花卉旗幟，迎接文化節的到來。"},{"w":"major","p":"adj. / n. / v.","d":"very large, serious, or important; academic focus; to specialize","c":"主要的；主修；主修學科","s":"David decided to major in computer software engineering at National Taiwan University because of his love for coding.","t":"因為熱愛寫程式，戴維決定在國立台灣大學主修電腦軟體工程。"},{"w":"minor","p":"adj. / n.","d":"less important or serious; a person under legal age","c":"次要的；輕微的；未成年人","s":"The driver suffered only a few minor scratches on his elbow and was discharged from the hospital after thirty minutes.","t":"司機手肘僅受了幾處輕微擦傷，三十分鐘後便出院了。"}]},{"unit":91,"theme":"Everyday Attributes, Privacy, Frequency, Organization & Flavors","cards":[{"w":"necessary","p":"adj.","d":"needed in order to achieve a particular result","c":"必須的；必要的","s":"Having a valid passport is absolutely necessary before traveling abroad, and you must check its expiration date.","t":"出國旅行前持有有效護照是絕對必要的，且你必須檢查其有效期限。"},{"w":"ordinary","p":"adj.","d":"normal or not special or different in any way","c":"普通的；平常的","s":"He looked like an ordinary office worker on the street, but he was actually a famous detective.","t":"他在街上看起來像個普通的上班族，但他實際上是一位著名的偵探。"},{"w":"private","p":"adj.","d":"only for one person or group and not for public use","c":"私人的；私密的","s":"The manager entered his private office to review confidential documents, and he asked not to be disturbed.","t":"經理進入他的私人辦公室審閱機密文件，並要求不要被打擾。"},{"w":"rare","p":"adj.","d":"not common or not seen or happening very often","c":"罕見的；稀有的","s":"Snowfall is very rare in this coastal city during winter, so all the children were thrilled to see it.","t":"這座沿海城市冬天下雪非常罕見，所以所有的孩子看到雪都興奮不已。"},{"w":"sudden","p":"adj.","d":"happening or done quickly and without warning","c":"突然的；意外的","s":"A sudden thunderstorm hit the outdoor market in the afternoon, and shoppers rushed to find shelter.","t":"午後一場突然的雷陣雨襲擊了戶外市集，購物者紛紛衝去尋找遮蔽處。"},{"w":"tidy","p":"adj. / v.","d":"having everything in its right place; to make clean","c":"整潔的；整理","s":"The teacher asked students to keep their desks clean and tidy, so the classroom looked very neat.","t":"老師要求學生保持課桌乾淨且整潔，因此教室看起來非常整齊。"},{"w":"usual","p":"adj.","d":"normal or happening most of the time","c":"通常的；慣常的","s":"Mr. Lin ordered his usual cup of black coffee without sugar, and he sat by the quiet window.","t":"林先生點了他慣常喝的不加糖黑咖啡，並坐在安靜的窗邊。"},{"w":"whole","p":"adj. / n.","d":"complete, including all parts of something","c":"全部的；整個的","s":"The young boy was so hungry that he ate the whole pizza alone, and he felt extremely full.","t":"那個小男孩太餓了，以致於獨自吃掉了整個披薩，他感到非常飽足。"},{"w":"sour","p":"adj.","d":"having a sharp, acid taste like lemon or vinegar","c":"酸的；酸腐的","s":"The fresh lemonade tasted a bit too sour for the little child, so her mother added some sweet honey.","t":"新鮮檸檬水對小小孩來說嚐起來有點太酸了，所以她的母親加了一些香甜的蜂蜜。"},{"w":"bitter","p":"adj.","d":"having a strong, sharp, harsh taste like black coffee or medicine","c":"苦的；痛苦的","s":"Traditional herbal medicine usually tastes very bitter, but it is considered very effective for curing colds.","t":"傳統草藥嚐起來通常非常苦，但它被認為對治療感冒非常有效。"}]},{"unit":92,"theme":"Spatial Positions, Locations, Frequency, Adverbs of Degree & Conjunctions","cards":[{"w":"ahead","p":"adv.","d":"further forward in space or time","c":"在前方；提前","s":"The bus driver noticed road construction two miles ahead, so he slowed down to merge safely.","t":"公車司機注意到兩英里前方有道路施工，所以他減速以便安全匯入車道。"},{"w":"alike","p":"adj. / adv.","d":"similar to each other; in the same way","c":"相似的；同樣地","s":"The identical twin sisters dress and speak so much alike, that even their close classmates confuse them.","t":"這對同卵雙胞胎姊妹穿著和說話如此相似，以致於連她們親近的同學都會搞混。"},{"w":"anywhere","p":"adv.","d":"in, at, or to any place, especially in negative sentences or questions","c":"在任何地方","s":"I searched my backpack thoroughly, but I could not find my student ID card anywhere in the classroom.","t":"我徹底搜遍了背包，但在教室裡的任何地方我都找不到學生證。"},{"w":"everywhere","p":"adv.","d":"to, in, or at every place","c":"到處；各處","s":"Spring has arrived in the countryside, and colorful wildflowers are blooming everywhere along the mountain paths.","t":"鄉村迎來了春天，繽紛的野花在山徑各處隨處綻放。"},{"w":"somewhere","p":"adv.","d":"in, at, or to an unspecified or unknown place","c":"在某處；到某處","s":"David left his car keys somewhere in the living room, but he could not remember the exact spot.","t":"大衛把車鑰匙遺落在客廳的某個地方，但他記不得確切位置了。"},{"w":"especially","p":"adv.","d":"used to emphasize that something is more true about one thing","c":"尤其；特別是","s":"Taiwan experiences heavy rainfall during summer months, especially when typhoons approach from the eastern ocean.","t":"台灣在夏季月份降雨豐沛，特別是當颱風從東部海面逼近時。"},{"w":"hardly","p":"adv.","d":"almost not at all; scarcely","c":"幾乎不；簡直不","s":"The music was so deafening at the concert that we could hardly hear each other speak across the table.","t":"音樂會在音樂聲震耳欲聾，以致於我們隔著桌子幾乎聽不見對方說話。"},{"w":"nearly","p":"adv.","d":"almost, not quite completely","c":"幾乎；接近","s":"Our high school basketball team played exceptionally well, and we nearly won the championship match yesterday.","t":"我們高中籃球隊打得非常出色，我們昨天差一點就贏得冠軍賽了。"},{"w":"while","p":"conj. / n.","d":"during the time that; a period of time","c":"當…的時候；一段時間","s":"My father likes to listen to classical radio while he prepares breakfast for the whole family.","t":"我父親喜歡在為全家人準備早餐時聆聽古典音樂電台廣播。"},{"w":"rather","p":"adv.","d":"quite, to some degree; more readily or willingly","c":"相當；頗為","s":"The math exam was rather difficult for most students, but Kevin completed all questions with high confidence.","t":"這場數學考試對多數學生而言頗為困難，但凱文充滿信心地答完了所有題目。"}]},{"unit":93,"theme":"Logical Connectors, Negations, Spatial Prepositions & Time Extent","cards":[{"w":"probably","p":"adv.","d":"used to mean that something is very likely to happen or be true","c":"可能；大概","s":"Because dark storm clouds are gathering in the afternoon sky, it will probably rain within an hour.","t":"因為午後天空烏雲密布，一小時之內大概會下雨。"},{"w":"such","p":"adj. / pron.","d":"of the type previously mentioned; to an extreme degree","c":"如此的；這樣的","s":"The charity concert was such a tremendous success that all the tickets were sold out in minutes.","t":"這場慈善音樂會是如此巨大的成功，以致於所有門票在幾分鐘之內便售罄。"},{"w":"neither","p":"adv. / conj. / pron.","d":"not either of two things or people","c":"兩者皆不","s":"My brother does not eat raw seafood, and neither do I, so we ordered cooked pasta instead.","t":"我哥哥不吃生海鮮，我也不吃，所以我們改點了煮熟的義大利麵。"},{"w":"nor","p":"conj.","d":"used before the second of two negative possibilities","c":"也不；亦不","s":"The elderly man could not read the tiny letters, nor could he find his reading glasses in the dark.","t":"那位年長男士看不懂微小的字母，在黑暗中他也找不到老花眼鏡。"},{"w":"none","p":"pron.","d":"not one of a group of people or things","c":"毫無；全無；沒有一個","s":"The math teacher asked five challenging questions, but none of the students could solve the last one.","t":"數學老師問了五道挑戰性題目，但沒有一個學生能解出最後一題。"},{"w":"across","p":"prep. / adv.","d":"from one side to the other of something","c":"穿過；橫越","s":"The government built a modern suspension bridge across the broad river to reduce morning traffic congestion.","t":"政府在這條寬闊河流上方建造了一座現代吊橋，以紓解早晨的交通壅塞。"},{"w":"against","p":"prep.","d":"opposing or disagreeing with; touching or hitting","c":"反對；倚靠；碰撞","s":"Environmental groups voted strongly against the new factory proposal to protect the natural forest wetlands.","t":"環保團體強烈投票反對新工廠提案，以保護天然森林濕地。"},{"w":"among","p":"prep.","d":"in the middle of or surrounded by other things or people","c":"在…之中；在…之間","s":"The traditional tea house was hidden peacefully among towering bamboo trees at the mountain base.","t":"那間傳統茶館寧靜地隱匿在山腳下高聳的竹林之中。"},{"w":"through","p":"prep. / adv.","d":"from one end or side of something to the other","c":"穿過；通過；歷經","s":"The high-speed bullet train travels swiftly through several mountain tunnels to reach the southern city.","t":"高速子彈列車飛快穿過幾座山間隧道以抵達南部城市。"},{"w":"till","p":"prep. / conj.","d":"up to the time of; until","c":"直到…為止","s":"The devoted university students stayed in the library till midnight to prepare for their final exams.","t":"那些用功的大學生在圖書館待到午夜，為期末考做準備。"}]},{"unit":94,"theme":"Spatial Movement, Gestures, Nutrition, Meals & Pharmaceuticals","cards":[{"w":"forward","p":"adv. / adj.","d":"toward the direction that is in front of you; into the future","c":"向前；前進地","s":"The brave police officer took three steps forward to speak with the frightened store owner.","t":"英勇的警官向前邁出三步，與受驚嚇的店主交談。"},{"w":"toward","p":"prep.","d":"in the direction of somebody or something","c":"朝向；面對","s":"The lost kitten was terrified by traffic, so it ran toward the warm embrace of the little girl.","t":"迷路的小貓被車流嚇壞了，所以它朝著小女孩溫暖的懷抱跑去。"},{"w":"upon","p":"prep.","d":"more formal word for on; happening immediately after","c":"在…之上；在…之後","s":"The successful future of our modern democracy depends upon the active participation of educated citizens.","t":"我們現代民主制度的成功未來取決於受良好教育公民的積極參與。"},{"w":"degree","p":"n.","d":"a unit of measurement for temperature or angles; a university qualification","c":"度數；程度；大學學位","s":"After completing four years of medical study, Rachel proudly earned her bachelor's degree from the university.","t":"完成四年的醫學研讀後，瑞秋自豪地從這所大學獲得了學士學位。"},{"w":"gesture","p":"n. / v.","d":"a movement of hands or body to express meaning; an action expressing feeling","c":"手勢；姿態；做手勢","s":"A warm smile and a polite handshake are widely recognized as a friendly gesture of welcome.","t":"溫暖的微笑與禮貌的握手被廣泛視為表示歡迎的友善姿態（手勢）。"},{"w":"diet","p":"n.","d":"the food and drink that a person or animal usually consumes","c":"日常飲食；節食","s":"Eating a balanced diet rich in fresh vegetables and whole grains helps lower the risk of heart disease.","t":"攝取富含新鮮蔬菜與全穀物的均衡日常飲食有助於降低心臟病風險。"},{"w":"bar","p":"n.","d":"a solid piece of something; a counter where drinks are served","c":"條；塊；酒吧","s":"Before washing her hands in the bathroom, mother unwrapped a new bar of fragrant soap.","t":"在浴室洗手之前，母親拆開了一塊新的芳香肥皂。"},{"w":"barbecue","p":"n. / v.","d":"a meal cooked outdoors on a metal frame over a fire","c":"戶外烤肉；燒烤","s":"Our community organized an outdoor summer barbecue in the park, and neighbors grilled chicken together.","t":"我們社區在公園舉辦了戶外夏季烤肉，鄰居們一起烤雞肉。"},{"w":"supper","p":"n.","d":"an informal meal eaten in the evening","c":"晚餐；晚飯","s":"Grandmother prepared a warm pot of beef noodle soup for our family supper on the cold winter evening.","t":"在寒冷的冬夜裡，祖母為我們全家的晚餐準備了一鍋熱騰騰的牛肉麵湯。"},{"w":"drug","p":"n.","d":"a medicine or substance used to treat disease or illness","c":"藥物；藥品；毒品","s":"Medical scientists are testing a powerful new drug that may help cure patients with lung cancer.","t":"醫學科學家正在測試一種強效新藥物，它可能有助於治癒肺癌患者。"}]},{"unit":95,"theme":"International Commerce, Manufacturing Quality, Consumer Feedback & Statistical Trends","cards":[{"w":"export","p":"v. / n.","d":"to send goods to another country for sale; goods sold abroad","c":"出口；外銷","s":"Taiwanese technology factories export millions of advanced computer chips to international markets every year.","t":"台灣科技廠每年外銷數百萬顆先進電腦晶片至國際市場。"},{"w":"import","p":"v. / n.","d":"to bring goods into a country from abroad to sell; goods bought from abroad","c":"進口；輸入","s":"Because this island nation has limited natural petroleum reserves, it must import most of its crude oil.","t":"因為這座島國的天然石油儲量有限，它必須進口大部分的原油。"},{"w":"product","p":"n.","d":"something that is made or grown to be sold","c":"產品；製品","s":"The software company launched an innovative new product that helps high school students practice spoken English.","t":"這家軟體公司推出了一款創新的新產品，幫助高中生練習英語口說。"},{"w":"quality","p":"n.","d":"how good or bad something is; a characteristic","c":"品質；特質","s":"Consumers are willing to pay higher prices for handmade shoes because of their superior leather quality.","t":"消費者願意為手工鞋支付較高價格，因為其皮革品質卓越。"},{"w":"control","p":"n. / v.","d":"the power to direct or manage something; to regulate","c":"控制；管理；管制","s":"During heavy weekend traffic, automated electronic systems help control vehicle speeds on the highway.","t":"在週末繁忙的車流中，自動化電子系統協助控制高速公路上的車速。"},{"w":"complain","p":"v.","d":"to say that something is wrong or not satisfactory","c":"抱怨；發牢騷","s":"Dozens of train passengers went to the service counter to complain about the two-hour departure delay.","t":"數十名火車乘客前往服務台抱怨發車延誤兩小時。"},{"w":"explain","p":"v.","d":"to make something clear or easy to understand by giving details","c":"解釋；說明","s":"The science teacher used colorful physical models to explain how the solar system orbits around the sun.","t":"自然老師使用色彩繽紛的實體模型來解釋太陽系如何圍繞太陽公轉。"},{"w":"argue","p":"v.","d":"to speak angrily to someone because you disagree; to give reasons for or against","c":"爭論；爭辯","s":"The two business partners began to argue loudly over budget allocations during the morning board meeting.","t":"兩位商業夥伴在早晨董事會議期間開始為了預算分配大聲爭辯。"},{"w":"increase","p":"v. / n.","d":"to become larger in amount, number, or degree; a rise","c":"增加；增長","s":"Regular physical exercise and healthy nutrition will significantly increase your energy levels throughout the workday.","t":"規律的身體運動與健康的營養將在整個工作日內顯著增加你的活力水平。"},{"w":"decrease","p":"v. / n.","d":"to become less or to make something become less; a reduction","c":"減少；降低","s":"Installing energy-efficient LED light bulbs will dramatically decrease monthly electricity bills for schools.","t":"安裝節能 LED 燈泡將大幅降低學校的每月電費支出。"}]},{"unit":96,"theme":"Household Maintenance, Domestic Objects, Human Health & Personal Preferences","cards":[{"w":"furniture","p":"n.","d":"movable objects such as tables, chairs, and beds used in rooms","c":"家具","s":"When moving into their new apartment, the newlywed couple purchased solid wooden furniture for the living room.","t":"搬進新公寓時，這對新婚夫婦為客廳購買了實木家具。"},{"w":"gather","p":"v.","d":"to come together in a group; to collect things","c":"聚集；收集","s":"Thousands of eager baseball fans will gather at the stadium tonight to watch the championship game.","t":"今晚成千上萬熱切的棒球迷將聚集在體育場觀看冠軍賽。"},{"w":"collection","p":"n.","d":"a group of objects or art brought together in one place","c":"收藏品；收集物","s":"Uncle Robert has built an impressive collection of rare postage stamps from around the world over thirty years.","t":"三十年來，羅伯特叔叔建立了一套令人印象深刻的全球罕見郵票收藏品。"},{"w":"blood","p":"n.","d":"the red liquid that circulates through the arteries and veins","c":"血液","s":"The local hospital organized a blood donation drive, inviting healthy citizens to give blood to help patients.","t":"當地醫院組織了一次捐血活動，邀請健康市民捐出血液以救助病患。"},{"w":"injure","p":"v.","d":"to hurt a person or animal physically, especially in an accident","c":"傷害；受傷","s":"Skiers should always wear safety helmets on the slopes so they do not seriously injure their heads.","t":"滑雪者在雪坡上應始終佩戴安全帽，以免頭部受到嚴重傷害。"},{"w":"mop","p":"v. / n.","d":"to clean floors with a wet tool; the tool itself","c":"拖地；拖把","s":"After cooking Sunday dinner for the large family, father used soapy water to mop the greasy kitchen floor.","t":"在為大家庭烹調完週日晚餐後，父親用肥皂水拖拭油膩的廚房地板。"},{"w":"sweep","p":"v.","d":"to clean dust or dirt from floors using a broom","c":"掃地；打掃","s":"The teacher asked students to take brooms and sweep the fallen leaves off the front courtyard stairs.","t":"老師請學生們拿掃帚清掃前庭台階上的落葉。"},{"w":"opportunity","p":"n.","d":"a chance to do something desirable or advantageous","c":"機會；良機","s":"Studying abroad in England provided Maria with an invaluable opportunity to improve her English fluency.","t":"在英國留學為瑪麗亞提供了一個寶貴的機會以提升她的英語流利度。"},{"w":"powder","p":"n.","d":"a dry substance in the form of very fine grains","c":"粉末；粉狀物","s":"The mother mixed three spoons of milk powder with warm water to prepare a bottle for her infant baby.","t":"母親將三匙奶粉與溫水混合，為她的嬰兒準備了一瓶奶。"},{"w":"prefer","p":"v.","d":"to like one thing or person better than another","c":"更喜歡；偏好","s":"During hot summer afternoons, many office workers prefer iced green tea to hot coffee.","t":"在炎熱的夏日午後，許多上班族比起熱咖啡更喜歡冰綠茶。"}]},{"unit":97,"theme":"Media Press, Velocity, Achievement, Communication & Concerns","cards":[{"w":"press","p":"n. / v.","d":"newspapers and journalists; to push firmly against something","c":"新聞媒體；按壓","s":"The government held an urgent press conference to address public concerns, and the minister took questions from the press.","t":"政府召開緊急新聞發布會以回應公眾關切，部長接受了新聞媒體記者的提問。"},{"w":"rapid","p":"adj.","d":"happening in a short period of time or at great speed","c":"快速的；迅速的","s":"The widespread use of smartphones has led to rapid development in electronic payment systems across Asia.","t":"智慧型手機的廣泛普及引發了全亞洲電子支付系統的迅速發展。"},{"w":"speed","p":"n. / v.","d":"the rate at which someone or something moves; to move fast","c":"速度；超速行駛","s":"Traffic cameras were installed on the highway to catch reckless drivers who speed over the legal limit.","t":"高速公路上安裝了測速照相機，以取締超過法定限制超速行駛的魯莽司機。"},{"w":"sharp","p":"adj.","d":"having a thin edge or point that can cut easily; clear and quick-witted","c":"鋒利的；尖銳的；敏銳的","s":"The chef used an exceptionally sharp knife to slice the raw tuna fillets into delicate pieces.","t":"主廚使用一把異常鋒利的刀子，將生鮪魚柳切成細緻薄片。"},{"w":"achieve","p":"v.","d":"to successfully finish or gain something after hard work","c":"達成；實現","s":"With continuous discipline and daily practice, the young athlete hoped to achieve his dream of an Olympic medal.","t":"憑藉持續的自律與每日訓練，這位年輕運動員希望能實現奪得奧運獎牌的夢想。"},{"w":"reach","p":"v.","d":"to arrive at a place; to stretch out an arm to touch something","c":"抵達；伸手觸及","s":"After climbing steep mountain paths for six exhausting hours, the hikers finally managed to reach the summit.","t":"在陡峭山徑上艱難攀登了筋疲力竭的六小時後，登山客們終於成功抵達了山頂。"},{"w":"regard","p":"v. / n.","d":"to consider or think of in a particular way; respect","c":"看待；尊重；問候","s":"Many literary critics regard this classic novel as one of the greatest masterpieces of the twentieth century.","t":"許多文學評論家將這本經典小說視為二十世紀最偉大的傑作之一。"},{"w":"concern","p":"n. / v.","d":"a feeling of worry; to cause worry to someone","c":"擔憂；關切；涉及","s":"Parents expressed deep concern regarding the safety of school pedestrian crossings near busy morning intersections.","t":"家長們對繁忙晨間十字路口附近的學校行人穿越道安全表達了深切的擔憂。"},{"w":"reply","p":"v. / n.","d":"to answer someone by words or writing; an answer","c":"回覆；答覆","s":"I sent an urgent email inquiry to the airline customer service desk, but I have received no reply yet.","t":"我給航空公司客服處寄去了一封緊急電子郵件諮詢，但我至今尚未收到回覆。"},{"w":"result","p":"n. / v.","d":"something that happens because of something else; an outcome","c":"結果；後果；成效","s":"The hard work of the research team produced an impressive result that was published in a prestigious journal.","t":"研究團隊的辛勤工作產生了令人矚目的成果（結果），該成果發表在一本聲譽卓著的期刊上。"}]},{"unit":98,"theme":"Vision, Landscapes, Human Intelligence, Abilities & Hygiene","cards":[{"w":"return","p":"v. / n.","d":"to come or go back to a place; to give something back; an act of returning","c":"返回；歸還","s":"Students must return all borrowed library books before the end of the semester to avoid late fines.","t":"學生必須在學期結束前歸還所有借閱的圖書館書籍，以避免繳交逾期罰款。"},{"w":"sight","p":"n.","d":"the ability to see; something that is seen; vision","c":"視力；景物；景象","s":"Watching fireworks explode over Sun Moon Lake on New Year's Eve was truly a breathtaking sight to behold.","t":"在除夕夜觀看煙火在日月潭上空綻放，確實是一幅令人屏息的壯麗景象。"},{"w":"view","p":"n. / v.","d":"what you can see from a particular place; an opinion; to look at","c":"視野；景色；看法；觀看","s":"From the top floor of Taipei 101, visitors can enjoy a panoramic view of the entire mountain basin.","t":"從台北101的頂樓，遊客可以欣賞整座盆地山景的全景視野。"},{"w":"silent","p":"adj.","d":"without any sound; not speaking","c":"寂靜的；無聲的；沉默的","s":"The auditorium remained completely silent while the pianist performed a delicate classical piece on stage.","t":"當鋼琴家在舞台上演奏一首細緻的古典樂曲時，禮堂裡保持著完全的寂靜無聲。"},{"w":"ability","p":"n.","d":"the physical or mental power or skill needed to do something","c":"能力；本領","s":"Regular language practice will greatly enhance your ability to communicate fluently with native speakers.","t":"規律的語言練習將大幅提升你與母語人士流利溝通的能力。"},{"w":"skill","p":"n.","d":"an ability to do an activity or job well, especially that is learned","c":"技能；技巧","s":"Learning carpentry requires both creative patience and the practical skill to use specialized hand tools.","t":"學習木工既需要創造性的耐心，也需要使用專業手工具的實用技能。"},{"w":"tip","p":"n. / v.","d":"the pointed end of something; useful advice; extra money given for service","c":"尖端；秘訣；小費","s":"The experienced English teacher shared a helpful tip on how to memorize vocabulary through reading.","t":"那位富有經驗的英語老師分享了一個關於如何透過閱讀記憶單字的實用秘訣。"},{"w":"talent","p":"n.","d":"a natural ability to be good at something, especially in arts or sports","c":"天賦；才華","s":"From early childhood, Mozart displayed an extraordinary musical talent for composing orchestral melodies.","t":"從幼年時期起，莫札特就展現了創作管弦樂旋律的非凡音樂天賦。"},{"w":"genius","p":"n.","d":"an exceptionally talented or intelligent person","c":"天才；天賦才智","s":"Albert Einstein is universally celebrated as a scientific genius whose theories reshaped modern physics.","t":"愛因斯坦被世人公認為一位科學天才，他的理論重塑了現代物理學。"},{"w":"soap","p":"n.","d":"a substance used with water for washing and cleaning","c":"肥皂","s":"Always wash your hands thoroughly with warm water and antibacterial soap before preparing food.","t":"在準備食物之前，務必用溫水與抗菌肥皂徹底清洗雙手。"}]},{"unit":99,"theme":"Information Resources, Organization, Aid Supplies, Infrastructure & Willingness","cards":[{"w":"source","p":"n.","d":"the place or thing where something comes from; an information provider","c":"來源；出處","s":"The internet has become the primary source of international news for university students today.","t":"網際網路已成為當今大學生獲取國際新聞的主要來源。"},{"w":"stamp","p":"n. / v.","d":"a small piece of paper stuck on a letter; to put a foot down hard","c":"郵票；印章；蓋章；踩踏","s":"Don't forget to affix an airmail stamp to the envelope before dropping it into the postbox.","t":"在將信封投入郵筒之前，別忘了在信封上貼上一枚航空郵票。"},{"w":"step","p":"n. / v.","d":"the movement of lifting foot; a stage in a process","c":"步伐；步驟；踏步","s":"The government took a decisive step forward by investing heavily in renewable solar energy systems.","t":"政府藉由大力投資可再生太陽能系統，向前邁出了決定性的一步（步驟）。"},{"w":"stick","p":"n. / v.","d":"a thin piece of wood; to attach with glue; to push into","c":"枝條；棍棒；黏貼；卡住","s":"The campers collected dry wooden sticks in the pine forest to build a warm fire for the evening.","t":"露營者在松樹林裡收集乾燥木枝條，以便為夜晚生起溫暖的營火。"},{"w":"support","p":"v. / n.","d":"to help someone emotionally or practically; to hold up physically","c":"支持；支撐；擁護","s":"Parents should always provide loving support and encouragement when their children face difficult challenges.","t":"當孩子面臨艱難挑戰時，父母應始終給予充滿愛意的支持與鼓勵。"},{"w":"supply","p":"n. / v.","d":"an amount of something available for use; to provide","c":"供應；補給；物資；提供","s":"The international charity delivered an urgent supply of clean drinking water and canned food to the disaster zone.","t":"國際慈善機構向災區運送了緊急的純淨飲用水與罐頭食品物資（供應）。"},{"w":"system","p":"n.","d":"a set of connected things or rules working together","c":"系統；體系；體制","s":"Taipei boasts an efficient underground metro system that transports millions of daily commuters quickly and safely.","t":"台北擁有高效的地下捷運系統，能迅速且安全地運送數百萬名每日通勤族。"},{"w":"task","p":"n.","d":"a piece of work to be done, especially one that is difficult","c":"任務；差事；工作","s":"Completing the complicated science project before Friday was a challenging task for the high school group.","t":"在星期五之前完成這項複雜的自然科學專案，對該高中組別而言是一項具挑戰性的任務。"},{"w":"track","p":"n. / v.","d":"a path or rough road; railway rails; to follow movement","c":"軌道；跑道；行蹤；追蹤","s":"Meteorologists use modern satellites to track the exact path of the powerful tropical typhoon approaching Taiwan.","t":"氣象學家利用現代人造衛星來追蹤逼近台灣的強烈熱帶颱風的確切路徑（軌跡）。"},{"w":"willing","p":"adj.","d":"ready, eager, or prepared to do something without complaining","c":"樂意的；情願的","s":"Many kindhearted community volunteers were willing to help rebuild homes damaged by the mountain earthquake.","t":"許多熱心的社區志願者樂意協助重建被山區地震損毀的家園。"}]},{"unit":100,"theme":"Intellectual Curiosity, Reflection, Ethics, Media Promotion & Interpersonal Contact","cards":[{"w":"wonder","p":"v. / n.","d":"to want to know something; a feeling of great surprise and admiration","c":"納悶；想知道；奇蹟","s":"Sitting under the starry night sky, the young boy began to wonder how many distant galaxies exist.","t":"坐在繁星點點的夜空下，小男孩開始納悶想知道究竟存在著多少遙遠星系。"},{"w":"actually","p":"adv.","d":"in fact or really, especially when stating the truth","c":"實際上；事實上","s":"People assumed the two rivals were unfriendly, but they were actually close childhood friends.","t":"人們以為這兩位競爭對手關係不睦，但事實上他們是親密的兒時玩伴。"},{"w":"admire","p":"v.","d":"to respect or approve of someone or their behavior","c":"欽佩；讚賞","s":"Students around the world deeply admire Mother Teresa for her lifelong selfless dedication to the poor.","t":"全世界的學生都深深欽佩德蕾莎修女一生對窮人的無私奉獻。"},{"w":"basic","p":"adj.","d":"forming the foundation or most important part; simple","c":"基礎的；基本的","s":"Mastering basic grammar rules and everyday vocabulary is the first essential step in learning English.","t":"掌握基礎文法規則與日常單字是學習英語的第一個重要步驟。"},{"w":"admit","p":"v.","d":"to agree that something is true, especially unwillingly","c":"承認；准許進入","s":"The honest student had the moral courage to admit his mistake after accidentally breaking the beaker.","t":"那位誠實的學生在不小心打碎燒杯後，有道德勇氣承認自己的錯誤。"},{"w":"adopt","p":"v.","d":"to take someone else's child as one's own; to accept a new method or policy","c":"收養；採納；採用","s":"The city government decided to adopt a modern green transportation policy to reduce urban smog.","t":"市政府決定採納一項現代綠色交通政策，以減少城市煙霧。"},{"w":"advertisement","p":"n.","d":"a public promotion of a product or service; an ad","c":"廣告；宣傳","s":"The local bookstore placed a creative advertisement in the weekend newspaper to promote its annual book sale.","t":"那家在地書店在週末報紙上刊登了一則有創意的廣告，以宣傳其年度書展大特賣。"},{"w":"available","p":"adj.","d":"ready to be used, bought, or found; not busy","c":"可取得的；可買到的；有空的","s":"Are you available this Saturday afternoon to meet at the quiet cafe and review our final presentation slides?","t":"你這個星期六下午有空在安靜的咖啡館碰面，並檢視我們期末簡報的投影片嗎？"},{"w":"certain","p":"adj.","d":"having no doubt or knowing for sure; particular","c":"確定的；確信的；某個","s":"The lead detective was completely certain that the fingerprint on the broken glass belonged to the suspect.","t":"主任偵探完全確定碎玻璃上的指紋屬於該名嫌犯。"},{"w":"contact","p":"v. / n.","d":"to communicate with someone by phone, email, or letter; communication","c":"聯絡；聯繫","s":"If you have any further questions regarding the job interview, please contact our human resources department.","t":"如果您對工作面試有任何進一步的問題，請聯絡我們的人力資源部門。"}]}];
